<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LEV" style="id">Nyamwezi</book>
  <para style="toc3">Law</para>
  <para style="toc2">V'alawi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ki'tabu cha Magambo ga V'alawi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Magambo ga V'alawi</para>
  <para style="imt">Mihayo zya mbele</para>
  <para style="ip">Ki'tabu cha Magambo ga V'alawi ki'kumingile nhama i'zyo v'apiwa V'aizilaeli na Mulungu ku'v'i'ti'la ku'mwa Mose. Nhama zyeni'zi zili'lagi'la ki'fumi'zye cha vitaambo na kalu'mbi'lo. Hangi' nhama zyeni'zi zili'lagi'la ki'v'ezezye na ki'ti'le cha kwisenga mugati' na Ihema Isondo. V'alawi v'ali' v'antu' av'o v'av'age igongo isogolwa lyamwa Mulungu i'lo li'li' na muli'mo gwa ku'londola mili'mo zya ki'hozya na muli'mo gwa wangali'zi wa ihema. Ku'londana na mahembeko, v'asomi v'a Bibiliya v'ali'sani'zya ku'v'a ki'tabu cha Magambo ga V'alawi, haki'mo na vitabu vingi' vine vya Tolati (Mbu'ki', Ku'fuma, Lu'v'alo, Mwizu' gwa Nhama), vyatonwa na mufumbu'zi Mose. Nhana yeni'yi' yi'li'hwekeziwa hangi' na wu'tone wa ki'tabu cheni'ki'li', ku'nguno ki'tabu cha V'alawi ki'lamulile ku' ku'yomba ati', “Gu'ku' Mulungu wamwitanaga Mose, na ku'yomba nawe ku'fuma mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya,” (V'alawi 1:1). V'angi' v'ali'sani'zya ku'v'a hamo ki'tabu cheni'chi' chatonwa ku'fuma ku' wu'kumingwe wa wu'tonwe hekeheke wa kale ku' itungo lya myaka 500 na 600 K.K. (Aho akaali' ku'v'yalwa Kilisito), aho V'aizilaeli v'av'age ku' wu'samiwa ku' Babuloni.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha nnandyo ya ki'tabu cha V'alawi, ku'li'soma i'vyo yi'li' ku'nguno ya mikoli hekeheke zya kalu'mbi'lo na vitaambo i'vyo Mulungu ndi' walagi'li'zya vifumiwe na v'ahozya. Vili'ho vitaambo vingi' vyafumiv'agwe ku'nguno ya ndi'pi zya wu'kenagu'zi wa v'antu'. Vitaambo vingi' vyafumiv'agwe ku'londana na wu'togwe wav'o ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wav'o. Ki'la itungo, lyav'age igambo lya kapanga muno ku' muntu' u'yo ali'fumya kalu'mbi'lo kasoga ku'londana na i'vyo akowolile, ako kagelani'lile na kali' wu'du'hu' wu'lema ninga hado. Yi'li' nhana ku'v'a ki'v'ezezye cheni'chi' chalagi'lage wu'sondo na nhana yamwa Mulungu. Ku' lwandi' lwa ku' mpelo lwa ki'tabu cheni'chi', ki'li'welezezya V'aizilaeli haki'mo na v'ahozya i'vyo v'asigali'lage na wu'soso ninga kwisosohya aho yav'age u'lu' higela mav'i. Muhayo muhanya gwa ki'tabu cheni'chi' yi'li' i'vi Mulungu ali' musondo na ku'zilonda nhama i'zyo zili' mu ki'tabu cheni'chi', V'aizilaeli v'ali' v'alakowole kwikala mugati' na wu'v'aho wa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mihayo ku' wu'guhi'</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Ifungu lya 1 mpaka lya 7 li'li'fumya milagi' na ki'fumi'zye cha vitaambo na kalu'mbi'lo hekeheke.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Ifungu lya 8 mpaka lya 10 li'li'welezezya Aloni na v'ana v'akwe i'vyo v'asogolwa na ku'v'eziwa v'ahozya.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Ifungu lya 11 mpaka 16 li'li'welezezya milagi' i'zyo zili' ku'nguno ya viliwa i'vyo vili' visoso na i'vyo vili' zoma, haki'mo na malwile.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Ifungu lya 17 mpaka lya 27 li'li'fumbu'la milagi' zingi' i'zyo zili' ku'nguno ya magambo ga nhama zya ki'lyi'le, myanya, nsembo nsoga, na myaka zya lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho u'lo lu'li' Sabato.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LEV 1" />
  <para style="s">Ki'taambo cha ku'zigya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 1:1" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamwitanaga Mose, na ku'yomba nawe ku'fuma mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. Wamuwi'laga ati', <verse eid="LEV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 1:2" />“U'v'awi'le V'aizilaeli ati', ‘Ki'la muntu' mugati' na inywe u'yo alav'e ali'leta kalu'mbi'lo ka ndimu ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, yi'lamudime ku'leta ng'ombe, nkolo ninga mbu'li.<verse eid="LEV 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 1:3" />“ ‘U'lu' kalu'mbi'lo kenako ka ki'taambo cha ku'zigya kali' ka ng'ombe, alafumye nzagamba i'yo yi'li' wu'du'hu' wu'lema. Alayi'lete ha wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, ki'gele yi'zumiwe ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 1:4" />Hangi' alatu'u'le mukono gwakwe ha igu'lya na mutwe gwa ng'ombe ya ki'taambo cha ku'zigya, nacho ki'lazumiwe ku' ku'muv'ezezya wu'swanano muntu' mwenu'yo. <verse eid="LEV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 1:5" />Nawe alayi'si'nze ng'ombe yeni'yo ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Hangi' v'ana v'amwa Aloni v'a ki'gosya, av'o v'ahozya, v'alagalete magazi na ku'li'nyanyagi'la ihozezyo ku' ki'la lwandi', i'lo li'li' bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. <verse eid="LEV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 1:6" />Hangi' alayi'v'age yeni'yo ng'ombe ya ki'taambo, na ku'yi'putagu'zya mamonke mamonke. <verse eid="LEV 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 1:7" />V'ana v'a muhozya Aloni v'alapembe moto ha igu'lya na ihozezyo, na ku'hela nkwi ha igu'lya na moto gwenu'go. <verse eid="LEV 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 1:8" />Hangi' v'ahozya v'enav'o v'alahele ago mamonke, haki'mo na mutwe na maguta, ga yeni'yo ng'ombe ha igu'lya na nkwi i'zyo zili'v'aka ha igu'lya na ihozezyo. <verse eid="LEV 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 1:9" />Ali'vi wu'la wayo, na magu'lu' gayo, muntu' mwenu'yo alavikuse na minzi' mbela. Haho muhozya alavizigye vyose ha igu'lya na ihozezyo. Kenako kali' kalu'mbi'lo ka ki'taambo cha ku'zigya ku' moto, ako kali' na wu'motu wa ku'mutogezya Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="LEV 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 1:10" />“ ‘U'lu' ki'taambo cha ku'zigya ki'li' cha nkolo ninga mbu'li, alafumye ngosya i'yo yi'li' wu'du'hu' wu'lema. <verse eid="LEV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 1:11" />Nawe alayi'si'nzi'le bi'hi' na ihozezyo ku' lwandi' lwa sukuma ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, na v'ana v'amwa Aloni, av'o v'ahozya, v'alanyanyagi'le magazi gayo ku' ki'la lwandi' lwa ihozezyo. <verse eid="LEV 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 1:12" />Hangi' muntu' mwenu'yo alayi'putagu'zye mamonke mamonke, nawe muhozya alagahele haki'mo na mutwe na maguta gayo ha igu'lya na nkwi i'zyo zili'v'aka ha igu'lya na ihozezyo. <verse eid="LEV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 1:13" />Ali'vi wu'la wayo, na magu'lu' gayo na vikono vyayo, alavikuse ku' minzi', nawe muhozya alavizigye vyose ha igu'lya na ihozezyo. Kenako kali' kalu'mbi'lo ka ki'taambo cha ku'zigya ku' moto, ako kali' na wu'motu wa ku'mutogezya Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="LEV 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 1:14" />“ ‘U'lu' ki'taambo cha ku'zigya i'cho ki'li'fumiwa ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ki'v'e cha nnoni, alamufumi'zye ipu'u'la ninga ikune lya nkunda. <verse eid="LEV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 1:15" />Hangi' muhozya alayi'lete nnoni yeni'yo ha ihozezyo, nawe alayi'nyunsu'le nhingo. Haho mutwe gwayo alagu'zigye ha igu'lya na ihozezyo, na magazi gayo alagatonyekezye mu lu'v'azu lwa ihozezyo. <verse eid="LEV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 1:16" />Alali'sinie isolilo haki'mo na wu'chafu walyo, na ku'vitagi'la ku' lwandi' lwa ku' ki'ya bi'hi' na ihozezyo u'ko ku'li' na matunde. <verse eid="LEV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 1:17" />Hangi' alayi'dime manana na ku'yi'sasa, ali'vi ku'du' ize ayi'lekanie, nawe muhozya alayi'zigye ha igu'lya na nkwi i'zyo zili'v'aka ha igu'lya na ihozezyo. Kenako kali' kalu'mbi'lo ka ki'taambo cha ku'zigya ku' moto, ako kali' na wu'motu wa ku'mutogezya Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="LEV 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LEV 2" />
  <para style="s">Kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 2:1" />“ ‘Itungo i'lo muntu' alav'e ali'leta mbutoo ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, yi'ladime kalu'mbi'lo kakwe kav'e ka wu'fuma wu'nelezu. Alapu'ngu'li'le maguta ga muzeituni na ku'tu'u'la wu'vumba ha igu'lya yawo, <verse eid="LEV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 2:2" />nawe alawu'file ku' v'ahozya, v'ana v'amwa Aloni v'a ki'gosya. Muhozya alasole iganza li'mo lya wu'fuma wu'nelezu, u'wo wu'li' na maguta, haki'mo na wu'vumba wose, na ku'wu'zigya ha igu'lya na ihozezyo ki'gele wu'v'e ku'nguno ya ako kalu'mbi'lo kose. Kenako kali' kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ako kali' na wu'motu wa ku'mutogezya Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 2:3" />Lwandi' u'lo lu'lasigali'le lwa kalu'mbi'lo kenako lu'lav'e lwamwa Aloni na v'ana v'akwe. Lwenu'lo lu'li' lwandi' lu'sondo muno lwa kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya kamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="LEV 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 2:4" />“ ‘U'lu' muntu' ali'mufumi'zya Mulungu mbutoo zya wu'komelwe mu liko ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo, yi'ladime kav'e ka migate zya wu'fuma wu'nelezu u'wo wu'seleganiv'ilwe na maguta, ninga migate milelemazu i'zyo zikatumba na ziv'ililwe maguta. <verse eid="LEV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 2:5" />Hangi' kalu'mbi'lo ako alafumye u'lu' ka migate i'zyo zikomelilwe mu ki'kalango, kenako kalav'e ka wu'fuma wu'nelezu, u'wo wu'seleganiv'ilwe na maguta ga muzeituni, u'wo wu'li' wu'du'hu' itumbyo. <verse eid="LEV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 2:6" />Migate zyeni'zyo alazimegulanie na ku'pu'ngu'li'la maguta ha igu'lya yazyo. Kenaka kali' kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo. <verse eid="LEV 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 2:7" />U'lu' kalu'mbi'lo kakwe ka mbutoo kav'e ka ku'kalangwa mu ki'kalango, kalav'e ka wu'fuma wu'nelezu na maguta. <verse eid="LEV 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 2:8" />Alalete kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo i'zyo ziv'eziv'ilwe na vintu' vyeni'vyo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Alamupe muhozya na hu' mwene alavifile ha ihozezyo. <verse eid="LEV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 2:9" />Hangi' muhozya alasole mwenu'mo lwandi' lwa kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo kav'e ku'nguno ya kalu'mbi'lo kose, na ku'kazigya ha igu'lya na ihozezyo. Kenako kali' kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ako kali' na wu'motu wa ku'mutogezya Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 2:10" />Lwandi' lwa kalu'mbi'lo kenako u'lo lu'lasigali'le lu'lav'e lwamwa Aloni na v'ana v'akwe. Lwenu'lo lu'li' lwandi' lu'sondo muno lwa kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya kamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 2:11" />Ki'la kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo ako muntu' alalete ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, yi'lamudime aviv'ezye viv'e vili' wu'du'hu' itumbyo, ku'nguno yi'kakoov'iwa ku'zigya itumbyo ninga wu'ki' ku' kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya kamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 2:12" />Akowolile ku'vileta ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo ka ntomolwa ya viliwa. Ali'vi vikakowola ku'fumiwa ha igu'lya na ihozezyo ku'v'a wu'motu wa ku'togezya.<verse eid="LEV 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 2:13" />“ ‘Hangi' alalu'nge munyu mu mbutoo zyose zya kalu'mbi'lo kakwe. Ku'du' ize aleke ku'lu'nga munyu mu mbutoo ya kalu'mbi'lo kakwe. Alati'ti'le munyu mu kalu'mbi'lo kako kose ku'nguno gwenu'go gu'li' lu'manyi'lo lwa ilagano lyamwa Mulungu haki'mo na inywe.<verse eid="LEV 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 2:14" />“ ‘Itungo i'lo alav'e ali'mufumi'zya Gu'ku' Mulungu ntomolwa ya viliwa ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo, alafumye ngala zya mbutoo zyavyo zya wu'komelwe ha moto, i'zyo zihalalilwe. <verse eid="LEV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 2:15" />U'lati'ti'le maguta ga muzeituni na wu'vumba ha igu'lya yako. Kenako kali' kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo. <verse eid="LEV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 2:16" />Nawe muhozya alazigye lwandi' lwa mbutoo i'zyo zihalalilwe, haki'mo na lwandi' lwa maguta na wu'vumba wose, ku'v'a ku'nguno ya kalu'mbi'lo kose. Kenako kali' kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LEV 3" />
  <para style="s">Ki'taambo cha kwiswanania</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 3:1" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wendeleyaga ku'muwi'la ati', “U'lu' muntu' ali'fumya ki'taambo cha kwiswanania, nawe ali'fumya ng'ombe, yi'v'e ngosya ninga nki'ma, yi'lamudime afumye i'yo yi'li' wu'du'hu' wu'lema ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 3:2" />Alatu'u'le mukono gwakwe ha igu'lya na mutwe gwa ng'ombe yeni'yo, na ku'yi'si'nzi'la bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. Haho v'ahozya, v'ana v'amwa Aloni v'a ki'gosya, v'alali'nyanyagi'le ihozezyo magazi gayo ku' ki'la lwandi'. <verse eid="LEV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 3:3" />Ku'fuma ku' ki'taambo cheni'cho cha kwiswanania, alafumye kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu: lu'sasa lose na maguta ago gali' mu nda, ga ng'ombe yeni'yo, <verse eid="LEV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 3:4" />nfigo iv'i'li' haki'mo na maguta gazyo, ago gali' bi'hi' na muki'mbi'li', na lwandi' lu'soga lwa iti'ma. <verse eid="LEV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 3:5" />Hangi' v'ana v'amwa Aloni, v'alavizigye ha igu'lya na ihozezyo, haki'mo na ako kalu'mbi'lo ka ki'taambo cha ku'zigya i'cho ki'li' ha igu'lya na nkwi i'zyo zili'v'aka moto. Kenako kali' kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ako kali' na wu'motu wa ku'mutogezya Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="LEV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 3:6" />“Aho muntu' alav'e ali'mufumi'zya Gu'ku' Mulungu ki'taambo cha kwiswanania cha nkolo ninga mbu'li, yi'v'e ngosya ninga nki'ma, yi'lamudime afumye i'yo yi'li' wu'du'hu' wu'lema. <verse eid="LEV 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 3:7" />U'lu' muntu' afumye nkolo ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo kakwe, haho alakafumye ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, <verse eid="LEV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 3:8" />alatu'u'le mukono gwakwe ha igu'lya na mutwe gwayo, nawe alayi'si'nze ha mbele ya Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. Hangi' v'ana v'amwa Aloni v'alanyanyagi'le magazi gayo ku' ki'la lwandi' lwa ihozezyo. <verse eid="LEV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 3:9" />Hangi' ku'fuma ku' ki'taambo cheni'cho cha kwiswanania, alamufumi'zye Gu'ku' Mulungu maguta gayo ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya: muki'la gwayo u'go gu'puti'lilwe bi'hi' na muki'mbi'li' haki'mo na maguta gago, lu'sasa lose na maguta gose ago gali' mu nda, <verse eid="LEV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 3:10" />nfigo iv'i'li' na maguta gazyo ago gali' bi'hi' na muki'mbi'li' na lwandi' lu'soga lwa iti'ma. <verse eid="LEV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 3:11" />Nawe muhozya alavizigye ha igu'lya na ihozezyo ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo ka ki'liwa ka ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="LEV 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 3:12" />“U'lu' kalu'mbi'lo kakwe kav'e ka mbu'li, alakafumye ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, <verse eid="LEV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 3:13" />alatu'u'le mukono gwakwe ha igu'lya na mutwe gwayo, na ku'yi'si'nzi'la ha mbele ya Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. Hangi' v'ana v'amwa Aloni v'alanyanyagi'le magazi gayo ku' ki'la lwandi' lwa ihozezyo. <verse eid="LEV 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 3:14" />Ku'fuma ku' kalu'mbi'lo ako ali'fumya, alamufumi'zye Gu'ku' Mulungu kalu'mbi'lo kakwe ka ku'zigya: lu'sasa lose na maguta ago gali' mu nda, <verse eid="LEV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 3:15" />nfigo iv'i'li' na maguta gazyo ago gali' bi'hi' na muki'mbi'li' na lwandi' lu'soga lwa iti'ma. <verse eid="LEV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 3:16" />Nawe muhozya alavizigye ha igu'lya na ihozezyo ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo ka ki'liwa ka ku'zigya ako kali' na wu'motu wa ku'togezya. Maguta gose ga ki'taambo gali' gamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 3:17" />Muhayo gwenu'gu' gu'ku'v'a nhama ya nhananhana ku' wu'v'yalwa winywe u'wo wu'lalonde, mu wikalo winywe wose, ku'v'a mukasye mulye ninga hado maguta ga ndimu ninga nyama ya magazi.”<verse eid="LEV 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LEV 4" />
  <para style="s">Ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 4:1" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', <verse eid="LEV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 4:2" />“U'v'awi'le V'aizilaeli ati', ‘U'lu' muntu' av'ezye wu'kenagu'zi bila ku'loma, ku' ku'v'ezya ki'ntu' i'cho ki'giziv'ilwe na nhama yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, alav'ezye i'vi:<verse eid="LEV 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 4:3" />“ ‘Ku' lwandi' lwa muhozya muhanya, u'lu' ize av'ezye wu'kenagu'zi na ku'v'alengela v'antu' musango, yi'lamudime ku'mufumi'zya Gu'ku' Mulungu ng'ombe nzagamba i'yo yi'li' wu'du'hu' wu'lema, yi'v'e ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi. <verse eid="LEV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 4:4" />Alayi'lete ng'ombe yeni'yo bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Alatu'u'le mukono gwakwe ha igu'lya na mutwe gwa ng'ombe yeni'yo, na ku'yi'si'nzi'la henanho. <verse eid="LEV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 4:5" />Hangi' mwenu'yo muhozya muhanya alasole lwandi' lwa magazi ga ng'ombe yeni'yo, na kwingi'la nago mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. <verse eid="LEV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 4:6" />Aladobye lyala lyakwe mu magazi genago, na ku'nyanyagi'la ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu kali' mupungati', ha mbele ya muki'ngo gwa mugati' gwa hantu' hasondo. <verse eid="LEV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 4:7" />Hangi' muhozya alasole lwandi' lwa magazi genago na ku'v'ila ku' mapembe ga ihozezyo lya ku'zuki'zya wu'bani wu'motu ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. Magazi ago galasigali'le alagite ha nsi'li'li' na ihozezyo lya ku'zigi'zya vitaambo, bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. <verse eid="LEV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 4:8" />Hangi' alagasinie maguta ga ng'ombe yeni'yo: lu'sasa lose, maguta ago gali' mu nda, <verse eid="LEV 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 4:9" />nfigo zyose iv'i'li' na maguta gazyo ago gali' bi'hi' na muki'mbi'li', na lwandi' lu'soga lwa iti'ma, <verse eid="LEV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 4:10" />ki'ti' i'vyo maguta gali'siniv'agwa ku'fuma ku' ng'ombe i'yo yi'li'fumiwa ki'taambo cha kwiswanania. Hangi' muhozya alavizigye ha igu'lya na ihozezyo lya ku'zigi'zya vitaambo. <verse eid="LEV 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 4:11" />Ali'vi ndi'li' ya ng'ombe yeni'yo, nyama zyayo zyose, mutwe, magu'lu' gayo, vikono vyayo, wu'la na wu'se wayo, <verse eid="LEV 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 4:12" />yaani ng'ombe ngima i'yo yi'li'sigala, alayi'file na ku'kayi'zigya ha ibala na nkambi' ha hantu' hasoso aho gali'witi'lagwa matunde, nawe alayi'time moto ha igu'lya na nkwi i'zyo zili' ha igu'lya na ituntu lya matunde.<verse eid="LEV 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 4:13" />“ ‘Ku' lwandi' lwa iv'ilingano lyose lya V'aizilaeli, u'lu' v'ize v'av'ezye wu'kenagu'zi bila ku'manya, ku' ku'v'ezya ki'ntu' i'cho ki'giziv'ilwe na nhama yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku'nguno ya igambo lyeni'lo v'alav'e na musango. <verse eid="LEV 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 4:14" />Aho v'alav'e v'amanya wu'kenagu'zi u'wo v'awu'v'ezyaga, haho iv'ilingano lyose yi'lav'adime ku'fumya ng'ombe nzagamba yi'v'e ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi na ku'yi'leta ha mbele ya Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. <verse eid="LEV 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 4:15" />V'anamala v'a iv'ilingano v'alatu'u'le makono gav'o ha igu'lya na mutwe gwa ng'ombe yeni'yo, hangi' v'alayi'si'nze ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 4:16" />Hangi' muhozya muhanya alasole lwandi' lwa magazi ga ng'ombe yeni'yo na kwingi'la nago mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. <verse eid="LEV 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 4:17" />Aladobye lyala lyakwe mu magazi genago na ku'nyanyagi'la ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu kali' mupungati', ha mbele ya muki'ngo gwa mugati'. <verse eid="LEV 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 4:18" />Hangi' muhozya alasole lwandi' lwa magazi genago na ku'v'ila ku' mapembe ga ihozezyo i'lo li'li' ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. Magazi ago galasigali'le alagite ha nsi'li'li' na ihozezyo lya ku'zigi'zya vitaambo, bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. <verse eid="LEV 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 4:19" />Maguta gose ga ng'ombe yeni'yo alagasinie na ku'gazigya ha igu'lya na ihozezyo, <verse eid="LEV 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 4:20" />nawe alayi'v'ezye ng'ombe yeni'yo ki'ti' i'vyo wayi'v'ezizye ng'ombe i'yo yi'ngi' ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi wakwe mweni'ki'li'. Ku' nzi'la yeni'yi' muhozya alav'av'ezezye v'antu' wu'swanano, nav'o v'alatondolwe. <verse eid="LEV 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 4:21" />Hangi' alayi'sole ng'ombe yeni'yo na alayi'file ha ibala na nkambi' na ku'yi'zigya ki'ti' i'yo yi'ngi'. Cheni'cho ki'li' ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi ku'nguno ya iv'ilingano.<verse eid="LEV 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 4:22" />“ ‘Ku' lwandi' lwa mutemi, u'lu' ize av'ezye wu'kenagu'zi bila ku'loma, ku' ku'v'ezya ki'ntu' i'cho ki'giziv'ilwe na nhama yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wakwe, mutemi mwenu'yo alav'e na musango. <verse eid="LEV 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 4:23" />Aho alav'e wawi'lwa wu'kenagu'zi wakwe, yi'lamudime ku'leta mbu'li ngulati' i'yo yi'li' wu'du'hu' wu'lema yi'v'e ki'taambo chakwe. <verse eid="LEV 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 4:24" />Alatu'u'le mukono gwakwe ha igu'lya na mutwe gwa mbu'li yeni'yo na ku'yi'si'nzi'la aho vili'si'nzi'lagwa vitaambo vya ku'zigya ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Cheni'cho ki'li' ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi. <verse eid="LEV 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 4:25" />Hangi' muhozya alasole magazi ga ki'taambo cheni'cho, aladobye ku' lyala lyakwe na ku'v'ila ku' mapembe ga ihozezyo lya ku'zigi'zya vitaambo. Magazi ago galasigali'le alagite ha nsi'li'li' na ihozezyo. <verse eid="LEV 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 4:26" />Alagazigye maguta gose ha igu'lya na ihozezyo, ki'ti' i'vyo ali'gazigyaga maguta ga vitaambo vya kwiswanania. Ku' nzi'la yeni'yo muhozya alamuv'ezezye wu'swanano mutemi mwenu'yo ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi wakwe, nawe alatondolwe.<verse eid="LEV 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 4:27" />“ ‘Ku' lwandi' lwa v'antu' v'angi', u'lu' muntu' yu'mo mugati' nav'o ize av'ezye wu'kenagu'zi bila ku'loma na av'ezye ki'ntu' i'cho ki'giziv'ilwe na nhama yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, muntu' mwenu'yo alav'e na musango. <verse eid="LEV 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 4:28" />Aho alav'e wawi'lwa wu'kenagu'zi wakwe, yi'lamudime ku'leta mbu'li nki'ma i'yo yi'li' wu'du'hu' wu'lema ku'v'a ki'taambo chakwe ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi u'wo wawu'v'ezizye. <verse eid="LEV 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 4:29" />Alatu'u'le mukono gwakwe ha igu'lya na mutwe gwa mbu'li yeni'yo ya ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi na ku'yi'si'nzi'la aho ha ku'zigi'zya vitaambo. <verse eid="LEV 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 4:30" />Hangi' muhozya alasole magazi ga ki'taambo cheni'cho, aladobye ku' lyala lyakwe na ku'v'ila ku' mapembe ga ihozezyo lya ku'zigi'zya vitaambo. Magazi ago galasigali'le alagite ha nsi'li'li' na ihozezyo. <verse eid="LEV 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 4:31" />Maguta gose ga mbu'li yeni'yo galasiniwe ki'ti' i'vyo gali'siniv'agwa maguta ga vitaambo vya kwiswanania, nawe muhozya alagazigye ha ihozezyo, gav'e wu'motu wa ku'mutogezya Gu'ku' Mulungu. Ku' nzi'la yeni'yo muhozya alamuv'ezezye wu'swanano muntu' mwenu'yo, nawe alatondolwe.<verse eid="LEV 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 4:32" />“ ‘Mbe muntu' mwenu'yo alete kadi'lana ka nkolo ku'v'a ki'taambo chakwe cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi, hohene alalete nki'ma i'yo yi'li' wu'du'hu' wu'lema. <verse eid="LEV 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 4:33" />Alatu'u'le mukono gwakwe ha igu'lya na mutwe gwa nkolo yeni'yo ya ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi, na ku'yi'si'nzi'la aho v'ali'si'nzi'laga ndimu zya vitaambo vya ku'zigya. <verse eid="LEV 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 4:34" />Hangi' muhozya alasole magazi ga ki'taambo cheni'cho, aladobye ku' lyala lyakwe na ku'v'ila ku' mapembe ga ihozezyo lya ku'zigi'zya vitaambo. Magazi ago galasigali'le alagite ha nsi'li'li' na ihozezyo. <verse eid="LEV 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 4:35" />Maguta gose galasiniwe, ki'ti' i'vyo gali'siniv'agwa maguta ga nkolo zya vitaambo vya kwiswanania, nawe muhozya alagazigye ha ihozezyo, ha igu'lya na kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Ku' nzi'la yeni'yo muhozya alamuv'ezezye wu'swanano ku' wu'kenagu'zi u'wo wawu'v'ezizye, nawe alatondolwe.<verse eid="LEV 4:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LEV 5" />
  <para style="s">Kalu'mbi'lo kangi' ka ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 5:1" />“ ‘U'lu' muntu' ninga yu'mo igwe lwito lwa ku'fumya wu'sangi'lwa ha iv'anza ku' igambo i'lo wali'wine ninga ku'ligwa, nawe akaane ku'yomba ki'ntu', hohene yi'lamudime ku'wu'somba wu'kenagu'zi wakwe.<verse eid="LEV 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 5:2" />“ ‘Ninga muntu' u'lu' akuumye ki'ntu' ki'zomalu'ku, gu'v'e mulambo gwa ndimu nzomalu'ku zya mu ipolu ninga mitugo, ninga mulambo gwa vitundwa vingi' vizomalu'ku vya ku'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi', ninga av'e akamanya, alapandi'ke zoma na alav'e na musango.<verse eid="LEV 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 5:3" />“ ‘Ninga muntu' u'lu' akuumye ki'ntu' ki'zomalu'ku i'cho ki'fumile ku' muntu'<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ku' ku'manya vintu' vyeni'vyo vizomalu'ku u'some V'alawi 12-15.</char></note>, ki'ntu' i'cho ki'kowolile ku'muv'ezya av'e na zoma, ninga av'e akamanya, alapandi'ke musango.<verse eid="LEV 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 5:4" />“ ‘Ninga muntu' u'lu' alahi'le ku'v'ezya igambo ninga li'mo bila kwiganika, li'v'e iv'i ninga isoga, ku' ku'lahi'la ku' nzi'la ninga yi'mo ki'ti' i'vyo v'antu' v'ali'v'ezyaga, ninga av'e akamanya, aho alav'e wamanya haho alapandi'ke musango.<verse eid="LEV 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 5:5" />“ ‘Hangi' muntu' mbe av'e na musango gwa igambo li'mo mugati' na genago, yi'lamudime ku'zumya wu'kenagu'zi wakwe u'wo wawu'v'ezizye, <verse eid="LEV 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 5:6" />na ku' masumule ga wu'kenagu'zi u'wo wav'ezizye yi'lamudime ku'leta ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu nkolo nki'ma ninga mbu'li nki'ma ku'v'a ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi. Nawe muhozya alamuv'ezezye wu'swanano ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi wakwe.<verse eid="LEV 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 5:7" />“ ‘Ali'vi muntu' mwenu'yo u'lu' akakowola ku'fumya nkolo ninga mbu'li, hohene alalete mapu'u'la av'i'li' ninga makune av'i'li' ga nkunda ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ku'v'a masumule ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi wakwe, li'mo ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi, na lya wu'v'i'li' ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'zigya. <verse eid="LEV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 5:8" />Alagalete ku'mwa muhozya, nawe muhozya alali'fumye li'mo mbela li'v'e ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi. Alali'vune nhingo bila ku'li'lekania mutwe gwalyo, <verse eid="LEV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 5:9" />nawe alasole lwandi' lwa magazi galyo na ku'ganyanyagi'la mu lu'v'azu lwa ihozezyo. Magazi ago galasigali'le alagatonyekezye ha nsi'li'li' na ihozezyo. Cheni'cho ki'li' ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi. <verse eid="LEV 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 5:10" />Hangi' alali'fumye i'lo lya wu'v'i'li' ku'v'a ki'taambo cha ku'zigya, ku'londana na ki'ti'le. Ku' nzi'la yeni'yo muhozya alamuv'ezezye muntu' mwenu'yo wu'swanano ku' wu'kenagu'zi u'wo wawu'v'ezizye, nawe alatondolwe.<verse eid="LEV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 5:11" />“ ‘U'lu' agayiwe mapu'u'la av'i'li' ninga makune ga nkunda av'i'li' ku'v'a ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi, hohene alalete wu'fuma wu'nelezu kilo yi'mo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Kilo yi'mo” ku' Ki'ebulania yi'li' lwandi' lwa iku'mi lwa efa.</char></note>. Ali'vi ku'du' ize awu'ti'ti'li'le maguta ninga wu'vumba, ku'nguno kali' kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi. <verse eid="LEV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 5:12" />Alalete wu'fuma wenu'wo ku' muhozya, nawe alasole iganza li'mo lya wu'fuma na ku'wu'zigya ha igu'lya na ihozezyo ki'gele wu'v'e ku'nguno ya ako kalu'mbi'lo kose, ha igu'lya ya kalu'mbi'lo kangi' ka ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Kenako kali' kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi. <verse eid="LEV 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 5:13" />Ku' nzi'la yeni'yo muhozya alamuv'ezezye muntu' mwenu'yo wu'swanano ku'nguno ya ku'v'ezya wu'kenagu'zi mugati' na magambo genago, nawe alatondolwe. Wu'fuma u'wo wu'lasigali'le wu'lav'e wa muhozya, ki'ti' i'vyo yi'li' ku' kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya musango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 5:14" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, <verse eid="LEV 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 5:15" />“Muntu' ninga yu'mo u'lu' ahu'v'e ku' ku'v'ezya wu'kenagu'zi bila ku'loma mugati' na vintu' visondo ku' ku'leka ku'mufumi'zya Gu'ku' Mulungu, yi'lamudime mwenu'yo muntu' alete ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ng'ondi i'yo yi'li' wu'du'hu' wu'lema ki'ti' masumule. Ev'e u'lapime mupango gwayo ku'londana na vipimo i'vyo vitu'u'lilwe ha hantu' hasondo. Cheni'cho ki'li' ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya musango. <verse eid="LEV 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 5:16" />Hangi' yi'li'mudima ali'pe ku' ago wapotilwe ku'gav'ezya ku' magambo masondo, na kongezya lwandi' lwa wu'tano lwa wu'gu'zi wacho, na ku'lu'fumya lose ku'mwa muhozya, nawe alamuv'ezezye wu'swanano ku' yeni'yo ng'ondi ku'v'a ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya musango, nawe alatondolwe.<verse eid="LEV 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 5:17" />“Muntu' u'lu' av'ezye wu'kenagu'zi ku' ku'v'ezya ki'ntu' i'cho ki'giziv'ilwe na nhama yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ninga av'e akamanya, aho alav'e wamanya yi'lamudime ku'wu'somba wu'kenagu'zi wakwe. <verse eid="LEV 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 5:18" />Alalete ku'mwa muhozya ng'ondi i'yo yi'li' wu'du'hu' wu'lema, yi'v'e na mupango gwa ku'gelani'la, ku'v'a ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya musango. Nawe muhozya alamuv'ezezye wu'swanano ku' wu'kenagu'zi u'wo wawu'v'ezizye bila ku'loma, nawe alatondolwe. <verse eid="LEV 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 5:19" />Cheni'cho ki'li' ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya musango. Nhana mweni'ki'li' ali' na musango ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.”<verse eid="LEV 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LEV 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 6:1" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', <verse eid="LEV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 6:2" />“U'lu' muntu' ninga yu'mo av'ezye wu'kenagu'zi na ku'mutala Gu'ku' Mulungu ku' ku'muyenga muntu' mwiye ku' igambo lya ku'tu'u'li'ziwa ninga lya wu'lindi'li'zi wakwe, ninga ku' ku'puzya, ninga ku' ku'mwiwonelezya mwiye, <verse eid="LEV 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 6:3" />ninga aku'ge ki'ntu' cha muntu' mwiye i'cho chatagi'kile nawe ayombe ati', akaki'wine, ninga alahi'le ku' wu'fi mugati' na wu'kenagu'zi ninga wu'mo u'wo v'antu' v'ali'wu'v'ezyaga, <verse eid="LEV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 6:4" />muntu' mwenu'yo sanga wav'ezizye wu'kenagu'zi na ku'v'a na musango. Ku'nguno yeni'yo yi'lamudime asu'v'ye i'cho wapandi'kile ku' ku'puzya, ninga ku' kwiwonelezya, ninga cha ku'tu'u'li'ziwa, ninga ki'ntu' i'cho chatagi'kile nawe waki'ku'gile, <verse eid="LEV 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 6:5" />ninga ki'ntu' ki'mo i'cho walahi'lile ku' wu'fi. Yi'lamudime ku'ki'su'v'ya cheni'cho na ki'v'e ki'gelani'lile na kongezya lwandi' lwa wu'tano lwa mupango gwacho. Vyose alamupe musav'a nsawo lu'siku' u'lo alalete ki'taambo chakwe cha ku'sini'zya musango. <verse eid="LEV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 6:6" />Hangi' yi'lamudime ku'muletela muhozya ng'ondi i'yo yi'li' wu'du'hu' wu'lema ku'v'a masumule, ki'gele amufumi'zye Gu'ku' Mulungu ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya musango. Mutugo gwenu'go gu'v'e na mupango gwa ku'gelani'la. <verse eid="LEV 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 6:7" />Ku' nzi'la yeni'yi' muhozya alav'ezye wu'swanano ku'nguno ya muntu' mwenu'yo ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, nawe alatondolwe wu'kenagu'zi u'wo wawu'v'ezizye.”<verse eid="LEV 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ki'taambo cha ku'zigya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 6:8" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, <verse eid="LEV 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 6:9" />“U'mupe Aloni na v'ana v'akwe v'a ki'gosya ilagi'li'zyo i'li', ‘I'yi' hu' nhama ku'nguno ya kalu'mbi'lo ka ki'taambo cha ku'zigya. Yi'li'dima kalu'mbi'lo ka ki'taambo cha ku'zigya kikale ha moto ha igu'lya na ihozezyo wu'ziku'pee mpaka ndiyu', na moto gu'lendeleye ku'v'aka ha igu'lya na ihozezyo. <verse eid="LEV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 6:10" />Hangi' muhozya alazwale vizwalo vyakwe vya katani vya mugati' na vya ha ibala, nawe alasole matunde ga ki'taambo cha ku'zigya ku'fuma ha ihozezyo na ku'gatu'u'la bi'hi' na ihozezyo. <verse eid="LEV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 6:11" />Hangi' alavizule vizwalo vyeni'vyo na ku'zwala vizwalo vingi', alagasole matunde na ku'gafila ha ibala na nkambi' hantu' hasoso. <verse eid="LEV 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 6:12" />Moto gwa ha ihozezyo yi'li'koov'iwa gwendeleye ku'v'aka ku' matungo gose, ku'du' gwize gu'zime. Ki'la ndiyu' muhozya alav'e ali'wongezya nkwi na ku'hela ki'taambo cha ku'zigya ha igu'lya na moto, na ku'zigya maguta ga ki'taambo cha kwiswanania ha igu'lya yalyo. <verse eid="LEV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 6:13" />Moto gu'lendeleye ku'v'aka ha igu'lya na ihozezyo ku' matungo gose, bila ku'zima.<verse eid="LEV 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 6:14" />“ ‘I'yi' hu' nhama ku'nguno ya kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo. Yi'li'v'adima v'ana v'amwa Aloni v'a ki'gosya v'alete kalu'mbi'lo kenako hamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ha mbele ya ihozezyo. <verse eid="LEV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 6:15" />Muhozya alasole iganza lya wu'fuma wu'nelezu wa kalu'mbi'lo kenako, haki'mo na lwandi' lwa maguta ga muzeituni, na wu'vumba wose u'wo wu'li' ha igu'lya na kalu'mbi'lo kenako, na alawu'zigye ha igu'lya na ihozezyo ku'v'a ku'nguno ya kalu'mbi'lo kose lwandi', wu'v'e wu'motu wa ku'mutogezya Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 6:16" />Wu'fuma u'wo wu'lasigali'le wu'laliwe na Aloni haki'mo na v'aane, ali'vi mugate gwa wu'fuma wenu'wo gu'laliwe bila ku'ti'ti'lwa itumbyo. V'alagu'lyi'le ha hantu' hasondo, ha lu'gu'tu' lwa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. <verse eid="LEV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 6:17" />Ku'du' wize wu'komelwe haki'mo na itumbyo. Nav'apile ku'v'a lwandi' lwav'o ku'fuma ku' kalu'mbi'lo kanne ka ku'zigya. Kenako kali' kalu'mbi'lo kasondo muno, ki'ti' i'vyo ki'li' ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi na cha ku'sini'zya musango. <verse eid="LEV 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 6:18" />Ki'la mugosya mugati' na wu'v'yalwa wamwa Aloni akowolile ku'lya. Lyeni'li' li'li' ifungu lyav'o lya nhananhana ku'fuma ku' kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku' wu'v'yalwa winywe wose. Ki'la muntu' u'yo alakakuumye yi'li'mudima av'e musondo.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 6:19" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', <verse eid="LEV 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 6:20" />“Ku'lamuli'la lu'siku' lwa ku'v'ilwa maguta kwamwa Aloni na v'ana v'akwe ku'nguno ya wu'hozya, yi'lav'adime ku'mufumi'zya Gu'ku' Mulungu kilo yi'mo ya wu'fuma wu'nelezu ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo ku' ki'la lu'siku'. Nusu ya wu'fuma wenu'wo alawu'fumye ndiyu' na nusu yi'ngi' mpi'ndi'. <verse eid="LEV 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 6:21" />Wu'fuma wenu'wo wu'laseleganiwe na maguta ga muzeituni na ku'komelwa mu ki'kalango, hangi' wu'laletwe ku'no wu'li' na mav'ale mav'ale na ku'mufumi'zya Gu'ku' Mulungu ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo, kav'e na wu'motu wa ku'mutogezya Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 6:22" />Ki'la muhozya u'yo alav'ilwe maguta na kwikali'la isumbi' lyamwa Aloni mugati' na wu'v'yalwa wakwe, hu' mwene alakegezye. Li'li' ifungu lya nhananhana ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Kalu'mbi'lo kose kalazigiwe. <verse eid="LEV 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 6:23" />Ki'la kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo ka muhozya kalazigiwe kose. Nhanayene kakasye kaliwe.”<verse eid="LEV 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 6:24" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', <verse eid="LEV 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 6:25" />“U'muwi'le Aloni na v'ana v'akwe v'a ki'gosya ati', ‘I'yi' hu' nhama ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi. Yi'li'koov'iwa cheni'cho ki'si'nzi'lwe ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu aho ki'taambo cha ku'zigya ki'li'si'nzi'lagwa. Cheni'cho ki'li' ki'sondo muno. <verse eid="LEV 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 6:26" />Muhozya u'yo alaki'egezye ki'taambo cheni'cho hu' mwene alaki'lye. Alaki'lyi'le ha hantu' hasondo, ha lu'gu'tu' lwa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. <verse eid="LEV 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 6:27" />Ki'la ki'ntu' i'cho ki'lakuumye nyama ya kalu'mbi'lo yi'li'koov'iwa ki'v'e ki'sondo, na u'lu' genago magazi ganyantu'ki'le ku' ki'zwalo ninga ki'mo, Yi'li'koov'iwa ku'ki'kanzi'la ha hantu' hasondo. <verse eid="LEV 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 6:28" />Nnungu' i'yo yi'latekele nyama yeni'yo yi'li'koov'iwa yi'v'elwe, ali'vi u'lu' yatekelagwa mu ki'seme cha shaba, ki'seme cheni'cho ki'lakwemwe na ku'ngu'lu'ziwa na minzi'. <verse eid="LEV 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 6:29" />Ki'la mugosya mugati' na mugana gwa muhozya hu' u'yo akowolile ku'lya nyama yeni'yo. Yi'li' nsondo muno. <verse eid="LEV 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 6:30" />Ali'vi magazi ga ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi u'lu' galetagwa mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya ki'gele ku'v'ezezya wu'swanano ha hantu' hasondo, ki'taambo cheni'cho ki'kasye ki'liwe. Sumbwa ki'lazigiwe.<verse eid="LEV 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LEV 7" />
  <para style="s">Ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya musango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 7:1" />“ ‘I'yi' hu' nhama ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya musango. Cheni'cho ki'li' ki'sondo muno. <verse eid="LEV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 7:2" />Yi'li'koov'iwa ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya musango ki'si'nzi'lwe aho ki'li'si'nzi'lagwa ki'taambo cha ku'zigya, na magazi gacho galanyanyagi'lwe ku' ki'la lwandi' lwa ihozezyo. <verse eid="LEV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 7:3" />Maguta gacho gose galafumiwe: maguta ga muki'la na lu'sasa lwacho ago gakumbi'lile lwandi' lwa mugati', <verse eid="LEV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 7:4" />nfigo iv'i'li' haki'mo na maguta gazyo ago gali' bi'hi' na muki'mbi'li' na lwandi' lu'soga lwa iti'ma. <verse eid="LEV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 7:5" />Muhozya alavizigye ha igu'lya na ihozezyo ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Cheni'cho ki'li' ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya musango. <verse eid="LEV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 7:6" />Ki'la mugosya mugati' na mugana gwa v'ahozya akowolile ku'lya ki'taambo cheni'cho, ali'vi ki'lalyi'lwe ha hantu' hasondo. Ki'li' ki'sondo muno. <verse eid="LEV 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 7:7" />Nhama yeni'yi' ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya musango yi'gelani'lile na i'yo ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi. Muhozya u'yo ali'v'ezya wu'swanano hu' mwene alaki'sole. <verse eid="LEV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 7:8" />Hangi' ninga ku' ki'taambo cha ku'zigya cha ki'la muntu' muhozya u'yo alaki'egezye, hu' mwene alayi'sole ndi'li' ya ndimu i'yo yafumiv'agwa. <verse eid="LEV 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 7:9" />Ki'la kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo ako kakomelilwe mu liko ninga ku'tekwa mu ifuli'la ninga mu ki'kalango, kose kalav'e ka muhozya u'yo ali'kegezya. <verse eid="LEV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 7:10" />Ki'la kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo ako kakakomelwa, kav'e kaseleganiv'ilwe na maguta ga muzeituni ninga kav'e kakaseleganiwa, kalav'e ka v'ana v'amwa Aloni, na v'ose v'alagawu'lwe ku' ku'gelani'la.<verse eid="LEV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ki'taambo cha kwiswanania</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 7:11" />“ ‘I'yi' hu' nhama ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha kwiswanania i'cho muntu' akowolile ku'mufumi'zya Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 7:12" />U'lu' muntu' ize afumye ki'taambo cha kwiswanania ku'nguno ya ku'mulu'mbi'la Mulungu, yi'lamudime aki'fumye haki'mo na migate zya mikoli zyeni'zi i'zyo zikatumba: migate zya wu'seleganiwe na maguta ga muzeituni, migate milelemazu zya wu'v'ilwe maguta, na migate zya wu'fuma wu'nelezu u'wo wu'seleganiv'ilwe na maguta. <verse eid="LEV 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 7:13" />Hangi' alalete kalu'mbi'lo ka migate i'zyo zili' na itumbyo, haki'mo na ki'taambo chakwe cha kwiswanania ku'nguno ya ku'lu'mba. <verse eid="LEV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 7:14" />Mugati' na migate zyeni'zyo, alamufumi'zye Gu'ku' Mulungu mugate gu'mo ku' ki'la mukoli. Migate zyeni'zyo zilav'e zya muhozya u'yo ali'nyanyagi'la magazi ga ki'taambo cha kwiswanania ha ihozezyo. <verse eid="LEV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 7:15" />Yi'li'koov'iwa nyama ya ki'taambo cha kwiswanania ku'nguno ya ku'lu'mba yi'liwe lu'siku' lwene lu'lo u'lo yi'li'fumiwa. Ku'du' ize alekele ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo mpaka ndiyu'.<verse eid="LEV 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 7:16" />“ ‘Ali'vi mbe ki'taambo chakwe ki'li' ku'nguno ya kalu'mbi'lo ka ki'lu'mbo ninga ka ku'togwa, ki'taambo cheni'cho ki'laliwe lu'siku' lwene lu'lo aho ki'li'fumiwa, sumbwa ki'ntu' i'cho ki'lasigali'le ki'kowolile ku'liwa wangalu'ke. <verse eid="LEV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 7:17" />Ali'vi nyama ninga yi'mo ya ki'taambo i'yo yi'lasigali'le mpaka lu'siku' lwa wu'datu' yi'lazigiwe mu moto. <verse eid="LEV 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 7:18" />Hangi' nyama ninga yi'mo ya ki'taambo cha kwiswanania u'lu' yi'liwe lu'siku' lwa wu'datu', Gu'ku' Mulungu akasye ayi'zumye. Yi'kasye yi'v'aziwe ku' muntu' u'yo wayi'fumyaga, ku'nguno yi'li' zoma. Muntu' u'yo alalye lwandi' lwayo ninga lu'mo yi'lamudime ku'wu'somba wu'kenagu'zi wakwe. <verse eid="LEV 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 7:19" />Nyama yeni'yo ya ki'taambo i'yo yi'lakuumye ki'ntu' ki'zomalu'ku ku'du' yize yi'liwe. Nyama yeni'yo yi'lazigiwe mu moto. V'ose av'o v'ali' v'asoso v'akowolile ku'lya nyama yi'ngi'. <verse eid="LEV 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 7:20" />Ali'vi muntu' ninga yu'mo u'yo ali' na zoma u'lu' ize alye nyama ninga yi'mo ya ki'taambo cha kwiswanania chamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, yi'lamudime muntu' mwenu'yo akomwe na iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli. <verse eid="LEV 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 7:21" />U'lu' muntu' ninga yu'mo akuumye ki'ntu' ki'zomalu'ku, wu'v'e wu'zomalu'ku wa muntu', ninga ndimu i'yo yi'li' zoma, ninga ki'ntu' ki'mo cha igayi'li'zyo i'cho ki'li' zoma, hangi' alye nyama ninga yi'mo ya ki'taambo cha kwiswanania chamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, yi'lamudime muntu' mwenu'yo akomwe na iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Igizyo lya ku'lya maguta na magazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 7:22" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', <verse eid="LEV 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 7:23" />“V'awi'le V'aizilaeli ati', ‘Ku'du' mulye maguta ga ndimu, gav'e ga ng'ombe, nkolo ninga mbu'li. <verse eid="LEV 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 7:24" />Maguta ga ndimu ya wifwi'le yeni'ki'li' ninga yatandagu'lilwe na ndimu ya mu ipolu gakowolile ku'tu'mama ku' muli'mo gu'ngi', ali'vi muzilo ku'du' mwize mugalye. <verse eid="LEV 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 7:25" />Muntu' u'yo alalye maguta ga ndimu i'yo yafumiv'agwa kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, yi'lamudime akomwe na iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli. <verse eid="LEV 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 7:26" />Ki'la aho mulakikale ku'du' mwize mulye nyama ya magazi ninga ya ki'ntu' ki'mo, yi'v'e ya nnoni ninga ya ndimu. <verse eid="LEV 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 7:27" />Muntu' ninga yu'mo u'lu' ize alye nyama ya magazi, yi'lamudime muntu' mwenu'yo akomwe na iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifungu lya V'ahozya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 7:28" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', <verse eid="LEV 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 7:29" />“U'v'awi'le V'aizilaeli ati', ‘Muntu' u'yo ali'leta ki'taambo cha kwiswanania ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, yi'lamudime afumye lwandi' lwacho ku'fuma ku' ki'taambo cheni'cho ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 7:30" />Alalete kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ku' makono gakwe mweni'ki'li'. Alalete maguta ga yeni'yo ndimu haki'mo na ki'dali, nawe alaki'wu'sye ki'v'e lu'manyi'lo lwa ku'mufumi'zya kalu'mbi'lo Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 7:31" />Muhozya alagazigye maguta gose ha igu'lya na ihozezyo, ali'vi ki'dali ki'lav'e chamwa Aloni na v'aane v'a ki'gosya. <verse eid="LEV 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 7:32" />Itango lya ndimu lya ku' mulyi'la lya ki'taambo cha kwiswanania mulamupe muhozya, <verse eid="LEV 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 7:33" />yaani mwana wamwa Aloni u'yo alav'e ali'wegezya magazi na maguta ga ki'taambo cha kwiswanania hu' mwene alapiwe itango lyeni'lo lya mulyi'la ku'v'a ifungu lyakwe. <verse eid="LEV 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 7:34" />Ku'fuma ku' ki'la ki'taambo cha kwiswanania cha V'aizilaeli, ene Mulungu nasolaga ki'dali i'cho chawu'siv'agwa haki'mo na i'lo itango i'lo lyafumiv'agwa, nanne nav'apaga v'ahozya, Aloni na v'aane ku'v'a ifungu lyav'o lya nhananhana ku'fuma ku' V'aizilaeli.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 7:35" />Lwenu'lu' hu' lwandi' lwa kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya kamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu u'lo lwakomwa ku'nguno yamwa Aloni na v'aane, ku'fuma lu'siku' u'lo ndi' v'ali'simi'kwa ku'nguno ya ku'mutu'mami'la Gu'ku' Mulungu ku' muli'mo gwa wu'hozya. <verse eid="LEV 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 7:36" />Lu'siku' u'lo ndi' v'ali'v'ilwa maguta, Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' walagi'li'zya ati', V'aizilaeli v'av'ape lyeni'li' ku'v'a ifungu lyav'o lya nhananhana ku' wu'v'yalwa wav'o u'wo wu'lalonde. <verse eid="LEV 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 7:37" />Zyeni'zyo hu' nhama zya ki'taambo cha ku'zigya, kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo, ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi, ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya musango, ki'taambo cha ku'simi'ki'la v'ahozya, na ki'taambo cha kwiswanania, <verse eid="LEV 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 7:38" />i'zyo Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' wamupa Mose ku' igu'lya na lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai, lu'siku' u'lo ndi' wav'alagi'li'zya V'aizilaeli v'alete kalu'mbi'lo kav'o ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku' ibalangu' lya Sinai.<verse eid="LEV 7:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LEV 8" />
  <para style="s">Ku'sondohiwa kwamwa Aloni na v'ana v'akwe v'a ki'gosya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 29:1-37">Ku'fuma 29:1-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 8:1" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', <verse eid="LEV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 8:2" />“U'v'asole Aloni na v'ana v'akwe v'a ki'gosya, u'lete na vizwalo vyav'o visondo, maguta ga ku'v'ila, nzagamba ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi, ng'ondi iv'i'li' na ki'sege cha migate i'zyo zikatumba. <verse eid="LEV 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 8:3" />Hangi' u'li'kuminge iv'ilingano lyose bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya.” <verse eid="LEV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 8:4" />Mose wav'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye. Iv'ilingano lyose likumingaga ha wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya.<verse eid="LEV 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 8:5" />Mose wali'wi'laga iv'ilingano, “I'li' hu' igambo i'lo Gu'ku' Mulungu walagi'li'zizye li'v'ezyeke.” <verse eid="LEV 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 8:6" />Hohene Mose wav'aletaga Aloni na v'aane ha mbele, na ku'v'akusa na minzi'. <verse eid="LEV 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 8:7" />Wamuzwi'kaga Aloni nhanzo na ku'mutunga mukwato mu muki'mbi'li', na wamuzwi'kaga ijoho haki'mo na ki'zibao ha igu'lya yalyo na ku'ki'tunga mu muki'mbi'li' ku' mukwato gwacho gwa wu'lembwe. <verse eid="LEV 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 8:8" />Hangi' watu'u'laga kamufuko ka ha ki'kuv'a ha igu'lya yacho. Mugati' na kamufuko kenako watu'u'laga Ulimu na Sumimu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:8</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mihayo Ulimu na Sumimu yi'li'wigelisya ku'v'a gav'age mawe masondo ago muhozya wagatu'u'lage mu kamufuko. Ku' itungo li'mo v'ahozya v'agatu'mi'lage ku'manya wu'yangu' wamwa Mulungu.</char></note>. <verse eid="LEV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 8:9" />Wamuzwi'kaga Aloni isimangi'la ku' mutwe, na ku'tu'u'la ndezi ya zahabu, yaani ndezi nsondo, ku' lwandi' lwa ku' mbele lwa isimangi'la, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye.<verse eid="LEV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 8:10" />Haho Mose wasolaga maguta masondo na ku'li'v'ila Ihema Isondo haki'mo na ki'la ki'ntu' i'cho ki'li' mugati' yalyo, nawe wavisondohyaga. <verse eid="LEV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 8:11" />Wanyanyagi'laga maguta ha igu'lya na ihozezyo kali' mupungati'. Hangi' wali'v'ilaga ihozezyo maguta na vilwani'lo vyalyo vyose haki'mo na ikalaye na kikali'lo chalyo, ki'gele avisondohye. <verse eid="LEV 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 8:12" />Hangi' wamupu'ngu'li'laga lwandi' lwa maguta genago Aloni ku' mutwe na ku'muv'ila, ki'gele amusondohye. <verse eid="LEV 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 8:13" />Hangi' wav'aletaga v'ana v'amwa Aloni v'a ki'gosya ha mbele, wav'azwi'kaga nhanzo, na wav'atungaga mikwato haki'mo na masimangi'la, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye.<verse eid="LEV 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 8:14" />Hangi' Mose wayi'fumyaga ng'ombe nzagamba ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi, nav'o Aloni na v'ana v'akwe v'atu'u'laga makono gav'o ha igu'lya na mutwe gwayo. <verse eid="LEV 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 8:15" />Haho Mose wayi'si'nzaga yeni'yo ng'ombe na ku'sola lwandi' lwa magazi gayo, hangi' ku' ku'tu'mi'la lyala lyakwe wav'ilaga magazi ku' mapembe ga ihozezyo ki'gele ali'sosohye ihozezyo. Magazi ago gasigali'laga wagiti'laga ha nsi'li'li' na ihozezyo. Ku' nzi'la yeni'yo wali'sondohyaga ihozezyo ki'gele li'zumi'ziwe ku'v'ezezya wu'swanano. <verse eid="LEV 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 8:16" />Hangi' wasolaga lu'sasa lose, lwandi' lu'soga lwa iti'ma haki'mo na nfigo zyose iv'i'li' na maguta gazyo na wazizigyaga ha igu'lya na ihozezyo. <verse eid="LEV 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 8:17" />Ali'vi ng'ombe yeni'ki'li', nyama yayo, ndi'li' yayo, haki'mo na wu'se wayo, wavizigyaga ha ibala na nkambi', ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye.<verse eid="LEV 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 8:18" />Hangi' Mose wayi'letaga ng'ondi ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'zigya, nawe Aloni haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe v'atu'u'laga makono gav'o ha igu'lya na mutwe gwayo. <verse eid="LEV 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 8:19" />Haho Mose wayi'si'nzaga ng'ondi yeni'yo na ku'nyanyagi'la magazi gayo ki'la lwandi' lwa ihozezyo. <verse eid="LEV 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 8:20" />Wayi'tambagu'zyaga ng'ondi yeni'yo mamonke mamonke na ku'gazigya haki'mo na mutwe na maguta gayo. <verse eid="LEV 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 8:21" />Hangi' wakusaga wu'la wayo, magu'lu' gayo na vikono vyayo ku' minzi', na ku'yi'zigya yeni'yo ng'ondi ha igu'lya na ihozezyo, ku'v'a ki'taambo cha ku'zigya, i'cho ki'li' na wu'motu wa ku'togezya. Kenako kali' kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye.<verse eid="LEV 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 8:22" />Hangi' Mose waletaga ng'ondi yi'ngi', yeni'yo hu' yi'li' ya ku'v'asimi'ki'la, nawe Aloni haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe v'atu'u'laga makono gav'o ha igu'lya na mutwe gwayo. <verse eid="LEV 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 8:23" />Haho Mose wayi'si'nzaga yeni'yo ng'ondi, na wasolaga lwandi' lwa magazi gayo na ku'gav'ila ku' nsoto ya itwi lya mulyi'la lyamwa Aloni, na ku' li'nkumwa lya mukono gwa mulyi'la na ku' li'nkumwa lya mugu'lu' gwa mulyi'la. <verse eid="LEV 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 8:24" />Hangi' wav'aletaga v'ana v'amwa Aloni ha mbele, na ku'v'av'ila magazi ku' nsoto zya matwi gav'o ga mulyi'la, na ku' mankumwa ga makono ga mulyi'la, na ku' mankumwa ga magu'lu' gav'o ga mulyi'la. Hangi' magazi ago gasigali'laga wanyanyagi'laga ki'la lwandi' lwa ihozezyo. <verse eid="LEV 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 8:25" />Hangi' wasolaga maguta gayo: muki'la gwayo haki'mo na maguta gago, lu'sasa, lwandi' lu'soga lwa iti'ma, nfigo iv'i'li' na maguta gazyo, haki'mo na itango lya ku' mulyi'la.<verse eid="LEV 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 8:26" />Hangi' ku'fuma ku' ki'sege cha migate i'zyo zikatumba i'cho chav'age ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, wasolaga mugate gu'mo u'go gu'kaseleganiwa maguta, na mugate gu'mo gwa wu'seleganiwe na maguta ga muzeituni, na mugate mulelemazu gu'mo. Wavitu'u'laga vyeni'vi vyose ha igu'lya na maguta ga ndimu, na ha igu'lya na i'lo itango lya mulyi'la. <verse eid="LEV 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 8:27" />Mose wavitu'u'laga i'vi vyose mu makono gamwa Aloni haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe, na ku'v'av'ezya v'aviwu'sye ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ku'v'a lu'manyi'lo lwa ku'fumya kalu'mbi'lo. <verse eid="LEV 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 8:28" />Haho Mose wavisolaga ku'fuma mu makono gav'o na ku'vizigya ha igu'lya na ihozezyo haki'mo na ki'taambo cha ku'zigya. Kenako kali' kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'simi'ki'la v'ahozya, ka wu'motu wa ku'togezya, ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 8:29" />Hangi' wasolaga ki'dali i'cho ki'li' ifungu lyakwe ku'fuma ku' i'yo ng'ondi ya ku'v'asimi'ki'la, na ku'ki'wu'sya ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ku'v'a lu'manyi'lo lwa ku'fumya kalu'mbi'lo, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye. <verse eid="LEV 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 8:30" />Mose wasolaga lwandi' lwa maguta ga ku'v'ila, na lwandi' lwa magazi ku'fuma ku' ihozezyo, na ku'ganyanyagi'la ku'mwa Aloni na vizwalo vyakwe, na ku' v'ana v'akwe na vizwalo vyav'o. I'vi hu' vyene wamusondohyaga Aloni na vizwalo vyakwe, haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe na vizwalo vyav'o.<verse eid="LEV 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 8:31" />Hangi' Mose wav'awi'laga Aloni na v'ana v'akwe ati', “Nyama yeni'yo muyi'tekele bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, na muyi'lyi'le henanho haki'mo na migate ku'fuma mu ki'sege cha kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'simi'ki'la. Muv'ezye vyeni'vyo ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu walagi'li'zya ku'v'a lwandi' lwenu'lo Aloni na v'ana v'akwe v'alalye. <verse eid="LEV 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 8:32" />Hangi' nyama na migate i'zyo zilasigali'le mulazizigye. <verse eid="LEV 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 8:33" />Ku'du' mwize muhafume ha wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati', mpaka nsiku' zinywe zya ku'simi'kwa aho zilav'e zyagelani'la, ku'nguno itungo linywe lya ku'simi'kwa li'lav'e nsiku' mupungati'. <verse eid="LEV 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 8:34" />I'lo lyav'eziv'agwa walelo ndi' lyalagi'li'ziwa na Gu'ku' Mulungu ki'gele ku'v'ezya wu'swanano ku'nguno yinywe. <verse eid="LEV 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 8:35" />Yi'li'mudima kwikala bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya wu'ziku' na lyu'v'a ku' nsiku' mupungati', na ku'li'doonoka i'lo Gu'ku' Mulungu walagi'li'zya, ki'gele muleke ku'fwa, ku'nguno lyeni'lo hu' i'lo nalagi'li'ziwa.” <verse eid="LEV 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 8:36" />Hohene Aloni na v'ana v'akwe v'av'ezyaga ki'la ki'ntu' i'cho Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' walagi'li'zya ku'v'i'ti'la ku'mwa Mose.<verse eid="LEV 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LEV 9" />
  <para style="s">Aloni ali'lamula wu'hozya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 9:1" />Mu lu'siku' lwa munane, Mose wav'itanaga Aloni na v'ana v'akwe v'a ki'gosya, haki'mo na v'anamala v'a Izilaeli. <verse eid="LEV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 9:2" />Wamuwi'laga Aloni, “U'sole ndama ngosya ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi, na ng'ondi ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'zigya, zyose iv'i'li' ziv'e zili' wu'du'hu' wu'lema, nazyo u'zilete ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 9:3" />Hangi' u'v'awi'le V'aizilaeli ati', ‘Musole mbu'li ngulati' ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi, na ndama ngosya na kadi'lana ka nkolo, zyose iv'i'li' ziv'e zya musimo gwa mwaka gu'mo, na ziv'e zili' wu'du'hu' wu'lema, ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'zigya. <verse eid="LEV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 9:4" />Hangi' musole ng'ombe na ng'ondi ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha kwiswanania, ki'gele mufumye ki'taambo ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, haki'mo na kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo ako kaseleganiv'ilwe na maguta ga muzeituni. Ku'nguno walelo Gu'ku' Mulungu aku'mwifumi'i'la.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 9:5" />Nav'o v'aviletaga vyeni'vyo vintu' i'vyo Mose wav'alagi'li'zyaga ha mbele ya Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, nalyo iv'ilingano lyose likumingaga na kwi'ma ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 9:6" />Haho Mose wayombaga ati', “I'li' hu' i'lo Gu'ku' Mulungu walagi'li'zizye muli'v'ezye, ki'gele mulu'wone lu'kumo lwakwe.” <verse eid="LEV 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 9:7" />Henanho Mose wamuwi'laga Aloni ati', “Yaga ku' ihozezyo, u'kafumi'zye henanho ki'taambo chako cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi na ki'taambo cha ku'zigya, na u'v'ezye wu'swanano ku'nguno yako na ku'nguno ya v'antu' v'a Izilaeli. Hangi' u'fumi'zye henanho vitaambo i'vyo vyaletagwa na v'antu' ku'nguno ya ku'v'av'ezezya wu'swanano, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu walagi'li'zizye.”<verse eid="LEV 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 9:8" />Hohene Aloni wizaga ha ihozezyo na ku'yi'si'nza i'yo ndama ku'v'a ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi ku'nguno yakwe. <verse eid="LEV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 9:9" />Hangi' v'ana v'akwe v'amuletelaga magazi gayo, nawe wadobyaga lyala lyakwe mu magazi na ku'gav'ila ku' mapembe ga ihozezyo, na magazi ago gasigali'laga wagiti'laga ha nsi'li'li' na ihozezyo. <verse eid="LEV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 9:10" />Ali'vi lu'sasa, nfigo na lwandi' lu'soga lwa iti'ma lwa cheni'cho ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi, wavizigyaga ha igu'lya na ihozezyo ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye Mose. <verse eid="LEV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 9:11" />Sumbwa nyama haki'mo na ndi'li', wavizigyaga ha ibala na nkambi'.<verse eid="LEV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 9:12" />Hangi' Aloni wasi'nzaga ki'taambo cha ku'zigya. V'ana v'akwe v'amuletelaga magazi gayo, nawe waganyanyagi'laga ki'la lwandi' lwa ihozezyo. <verse eid="LEV 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 9:13" />V'amuletelaga ki'taambo cha ku'zigya mamonke mamonke, haki'mo na mutwe, nawe wavizigyaga ha igu'lya na ihozezyo. <verse eid="LEV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 9:14" />Wawu'kusaga wu'la haki'mo na magu'lu', na wavizigyaga ha igu'lya na ki'taambo cha ku'zigya, ha igu'lya na ihozezyo.<verse eid="LEV 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 9:15" />Hangi' Aloni waletaga vitaambo i'vyo vyaletagwa na v'antu'. Wasolaga i'yo mbu'li ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi, wayi'si'nzaga na ku'yi'fumya, ki'ti' i'vyo wav'ezyaga ku' i'yo ya mbele. <verse eid="LEV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 9:16" />Aloni waki'letaga ki'taambo cha ku'zigya na ku'ki'fumya ku'londana na ki'ti'le. <verse eid="LEV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 9:17" />Hangi' waletaga kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo, wasolaga iganza li'mo lya wu'fuma na ku'wu'zigya ha igu'lya na ihozezyo, haki'mo na ki'taambo cha ku'zigya cha ki'la ndiyu'.<verse eid="LEV 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 9:18" />Hangi' Aloni wasi'nzaga ng'ombe na ng'ondi ku'v'a ki'taambo cha kwiswanania ku'nguno ya v'antu'. V'ana v'akwe v'amupaga magazi gazyo, nawe waganyanyagi'laga ku' ki'la lwandi' lwa ihozezyo. <verse eid="LEV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 9:19" />Ali'vi maguta ga i'yo ng'ombe na ng'ondi, muki'la na maguta gago, lu'sasa, nfigo na lwandi' lu'soga lwa iti'ma, <verse eid="LEV 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 9:20" />vyeni'vi vyose v'avitu'u'laga ha igu'lya na vidali, nawe Aloni wagazigyaga maguta ha igu'lya na ihozezyo. <verse eid="LEV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 9:21" />Aloni waviwu'syaga i'vyo vidali haki'mo na matango ga mulyi'la ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku'v'a lu'manyi'lo lwa kalu'mbi'lo, ki'ti' i'vyo Mose walagi'li'zizye.<verse eid="LEV 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 9:22" />Hangi' Aloni aho wamali'laga ku'fumya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi, ki'taambo cha ku'zigya, na ki'taambo cha kwiswanania, wawu'syaga makono gakwe ku' ku'v'alola v'antu' na ku'v'adosya, haho wasookaga ku'fuma ku' ihozezyo.<verse eid="LEV 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 9:23" />Hangi' Mose na Aloni v'ingi'laga mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. Aho v'afumaga ha ibala v'av'adosyaga v'antu', nalo lu'kumo lwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu lwav'ifumi'i'laga v'antu' v'ose. <verse eid="LEV 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 9:24" />Moto gwafumi'i'laga ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, gwaki'zigyaga ki'taambo cha ku'zigya, haki'mo na maguta ago gav'age ha igu'lya na ihozezyo. V'antu' v'ose aho v'awonaga igambo lyeni'li', v'abu'bu'zyaga ku' wu'togwe, v'asukambaga na ku'ku'v'i'i'la.<verse eid="LEV 9:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LEV 10" />
  <para style="s">Ku'fwa kwamwa Nadabu na Abihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 10:1" />Nadabu na Abihu, v'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Aloni, v'asolaga vitezo vyav'o na v'atu'u'laga moto mugati' yavyo na kongezya wu'bani, hangi' v'amufumi'zyaga Gu'ku' Mulungu moto u'go gu'kazumi'ziwa na gu'kagelani'la na ilagi'li'zyo lyamwa Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 10:2" />Hohene moto gwafumi'i'laga ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu na ku'v'azimangu'zya, nav'o v'afwaga ha mbele yakwe. <verse eid="LEV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 10:3" />Hangi' Mose wamuwi'laga Aloni ati', “Igambo lyeni'li' li'li'lagi'la nhana ya mihayo zyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ku' i'cho ndi' ali'yomba:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LEV 10:3">‘Ndasondohiwe ene mugati' na av'o v'ali'nyegela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LEV 10:3">nanne ndapandi'ke lu'kumo ha mbele ya v'antu' v'anne v'ose.’ ”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LEV 10:3">Hohene Aloni akayombile ki'ntu'.<verse eid="LEV 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 10:4" />Mose wav'itanaga Mishaeli na Elisafani, v'ana v'amwa Uzieli v'a ki'gosya, ise mudo lyamwa Aloni. Wav'awi'laga ati', “Izi hano, muzisinie milambo zya v'adu'gu' v'inywe ha mbele ya hantu' hasondo, muzifile ha ibala na nkambi'.” <verse eid="LEV 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 10:5" />Hohene v'izaga na ku'zisinia milambo, ku'no zikaali' zizwalile nhanzo zya ki'hozya, na v'azifilaga ha ibala na nkambi', ki'ti' i'vyo Mose walagi'li'zyaga. <verse eid="LEV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 10:6" />Haho Mose wamuwi'laga Aloni haki'mo na v'aane v'angi' v'a ki'gosya, Eleazali na Itamali, ati', “Ku'du' musalambanie nyele zinywe ninga ku'zemula vizwalo vinywe ku' ku'v'ali'la, ku'nguno mukwilengela lu'fu na Gu'ku' Mulungu aku'li'gayi'la iv'ilingano lyose. Ali'vi v'adu'gu' v'inywe, yaani iv'ilingano lyose lya Izilaeli, v'akowolile ku'v'ali'la v'antu' av'o Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'azimangu'zyaga ku' moto. <verse eid="LEV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 10:7" />Ku'du' mufume ha ibala na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, ki'gele muleke ku'fwa, ku'nguno maguta gamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ga ku'sondohya gali' ha igu'lya yinywe.” Haho Aloni na v'ana v'akwe v'av'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vyo Mose wayombaga.<verse eid="LEV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 10:8" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Aloni ati', <verse eid="LEV 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 10:9" />“Ev'e na v'ana v'ako v'a ki'gosya ku'du' mwize munywe ki'neneko ninga malwa itungo i'lo mulav'e muli'wingi'la mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, ki'gele muleke ku'fwa. I'yi' yi'ku'v'a nhama ya nhananhana ku' wu'v'yalwa u'wo wu'lalonde. <verse eid="LEV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 10:10" />Yi'li'mudima mulekanie mugati' na magambo masondo na ago gakav'ile masondo, mugati' na magambo masoso na ga zoma, <verse eid="LEV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 10:11" />na yi'li'mudima muv'ahembeke V'aizilaeli nhama zyose i'zyo Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' wav'apa ku'v'i'ti'la ku'mwa Mose.”<verse eid="LEV 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 10:12" />Mose wamuwi'laga Aloni haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe v'a ki'gosya av'o ndi' v'asigali'laga, Eleazali na Itamali, “Musole kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo ako kasigali'laga ku'fuma ku' kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, mukalyi'le aho bi'hi' na ihozezyo, na kav'e kav'eziv'agwa bila itumbyo, ku'nguno kali' kasondo muno. <verse eid="LEV 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 10:13" />Mulakalyi'le ha hantu' hasondo ku'nguno li'li' ifungu lyako na ifungu lya v'ana v'ako v'a ki'gosya lya kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku'nguno i'vi hu' i'vyo nalagi'li'ziwa.<verse eid="LEV 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 10:14" />“Ali'vi ki'dali i'cho chawu'siv'agwa na itango i'lo lyafumiv'agwa, inywe na v'ana v'inywe v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma mukowolile ku'lya, na mulavilyi'le ha hantu' hasoso. Vintu' vyeni'vyo mwapiv'ilwe inywe na v'ana v'inywe ku'v'a ifungu linywe lya vitaambo vya kwiswanania vya V'aizilaeli. <verse eid="LEV 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 10:15" />Itango i'lo lyafumiv'agwa na ki'dali i'cho chawu'siv'agwa v'alavilete haki'mo na kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ka maguta ga ndimu yeni'yo, ki'gele viwu'siwe ku'v'a lu'manyi'lo lwa kalu'mbi'lo ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Vyeni'vyo vilav'e vya ku' winywe haki'mo na v'ana v'inywe, ku'v'a ifungu linywe nhananhana ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu walagi'li'zizye.”<verse eid="LEV 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 10:16" />Hangi' Mose wayi'koov'aga muno i'yo mbu'li ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi, nawe wamanyaga ku'v'a kasinaga yakazigiwa! Haho wav'agayi'laga Eleazali na Itamali, v'ana v'amwa Aloni v'a ki'gosya av'o v'asigali'lile, na wav'awu'zyaga, <verse eid="LEV 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 10:17" />“Ku' ki' mukalyi'lile ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi ha lwandi' lwa hantu' hasondo? Ki'li' ki'sondo muno. Mwapiv'ilwe inywe ki'gele ku'sinia musango gwa iv'ilingano ku'nguno ya ku'v'av'ezezya wu'swanano ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 10:18" />Lingagi, magazi gayo gakaletilwe mugati' ya Hantu' Hasondo mu ihema. Nhana, yali' yi'li'koov'iwa muyi'lyi'le mbu'li yeni'yo ha lwandi' lwa hantu' hasondo lwa ihema ki'ti' i'vyo nalagi'li'zizye.”<verse eid="LEV 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 10:19" />Aloni wasu'v'yaga ku'mwa Mose ati', “Lingaga, walelo v'ana v'anne v'afumyaga ki'taambo chav'o cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi na ki'taambo chav'o cha ku'zigya ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ali'vi magambo ki'ti' genaga ganfumi'i'laga ene! Vihe, Gu'ku' Mulungu wali' aku'zumani'zya u'lu' mbe nali' nalyaga ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi walelo?” <verse eid="LEV 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 10:20" />Mose aho wigagwa genago, wazumani'zyaga.<verse eid="LEV 10:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LEV 11" />
  <para style="s">Ndimu zya zoma na nsoso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 14:3-21">Mwizu' 14:3-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 11:1" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'awi'laga Mose na Aloni ati', <verse eid="LEV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 11:2" />“V'awi'li V'aizilaeli ati', ‘Mugati' na ndimu zyose i'zyo zili' ha igu'lya na nsi', i'zi hu' zyene muku'v'a muli'lya. <verse eid="LEV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 11:3" />Ki'la ndimu i'yo yi'li' na vyu'ga vya wu'tandu'ke ku' magu'lu', na yi'li'bizu'ka, yeni'yo hu' yene mukowolile ku'lya. <verse eid="LEV 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 11:4" />Ninga vyeni'vyo, zili'ho ndimu i'zyo mukasye muv'e muli'lya mugati' na i'zyo zili'bizu'ka du' ninga i'zyo zili' na vyu'ga vya wu'tandu'ke du'. Ntwangawu'lende yi'li'bizu'ka ali'vi yi'li' wu'du'hu' vyu'ga. Yeni'yi' yi'li' zoma ku' winywe. <verse eid="LEV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 11:5" />Mpelele yi'li'bizu'ka ali'vi yi'li' wu'du'hu' vyu'ga. Yeni'yi' yi'li' zoma ku' winywe. <verse eid="LEV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 11:6" />Wu'ng'ando yi'li'bizu'ka, ali'vi yi'li' wu'du'hu' vyu'ga. Yeni'yi' yi'li' zoma ku' winywe. <verse eid="LEV 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 11:7" />Ngu'lu'v'e yi'li' na vyu'ga vya wu'tandu'ke, ali'vi yi'kav'ile ku'bizu'ka. Yeni'yi' yi'li' zoma ku' winywe. <verse eid="LEV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 11:8" />Ndimu zyeni'zi zili' zoma ku' winywe. Nhana ku'du' mwize muv'e muli'lya nyama zyazyo ninga ku'zikuumya milambo zyazyo.<verse eid="LEV 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 11:9" />“ ‘Mugati' na vitundwa vyose vya mu minzi' ga mu nyanza ninga mu myongo, mukowolile ku'lya i'vyo vili' na lu'gaala na magambala. <verse eid="LEV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 11:10" />Ali'vi ki'la ki'tundwa mugati' na minzi' ga mu nyanza ninga myongo i'cho ki'li' wu'du'hu' lu'gaala ninga magambala, mugati' na madale ga vitundwa vido vido ninga mugati' na vitundwa vingi' i'vyo vili'wikala mugati' na minzi', cheni'cho ki'li' igayi'li'zyo ku' winywe. <verse eid="LEV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 11:11" />Ku'nguno ki'li' zoma ku' winywe, ku'du' mwize muv'e muli'lya nyama yacho, ninga ku'gu'kuumya mulambo gwacho, ku'nguno gu'li' igayi'li'zyo ku' winywe. <verse eid="LEV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 11:12" />Ki'la ki'tundwa i'cho ki'li'wikala mu minzi' nacho ki'li' wu'du'hu' magambala ninga lu'gaala ki'li' igayi'li'zyo ku' winywe.<verse eid="LEV 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 11:13" />“ ‘Ku' lwandi' lwa nnoni i'zyo zili' igayi'li'zyo ku' winywe, ku'du' mwize muv'e muli'lya i'zi: nyandakayogo, mbesi, kalimba, <verse eid="LEV 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 11:14" />nyanda, ki'la mukoli gwa lu'v'ala, <verse eid="LEV 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 11:15" />ki'la mukoli gwa maku'ngu'u'lu', <verse eid="LEV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 11:16" />nnongu, pu'lu', v'iliv'ili, <verse eid="LEV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 11:17" />nsinhi, munandi', ifunfugu'lu', <verse eid="LEV 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 11:18" />nsu'lu'zi, nsinhi ya mu ibalangu', kasinzi, <verse eid="LEV 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 11:19" />nkololo, ki'la mukoli gwa mwelwe, ku'nda haki'mo na tu'nge.<verse eid="LEV 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 11:20" />“ ‘Madudu gose ga manana na gali'yu'mba ha nsi', genago gali' igayi'li'zyo ku' winywe. <verse eid="LEV 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 11:21" />Ali'vi mugati' na madudu genago, mukowolile ku'lya ago gali' na masanto ga ku'dumu'ki'la ha igu'lya na nsi'. <verse eid="LEV 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 11:22" />Mugati' na madudu genago mukowolile ku'lya aga: ki'la mukoli gwa nzige, nsyenene na ndili na ki'la mukoli gwa ntololo. <verse eid="LEV 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 11:23" />Sumbwa madudu gangi' gose ago gali' na manana na gali'yu'mba ha nsi', genago gali' igayi'li'zyo ku' winywe.<verse eid="LEV 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 11:24" />“ ‘Mulitu'u'li'le zoma ku' ndimu i'zi. Ki'la u'yo alakuumye milambo zyazyo alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'. <verse eid="LEV 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 11:25" />Muntu' u'yo alasombe ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo mugati' na mulambo gwa vitundwa vyeni'vyo alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi', na yi'lamudime ku'vikanza vizwalo vyakwe.<verse eid="LEV 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 11:26" />“ ‘Ki'la ndimu i'yo yi'li' wu'du'hu' vyu'ga vya wu'tandu'ke, ninga yi'kav'ile ku'bizu'ka, yeni'yo yi'li' zoma ku' winywe. Muntu' u'yo alakuumye mulambo gwayo alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'. <verse eid="LEV 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 11:27" />Hangi' mugati' na ndimu zyose i'zyo zili' na magu'lu' ane, ali'vi zili' na mawundu, zyeni'zyo zili' zoma ku' winywe. Ki'la muntu' u'yo alazikuumye milambo zyazyo alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'. <verse eid="LEV 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 11:28" />Muntu' ninga yu'mo u'yo alasombe milambo zyazyo yi'lamudime ku'vikanza vizwalo vyakwe, nawe alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'. Ndimu zyeni'zyo zili' zoma ku' winywe.<verse eid="LEV 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 11:29" />“ ‘Ku' lwandi' lwa vitundwa vingi' vya ku'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi', i'vi hu' vyene vili' zoma ku' winywe: Lonzi, ngoso, ki'la mukoli gwa mbu'lu', <verse eid="LEV 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 11:30" />ku'u'li', isandawu'lu', ki'gonigoni, mbu'lu'wu'lu' na lu'nvu. <verse eid="LEV 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 11:31" />Vyeni'vyo vyose vili' zoma ku' winywe. Muntu' u'yo alazikuumye milambo zyazyo alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'. <verse eid="LEV 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 11:32" />Hangi' u'lu' yi'v'e mugati' na vitundwa vyeni'vyo ki'mo ki'fwe na ku'gwi'la ha igu'lya na ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo, i'cho ki'lagwi'lwe ki'lav'e na zoma, ninga ki'v'e ki'v'eziv'ilwe ku' muti', mwenda, ndi'li' ninga iguni'la, hangi' ninga ki'v'e cha ku'tu'mami'la muli'mo ninga gu'mo. Yi'li'mudima ku'ki'tu'u'la mu minzi', nacho ki'lav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi', haho ki'lav'e chav'a ki'soso. <verse eid="LEV 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 11:33" />U'lu' ki'tundwa cha wu'fwe ki'gwi'le mu ki'seme cha nnungu', hohene ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo i'cho ki'lav'e mwenu'mo ki'lav'e na zoma, na cheni'cho ki'seme yi'lamudime ku'ki'v'ela. <verse eid="LEV 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 11:34" />Ki'la ki'liwa i'cho ki'liti'lwe minzi' ga ku'fuma mu ki'seme cheni'cho ki'lav'e na zoma, na ki'la ki'ntu' cha ku'nywiwa i'cho ki'lav'e mu ki'seme cheni'cho, ki'lav'e na zoma. <verse eid="LEV 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 11:35" />Ki'la ki'ntu' i'cho ki'lagwi'lwe na ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo mugati' na mulambo gwenu'go ki'lav'e na zoma. Yi'v'e liko ninga nnungu' ya ku'tekela, yi'lamudime ku'viv'ela. Vilav'e na zoma, navyo vili' zoma ku' winywe. <verse eid="LEV 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 11:36" />Ali'vi lwinzi' ninga kasela ka minzi' vikasye viv'e na zoma, ali'vi muntu' ninga yu'mo u'yo alakuumye mulambo u'go gu'li' mu minzi' alav'e na zoma. <verse eid="LEV 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 11:37" />U'lu' ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo mugati' na mulambo ki'gwi'le ha igu'lya na mbutoo, mbutoo yeni'yo yi'kasye yi'v'e na zoma. <verse eid="LEV 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 11:38" />Ali'vi u'lu' mbiyu' zyeni'zyo ziv'e zilov'ekilwe mu minzi' na ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo mugati' na mulambo ki'gwi'le ha igu'lya yazyo, mbiyu' zyeni'zyo zilav'e na zoma.<verse eid="LEV 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 11:39" />“ ‘Ndimu i'yo muzumi'ziv'ilwe ku'yi'lya u'lu' yifwi'le, u'yo alagu'kuumye mulambo gwayo alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'. <verse eid="LEV 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 11:40" />Ki'la muntu' u'yo alalye nyama ya mulambo gwenu'go yi'lamudime avikanze vizwalo vyakwe, nawe alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'. Hangi' ki'la muntu' u'yo alagu'sombe mulambo gwenu'go yi'lamudime avikanze vizwalo vyakwe, nawe alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'.<verse eid="LEV 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 11:41" />“ ‘Hangi' ki'la ki'tundwa ki'do ki'do i'cho ki'li'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi' ki'li' igayi'li'zyo. Nhana ku'du' mwize muki'lye. <verse eid="LEV 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 11:42" />Ki'la ki'tundwa ki'do ki'do i'cho ki'li'yu'mbi'la nda yalyo, na ki'la i'cho ki'li'yu'mbi'la magu'lu' ane, ninga i'cho ki'li'yu'mbi'la magu'lu' mingi, yaani vitundwa vyose i'vyo vili'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi', nhana ku'du' mwize muvilye ku'nguno vili' igayi'li'zyo. <verse eid="LEV 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 11:43" />Ku'du' mwize mwitu'u'li'le igayi'li'zyo ku' ku'lya vitundwa vyeni'vyo, ninga ku'du' mwize muziv'ezye myoyo zinywe ku'v'a na zoma ku'nguno yavyo. <verse eid="LEV 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 11:44" />Ku'nguno ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe. Mwisondohye muv'e v'asondo, ku'nguno ene ni' musondo. Ku'du' mwiv'ezezye zoma inywe v'eni'ki'li' ku' ki'tundwa ki'do ki'do ninga ki'mo cha ku'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi'. <verse eid="LEV 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 11:45" />Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu u'yo namufumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili ki'gele mbe Mulungu winywe. Ku'nguno yeni'yo muv'e v'asondo, ku'nguno ene ni' musondo.<verse eid="LEV 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 11:46" />“ ‘Yeni'yo hu' nhama ku'nguno ya ndimu, nnoni na ki'la ki'tundwa cha myu'ye ya wu'panga i'cho ki'li' mu minzi' ninga i'cho ki'li'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi'. <verse eid="LEV 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 11:47" />Yi'li'mudima ku'lekania mugati' na i'cho ki'li' ki'soso na i'cho ki'li' zoma, na mugati' na vitundwa vya myu'ye ya wu'panga i'vyo vikowolile ku'liwa na i'vyo vikakowoleka ku'liwa.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 11:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LEV 12" />
  <para style="s">Ku'v'asosohya v'aki'ma v'afyele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 12:1" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', <verse eid="LEV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 12:2" />“U'v'awi'le V'aizilaeli ati', ‘U'lu' muki'ma wav'a na mwitungo na kwipeku'la mwana wa ki'gosya, alav'e na zoma nsiku' mupungati' ki'ti' i'vyo ali'v'aga na zoma ku'londana na nsiku' zyakwe i'zyo zili' ku' ki'ti'le cha v'aki'ma. <verse eid="LEV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 12:3" />Mwana mwenu'yo alaputwe nyu'nzu' yakwe mu lu'siku' lwa munane. <verse eid="LEV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 12:4" />Hangi' na muki'ma mwenu'yo alikale itungo lya nsiku' maku'mi adatu' na idatu', ki'gele ku'sosohiwa zoma ya magazi gakwe. Akasye azumi'ziwe ku'kuumya ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo i'cho ki'li' ki'sondo ninga ku'ya ha lwandi' lwa hantu' hasondo, mpaka aho zilav'e zyagelani'la nsiku' zya ku'sosohiwa kwakwe. <verse eid="LEV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 12:5" />Sumbwa u'lu' av'e wipeku'laga mwana wa ki'ki'ma, hohene muki'ma mwenu'yo alav'e na zoma ku' itungo lya mayuma av'i'li' ki'ti' i'vyo yi'li' ku' ki'ti'le cha v'aki'ma. Hangi' alikale nsiku' maku'mi mukaga na mukaga, ki'gele ku'sosohiwa zoma ya magazi gakwe.<verse eid="LEV 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 12:6" />“ ‘Hangi' nsiku' zya ku'sosohiwa ku'nguno ya ku'v'yala kwakwe mwana wa ki'gosya ninga wa ki'ki'ma, aho zilav'e zyagelani'la, muki'ma mwenu'yo alalete kadi'lana ka nkolo ka mwaka gu'mo ku'v'a ki'taambo cha ku'zigya, haki'mo na ipu'u'la ninga ikune lya nkunda ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi. Alalete bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, na ku'mupa muhozya. <verse eid="LEV 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 12:7" />Haho muhozya alavifumye ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu na ku'muv'ezezya wu'swanano, nawe alav'e wasosohiwa zoma ya magazi gakwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 12:7">“ ‘Yeni'yo hu' nhama ku' muki'ma u'yo alav'e wav'yalaga mwana wa ki'gosya ninga wa ki'ki'ma. <verse eid="LEV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 12:8" />U'lu' muki'ma mwenu'yo wav'a ali' wu'du'hu' nsawo ya ku'pandi'ka kadi'lana ka nkolo, alalete mapu'u'la av'i'li' ninga makune av'i'li' ga nkunda, li'mo ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'zigya na lya wu'v'i'li' ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi. Haho muhozya alamuv'ezezye wu'swanano, nawe alav'e wasosoka.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 12:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LEV 13" />
  <para style="s">Nhama ku'nguno ya malwile ga ndi'li'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 13:1" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'awi'laga Mose na Aloni ati', <verse eid="LEV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 13:2" />“U'lu' muntu' ninga yu'mo av'e na wu'vimbe ku' ndi'li' ya mu muv'i'li' gwakwe, ninga wu'landi, ninga ibado, na ki'ntu' i'cho ki'li'wikola ku'v'a ki'ti' wu'lwile wa ndi'li' mu muv'i'li' gwakwe, haho alaletwe ku'mwa Aloni ninga ku' yu'mo mugati' na v'ana v'akwe v'a ki'gosya v'ahozya. <verse eid="LEV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 13:3" />Nawe muhozya alahikomye ha wu'vimbe wenu'wo wa ha igu'lya na ndi'li', na u'lu' wu'yenze wa henanho wagalu'kile na ku'v'a wape, na u'lu' wu'vimbe wingi'lile mugati' na ndi'li', hohene yi'ligelisye ku'v'a yi'li' wu'lwile wa ndi'li'. Muhozya alav'e u'lu' wamali'la ku'mwikomya, haho alamutangazye ku'v'a ali' na zoma. <verse eid="LEV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 13:4" />Ali'vi wu'vimbe wenu'wo ninga i'vi wape, u'lu' wu'kingi'la mugati' na ndi'li', na wu'yenze wu'kagalu'kile ku'v'a wape, haho muhozya alamukome muntu' mwenu'yo av'e ha winene ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati'. <verse eid="LEV 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 13:5" />Yi'lav'e lu'siku' lwa mupungati', muhozya alamwikomye hangi' muntu' mwenu'yo, nawe u'lu' wawona ku'v'a wu'vimbe wenu'wo wu'kalandalile ku' ndi'li' yakwe, hohene muhozya alamukome hangi' av'e inene ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati' zingi'. <verse eid="LEV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 13:6" />U'lu' lwafika lu'siku' lwa mupungati', muhozya alamwikomye hangi'. U'lu' yi'v'e wu'vimbe wenu'wo wadohaga na wu'kalandalile ha igu'lya na ndi'li', haho muhozya alamutangazye ku'v'a wav'aga musoso, na wu'li' wu'vimbe du'. Yi'lamudime muntu' mwenu'yo avikanze vizwalo vyakwe, nawe alav'e wasosoka. <verse eid="LEV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 13:7" />Ali'vi u'lu' wu'vimbe wenu'wo wakalandala ku'fuma muntu' mwenu'yo aho ndi' wilagi'la ku' muhozya ku'nguno ya ku'sosohiwa kwakwe, hohene yi'lamudime ku'ya hangi' ku' muhozya. <verse eid="LEV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 13:8" />Haho muhozya alamwikomye hangi'. U'lu' wu'vimbe wu'landalile ku' ndi'li' hohene muhozya alamutangazye ku'v'a muntu' mwenu'yo ali' na zoma. Wenu'wo wu'li' wu'lwile wa ndi'li'.<verse eid="LEV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 13:9" />“U'lu' muntu' wu'mudime wu'lwile wa ndi'li', alafilwe ku' muhozya. <verse eid="LEV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 13:10" />Nawe muhozya alamwikomye na u'lu' ali' na wu'vimbe wape ha igu'lya na ndi'li' na wu'yenze wagalu'kile ku'v'a wape, na wu'vimbe wenu'wo wagalu'kile na ku'v'a ki'londa, <verse eid="LEV 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 13:11" />wenu'wo sanga wu'li' wu'lwile wa ndi'li' u'wo wu'kakowola ku'pi'la. Haho muhozya alamutangazye ku'v'a ali' na zoma. Yi'lav'e ku'du'hu' nguno ya ku'mukoma ku'nguno ya ku'mwikomya, ku'nguno yigelisyaga ali' na zoma.<verse eid="LEV 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 13:12" />“Ali'vi wenu'wo wu'lwile wa ndi'li' u'lu' wu'lav'e wigelisyaga ku' ndi'li' ya mulwile, na walandalaga ku' muv'i'li' gose, ku'fuma ku' mutwe mpaka ku' magu'lu', ki'ti' i'vyo muhozya alav'e wamuwonaga, <verse eid="LEV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 13:13" />muhozya alamwikomye. U'lu' nhana wu'lwile wa ndi'li' wakalandala mu muv'i'li' gose, hohene alamutangazye ku'v'a muntu' mwenu'yo ali' musoso. Ku'nguno muv'i'li' gwakwe gwakagalu'ka na ku'v'a gwape yi'li'wigela wu'lwile wakav'i'ta. Muntu' mwenu'yo ali' musoso. <verse eid="LEV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 13:14" />Ali'vi u'lu' yigele mu muv'i'li' gwa muntu' mwenu'yo ku'li' na ki'londa, hohene muntu' mwenu'yo alav'e na zoma. <verse eid="LEV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 13:15" />Muhozya alakikomye cheni'cho ki'londa na ku'mutangazya muntu' mwenu'yo ku'v'a ali' na zoma. Ki'londa cheni'cho ki'li' zoma, ku'nguno wenu'wo wu'li' wu'lwile wa ndi'li'. <verse eid="LEV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 13:16" />Sumbwa ki'londa cheni'cho u'lu' ki'galu'ke hangi' na ku'v'a chape, yi'lamudime muntu' mwenu'yo ku'su'v'a ku' muhozya. <verse eid="LEV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 13:17" />Nawe muhozya alamwikomye na u'lu' waki'wona ku'v'a nhana chagalu'kaga na ku'v'a chape, hohene alamutangazye muntu' mwenu'yo ku'v'a zoma yamalaga na wav'aga musoso.<verse eid="LEV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 13:18" />“Hangi' u'lu' muntu' av'e na ipute ku' ndi'li' yakwe, nalyo li'pi'le, <verse eid="LEV 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 13:19" />ali'vi aho ndi' hali' na ipute u'lu' hav'e na wu'vimbe wape, ninga wape wa wazaa, yi'lamudime akiyoleche ku' muhozya. <verse eid="LEV 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 13:20" />Nawe muhozya alahikomye henanho ha wu'vimbe, na u'lu' wingi'lile mugati' na ndi'li', na wu'yenze wagalu'kile ku'v'a wape, haho muhozya alamutangazye ku'v'a ali' na zoma. Wenu'wo wu'li' wu'lwile wa ndi'li' u'wo wakafumi'i'la ku' ipute. <verse eid="LEV 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 13:21" />Ali'vi muhozya u'lu' wamwikomya muntu' mwenu'yo na ku'wona wu'yenze wa ha lwandi' lwenu'lo wu'kav'ile wape na wu'vimbe wu'kingi'la mugati' na ndi'li', ali'vi hali'pi'li'zya, hohene muhozya alamukome muntu' mwenu'yo av'e ha winene ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati'. <verse eid="LEV 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 13:22" />Hangi' u'lu' wu'vimbe wize wu'v'e wakalandala ha ndi'li', haho muhozya alamutangazye ku'v'a ali' na zoma. Wenu'wo wu'li' wu'lwile. <verse eid="LEV 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 13:23" />Ali'vi u'lu' wu'vimbe wenu'wo wu'li' vyene vivyo, na wu'kalandala, yi'li' iv'amba lya ipute du'. Muhozya alamutangazye muntu' mwenu'yo ku'v'a ali' musoso.<verse eid="LEV 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 13:24" />“U'lu' muntu' av'e na lwandi' u'lo ndi' wapya ha ndi'li' yakwe na lu'galu'ke lu'v'e ki'londa cha wape ninga wape wa wazaa, <verse eid="LEV 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 13:25" />haho muhozya alahikomye. U'lu' awone wu'yenze wa henanho wagalu'kaga na ku'v'a wape na wu'vimbe wingi'lile mugati', wenu'wo sanga wu'li' wu'lwile wa ndi'li' u'wo wakamudima ha wu'pye wa moto. Haho muhozya alamutangazye muntu' mwenu'yo ku'v'a ali' na zoma. Wu'li' wu'lwile wa ndi'li'. <verse eid="LEV 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 13:26" />Ali'vi muhozya u'lu' ahikomye na ku'wona wu'yenze wa henanho wu'kav'ile wape na wu'vimbe wu'kingi'la mugati' na hapi'li'zizye, haho muhozya alamukome muntu' mwenu'yo av'e ha winene ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati'. <verse eid="LEV 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 13:27" />Lu'siku' lwa mupungati' muhozya alamwikomye hangi', na u'lu' awone wu'vimbe wu'landalile ku' ndi'li', haho muhozya alamutangazye muntu' mwenu'yo ku'v'a ali' na zoma. Wenu'wo wu'li' wu'lwile wa ndi'li'. <verse eid="LEV 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 13:28" />Ali'vi u'lu' lwandi' lwenu'lo lu'li' vyene vivyo na lu'kalandala, sumbwa hali'pi'li'zya, wenu'wo wu'li' wu'vimbe ku'nguno ya ku'pya moto du'. Haho muhozya alamutangazye muntu' mwenu'yo ku'v'a ali' musoso. Lyeni'lo li'li' iv'amba ku'nguno ya ku'pya moto.<verse eid="LEV 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 13:29" />“Hangi' muntu' u'yo alav'e na wu'vimbe ku' mutwe ninga ku' ki'lezu, av'e mugosya ninga muki'ma, <verse eid="LEV 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 13:30" />haho muhozya alawikomye wu'vimbe wenu'wo. Muhozya u'lu' awone wu'vimbe wingi'lile mugati' na ndi'li', na nyele zyakav'a zya njano na zyakanieniengala, haho muhozya alamutangazye muntu' mwenu'yo ku'v'a ali' na zoma. Genago gali' mapatu' na wu'li' wu'lwile wa ndi'li' wa ku' mutwe ninga ku' ndezu. <verse eid="LEV 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 13:31" />Ali'vi u'lu' muhozya ahikomye ha mapatu' genago nago gigele gakingi'lile mugati' na ndi'li' sumbwa ku'du'hu' nyele nnilawu'zu, haho muhozya alamukome muntu' mwenu'yo ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati'. <verse eid="LEV 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 13:32" />Lu'siku' lwa mupungati' muhozya alagikomye hangi' mapatu' genago. U'lu' gakalandalile na gali' wu'du'hu' nyele zya langi ya njano na gakingi'lile mugati' na ndi'li', <verse eid="LEV 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 13:33" />yi'lamudime muntu' mwenu'yo amogwe nyele zyakwe, sumbwa ha mapatu' hakasye hamogwe. Haho muhozya alamukome ha winene muntu' mwenu'yo ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati' zingi'. <verse eid="LEV 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 13:34" />Lu'siku' lwa mupungati' muhozya alagikomye hangi' mapatu' genago. U'lu' wawona ku'v'a gakalandalile na gakingi'lile mugati' na ndi'li', haho alamutangazye muntu' mwenu'yo ku'v'a ali' musoso. Muntu' mwenu'yo yi'lamudime ku'vikanza vizwalo vyakwe, nawe alav'e wasosoka. <verse eid="LEV 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 13:35" />Ali'vi u'lu' mapatu' gize galandale ku'fuma ha itungo lya ku'tangaziwa wu'soso wakwe, <verse eid="LEV 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 13:36" />muhozya alamwikomye muntu' mwenu'yo. U'lu' gav'e mapatu' nhana galandalile, ku'lav'e ku'du'hu' nguno ya muhozya ku'mwikomya nyele zya njano, ku'nguno muntu' mwenu'yo ali' na zoma. <verse eid="LEV 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 13:37" />Ninga vyeni'vyo, u'lu' wamwikomya na ku'wona akagalu'kile, na nyele nnilawu'zu zimelile henanho, mapatu' genago sanga gapi'laga na muntu' mwenu'yo akav'ile na zoma. Haho muhozya alamutangazye ku'v'a ali' musoso.<verse eid="LEV 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 13:38" />“Ki'la muntu' u'yo alav'e na mabado gape ha igu'lya na ndi'li' yakwe, av'e mugosya ninga muki'ma, <verse eid="LEV 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 13:39" />muhozya alamwikomye muntu' mwenu'yo. U'lu' amuwone ku'v'a mabado genago gali' na wilawu'zu hadoo, sanga wenu'wo wu'li' wu'landi u'wo wu'kav'ile na wu'v'i ku' ndi'li'. Muntu' mwenu'yo ali' musoso.<verse eid="LEV 13:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 13:40" />“U'lu' mugosya amele wanga, mwenu'yo ali' musoso. <verse eid="LEV 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 13:41" />Ninga u'lu' muntu' apenyuke nyele zyakwe ku' lwandi' lwa ku' mbele ninga lwa ku' nnuma lwa mutwe gwakwe, sanga wanga du'. Mwenu'yo ali' musoso. <verse eid="LEV 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 13:42" />Ali'vi u'lu' ku' mutwe gwa muntu' wa wanga ku'v'e na wu'vimbe wa langi yape ya wazaa, wenu'wo wu'li' wu'lwile wa ndi'li' u'wo wu'li'fumi'i'la ku' wanga wakwe wa ku' mbele ninga wa ku' nnuma. <verse eid="LEV 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 13:43" />Haho muhozya alamwikomye. U'lu' awone wu'vimbe wu'li' na wape wa wazaa ku' wanga wakwe, na wu'li'wigela ki'ti' wu'lwile wa ndi'li', <verse eid="LEV 13:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 13:44" />sanga muntu' mwenu'yo alwalile, na ali' na zoma. Haho muhozya alamutangazye muntu' mwenu'yo ku'v'a ali' na zoma ku'nguno ya wu'vimbe ku' mutwe gwakwe.<verse eid="LEV 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 13:45" />“Ki'la mulwile wa ndi'li' u'yo ali' na wu'vimbe yi'lamudime azwale vizwalo vya wu'zemuke, na nyele zyakwe alazisalambanie, na mulomo gwakwe alagu'fumbati'zye na ku'liinia muzwi na ku'yomba, ‘Ene ni'na zoma! Ene ni'na zoma!’ <verse eid="LEV 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 13:46" />Mugati' na nsiku' zyose i'zyo alav'e na wu'lwile wenu'wo mwenu'yo alendeleye ku'v'a na zoma, nawe alikale ku' ku'komwa av'e ha mpelo na nkambi'.”<verse eid="LEV 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhama ku'nguno ya wule ku' vizwalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 13:47" />“U'lu' ku'li' na mwenda u'go gwakikuumya na wule, gu'v'e gwa wu'zi wa wu'yenze ninga wa katani, <verse eid="LEV 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 13:48" />ninga gu'v'e gwa wu'fuumwe wa ki'la mukoli ku' katani ninga wu'yenze, ninga gu'v'e gwa ndi'li', ninga ki'v'e ki'ntu' i'cho ki'v'eziv'ilwe ku' ndi'li', <verse eid="LEV 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 13:49" />na u'lu' wule wenu'wo wu'li' na langi ya lu'du'tu' ninga yazaa ku' mwenda gwenu'go ninga ku' ki'ntu' cha ndi'li', wenu'wo wu'li' wule wu'v'i, na yi'li'koov'iwa ku'lagi'lwa muhozya. <verse eid="LEV 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 13:50" />Haho muhozya alawikomye wule wenu'wo na ku'gu'koma mwenda ninga ki'ntu' cheni'cho ha mpelo ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati'. <verse eid="LEV 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 13:51" />Mu lu'siku' lwa mupungati' alawikomye, na u'lu' awone wule wenu'wo wu'landalile ku' mwenda ninga ki'ntu' cheni'cho, sanga ki'li' na wule wu'v'i. Ku'nguno yeni'yo ki'ntu' cheni'cho ki'li' na zoma. <verse eid="LEV 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 13:52" />Hohene muhozya yi'lamudime agu'time moto mwenda ninga ki'ntu' cheni'cho, ku'nguno ki'li' na wule wu'v'i u'wo wu'kakowoleka ku'hangwa.<verse eid="LEV 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 13:53" />“Ali'vi u'lu' muhozya awikomye na ku'wona ku'v'a wule wenu'wo wu'kalandala ku' mwenda ninga ki'ntu' cheni'cho, <verse eid="LEV 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 13:54" />haho muhozya alasemuzye ki'kanzwe, nawe alaki'kome ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati' hangi'. <verse eid="LEV 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 13:55" />Hangi' muhozya alagwikomye mwenda gwenu'go ninga ki'ntu' u'lu' chakanzwa. U'lu' yigele wu'kagalu'kile langi ninga i'vyo wu'kalandala, sanga ki'li' na zoma. Mwenda ninga ki'ntu' cheni'cho ki'latimwe, ninga ki'v'e na wu'v'ipiwe wa wule mugati' ninga ha ibala. <verse eid="LEV 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 13:56" />Ali'vi u'lu' muhozya awone ku'v'a wule walamulaga ku'zimangu'ka ku'fuma aho ndi' chakanzwa, hohene alahazemule aho hakalandi'ki'ziwa na wule ku' mwenda ninga ki'ntu'. <verse eid="LEV 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 13:57" />Ali'vi u'lu' wule wigele hangi' ku' mwenda ninga ki'ntu' cheni'cho, sanga wu'landalile. Haho yi'li'koov'iwa ku'ki'tima moto. <verse eid="LEV 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LEV 13:58" />Sumbwa mwenda ninga ki'ntu' cheni'cho i'cho chakanzagwa na ku'siniwa wule, yi'li'koov'iwa ki'kanzwe ka wu'v'i'li', nacho ki'lav'e chasosoka.”<verse eid="LEV 13:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LEV 13:59" />Yeni'yi' hu' nhama ku'nguno ya wule u'wo wu'fumi'i'lile ku' myenda zya wu'zi wa wu'yenze ninga wa katani, i'zyo zya wu'fuumwe wa ki'la mukoli, ninga ki'ntu' cha ndi'li'. Ku' nzi'la yeni'yi' mulakowole ku'mani'cha mugati' na myenda misoso na zya zoma.<verse eid="LEV 13:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LEV 14" />
  <para style="s">Ku'sosohya ku'fuma ku'landi'ki'ziwa malwile ga ndi'li'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 14:1" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', <verse eid="LEV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 14:2" />“I'yi' hu' nhama ku'nguno ya muntu' wa wu'lwile wa ndi'li', mu lu'siku' lwa ku'sosohiwa kwakwe. Mmola yakwe yi'laletwe ku' muhozya, <verse eid="LEV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 14:3" />nawe muhozya alafume ha ibala na nkambi' na ku'mwikomya. U'lu' muntu' mwenu'yo wapi'laga wu'lwile wakwe wa ndi'li', <verse eid="LEV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 14:4" />haho muhozya alasemuzye viletwe vintu' i'vi ku'nguno ya muntu' u'yo alasosohiwe: Nnoni iv'i'li' nsoso i'zyo mpanga, ki'pande cha muti' gwa mwelezi, wu'zi wa langi yazaa haki'mo na itambi' lya hisopo. <verse eid="LEV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 14:5" />Hohene muhozya alasemuzye mugati' na nnoni zyeni'zyo v'asi'nze nnoni yi'mo ha igu'lya na nnungu' i'yo yi'li' na minzi' masoga ga kasela. <verse eid="LEV 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 14:6" />Hangi' muhozya alayi'sole i'yo nnoni yi'ngi' mpanga, ki'pande cha muti' gwa mwelezi, wu'zi wa langi yazaa haki'mo na itambi' lya hisopo, na ku'vidobya mu magazi ga i'yo nnoni ya wu'si'nzwe. <verse eid="LEV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 14:7" />Nawe alamunyanyagi'le magazi kali' mupungati' mwenu'yo u'yo ali'sosohiwa, na alamutangazye ku'v'a ali' musoso. Hangi' alayi'leku'li'le i'yo nnoni mpanga ki'gele yiyagalu'le.<verse eid="LEV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 14:8" />“Haho mwenu'yo muntu' u'yo ali'sosohiwa yi'lamudime avikanze vizwalo vyakwe, asenye nyele zyakwe zyose na koga mu minzi', nawe alav'e wasosoka. Hohene alasu'v'e ha nkambi', ali'vi yi'lamudime kwikala ha ibala na ihema lyakwe ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati'. <verse eid="LEV 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 14:9" />Lu'siku' lwa mupungati' alamoge nyele zyakwe zyose, yaani amoge nyele zya ku' mutwe, ndezu, vikuti na nyele zingi' zyose. Hangi' yi'lamudime avikanze vizwalo vyakwe, na oge mu minzi', haho alav'e wasosoka.<verse eid="LEV 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 14:10" />“Hangi' lu'siku' lwa munane alalete tu'di'lana twa ng'ondi tu'v'i'li' na kaki'ma kamo, tose tu'v'e na musimo gwa mwaka gu'mo, na tu'v'e tu'li' wu'du'hu' wu'lema, haki'mo na kilo idatu' zya wu'fuma wu'nelezu u'wo wu'seleganiv'ilwe na maguta ga muzeituni ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo, na selusi ya lita ya maguta. <verse eid="LEV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 14:11" />Muhozya u'yo alamutangazye ku'v'a ali' musoso, hu' mwene alamulete muntu' mwenu'yo haki'mo na kalu'mbi'lo kakwe kose ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya.<verse eid="LEV 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 14:12" />“Hangi' muhozya alakasole kadi'lana ka ng'ondi kamo mugati' na tu'di'lana twenu'to, na ku'kafumya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya musango, haki'mo na maguta genago. Hangi' alaviwu'sye ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ku'v'a lu'manyi'lo lwa kalu'mbi'lo. <verse eid="LEV 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 14:13" />Hangi' alakasi'nzi'le kadi'lana kenako ha hantu' hasondo aho v'ali'si'nzi'laga vitaambo vya ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi na vitaambo vya ku'zigya. Ki'ti' ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi i'vyo ki'li' cha muhozya, hu' vyene ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya musango ki'li' nsawo ya muhozya. Nacho ki'li' ki'sondo muno. <verse eid="LEV 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 14:14" />Haho muhozya mwenu'yo alasole magazi madoo ga ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya musango na ku'muv'ila mwenu'yo u'yo ali'sosohiwa ku' mpelo na itwi lya mulyi'la na ku' li'nkumwa lya ku' mukono gwakwe gwa mulyi'la na li'nkumwa lya ku' mugu'lu' gwakwe gwa mulyi'la. <verse eid="LEV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 14:15" />Hangi' muhozya alasole lwandi' lwa genago maguta na ku'gapu'ngu'li'la mu ki'ganza cha mukono gwakwe gwa mumoso. <verse eid="LEV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 14:16" />Hangi' aladobye maguta genago ku' lyala lyakwe lya mukono gwa mulyi'la na ku'nyanyagi'la kali' mupungati' ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 14:17" />Muhozya alamuv'ile u'yo ali'sosohiwa lwandi' lwa maguta ago gali' mu ki'ganza ku' mpelo ya itwi lya mulyi'la na ku' li'nkumwa lya ku' mukono gwakwe gwa mulyi'la haki'mo na ku' li'nkumwa lya ku' mugu'lu' gwakwe gwa mulyi'la, mu lwandi' lwene lu'lo u'mo wamuv'ilaga magazi ga ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya musango. <verse eid="LEV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 14:18" />Maguta ago galasigali'le mu ki'ganza chakwe muhozya, alagav'ile ku' mutwe gwa mwenu'yo muntu' u'yo ali'sosohiwa, na ku'v'ezya wu'swanano ku'nguno yakwe ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 14:19" />Muhozya alaki'egezye i'cho ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi, na ku'v'ezya wu'swanano ku'nguno ya muntu' mwenu'yo. Hangi' alasi'nze kadi'lana ka ki'taambo cha ku'zigya, <verse eid="LEV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 14:20" />na ku'kafumya ha igu'lya na ihozezyo, haki'mo na kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo, ki'gele ku'mali'zi'zya ku'muv'ezezya wu'swanano, nawe alav'e wasosoka.<verse eid="LEV 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 14:21" />“Sumbwa muntu' mwenu'yo u'lu' av'e mupi'na, na akakowola ku'pandi'ka vintu' vyeni'vyo, haho alafumye kadi'lana kamo ka ng'ondi ku'v'a ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya musango, ki'gele ki'wu'siwe ki'v'e lu'manyi'lo lwa kalu'mbi'lo, na ku'muv'ezezya wu'swanano. Hangi' alafumye kilo yi'mo ya wu'fuma wu'nelezu u'wo wu'seleganiv'ilwe na maguta ga muzeituni ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo, na selusi ya lita ya maguta. <verse eid="LEV 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 14:22" />Alalete na mapu'u'la av'i'li' ninga makune av'i'li' ga nkunda, ku'londana na i'vyo alakowole ku'pandi'ka. Li'mo li'lav'e lya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi, na lya wu'v'i'li' lya ki'taambo cha ku'zigya.<verse eid="LEV 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 14:23" />“Lu'siku' lwa munane alamuletele muhozya vintu' vyeni'vyo bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku'nguno ya ku'sosohiwa kwakwe. <verse eid="LEV 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 14:24" />Nawe muhozya alakasombe kenako kadi'lana ka ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya musango, haki'mo na selusi ya lita ya maguta, haho alaviwu'sye viv'e lu'manyi'lo lwa kalu'mbi'lo ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 14:25" />Haho alakasi'nze kenako kadi'lana ka ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya musango. Hangi' alasole lwandi' lwa magazi na ku'muv'ila ku' itwi lya mulyi'la lya muntu' u'yo alav'e ali'sosohiwa, na ku'muv'ila hangi' ku' li'nkumwa lya ku' mukono gwa mulyi'la lya mwenu'yo muntu', haki'mo na ku' li'nkumwa lya ku' mugu'lu' gwa mulyi'la. <verse eid="LEV 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 14:26" />Hangi' muhozya alasole lwandi' lwa genago maguta na ku'gapu'ngu'li'la mu ki'ganza cha mukono gwakwe gwa mumoso, <verse eid="LEV 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 14:27" />na alamunyanyagi'le muntu' mwenu'yo maguta genago ku' ku'tu'mi'la lyala lyakwe lya mukono gwa mulyi'la kali' mupungati' ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 14:28" />Muhozya alamuv'ile u'yo ali'sosohiwa lwandi' lwa maguta ago gali' mu ki'ganza, ku' itwi lya mulyi'la, ku' li'nkumwa lya ku' mukono gwa mulyi'la, na ku' li'nkumwa lya ku' mugu'lu' gwa mulyi'la, mu lwandi' lwene lu'lo u'mo wamuv'ilaga magazi ga ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya musango. <verse eid="LEV 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 14:29" />Maguta ago galasigali'le mu ki'ganza chakwe, muhozya alamuv'ile ku' mutwe muntu' mwenu'yo u'yo ali'sosohiwa, ki'gele ku'v'ezya wu'swanano ku'nguno yakwe ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 14:30" />Hangi' muhozya alasole ago mapu'u'la ninga ago makune ga nkunda ku'londana na i'vyo muntu' mwenu'yo akowolile ku'leta. <verse eid="LEV 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 14:31" />Mugati' nago li'mo li'lav'e ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi na li'ngi' ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'zigya, haki'mo na kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo. Ku' nzi'la yeni'yi' muhozya alamuv'ezezye muntu' mwenu'yo wu'swanano ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="LEV 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 14:32" />“Yeni'yi' hu' nhama ya ki'la muntu' wa wu'lwile wa ndi'li' wa ku'landi'ki'zya u'yo akakowola ku'pandi'ka kalu'mbi'lo ako kali'koov'iwa ka ku'musosohya.”<verse eid="LEV 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndoowu mu magelele ga nnumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 14:33" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'awi'laga Mose na Aloni ati', <verse eid="LEV 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 14:34" />“Aho mulav'e mwingi'la mu nsi' ya Kanaani, i'yo nu'mupa muyi'teme, nanne mbe ndete ndoowu mugati' na nnumba yi'mo ya nsi' yeni'yo, <verse eid="LEV 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 14:35" />hohene musav'a nnumba yeni'yo yi'lamudime ku'ya ku' muhozya na ku'kamuwi'la ati', ‘Nawonaga ki'ntu' ki'mo ku' nnumba yanne kikolile ki'ti' ndoowu.’ <verse eid="LEV 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 14:36" />Muhozya alalagi'li'zye ku'v'a vifumiwe vintu' vyose mu nnumba yeni'yo, aho akaali' ku'ya ku'kayikomya ndoowu yeni'yo, ki'gele vintu' i'vyo vili' mu nnumba ku'du' vitangaziwe ku'v'a vili' na zoma. Haho muhozya alaingi'le na ku'yikomya nnumba yeni'yo. <verse eid="LEV 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 14:37" />Nawe alayikomye ndoowu yeni'yo ku' nnumba. U'lu' yingi'lile ku' magelele, nago gali' na madu'lu'lu' madu'lu'lu' ga langi ya lu'du'tu' ninga yazaa na gingi'lile mugati' na magelele, <verse eid="LEV 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 14:38" />hohene muhozya alafume ha ibala na nnumba yeni'yo, na ku'gu'lugala muzigo gwayo ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati'. <verse eid="LEV 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 14:39" />Lu'siku' lwa mupungati', muhozya alasu'v'e hangi' na ku'yikomya nnumba yeni'yo. U'lu' yi'v'e ndoowu yeni'yo yakalandala ku' magelele ga nnumba yeni'yo, <verse eid="LEV 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 14:40" />haho muhozya alalagi'li'zye v'agafumye mawe gose ago gali' na ndoowu, na ku'gatagi'la ha lwandi' lu'zomalu'ku ha ibala na kaya. <verse eid="LEV 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 14:41" />Magelele gose ga mugati' ga nnumba yeni'yo gize gapalangu'lwe ki'la lwandi', na matuntu gose ga malongo genago v'alagazyolele ha ibala na kaya ha lwandi' lu'zomalu'ku. <verse eid="LEV 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 14:42" />Hangi' v'alasole mawe gangi' na ku'zyenga aho habomolilwe, na ku'yi'si'li'v'a nnumba yeni'yo ku' wu'pya.<verse eid="LEV 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 14:43" />“Ali'vi aho galav'e gafumiwa mawe genago, na nnumba yeni'yo ku'palangu'lwa na ku'si'li'v'wa wu'pya, na u'lu' ndoowu yeni'yo yigele hangi' mugati' na nnumba yeni'yo, <verse eid="LEV 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 14:44" />haho muhozya alaingi'le na ku'yikomya. U'lu' ndoowu yeni'yo yalandalaga mu nnumba yeni'yo, sanga yi'li' ndoowu mbi i'yo yi'kali' ku'hangwa. Nnumba yeni'yo yi'li' na zoma. <verse eid="LEV 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 14:45" />Yi'lamudime muntu' mwenu'yo ayi'bomole nnumba yeni'yo. Mawe gayo, miti' na malongo gayo, vyose alavizyole na ku'vitagi'la ha ibala na kaya ha lwandi' lu'zomalu'ku.<verse eid="LEV 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 14:46" />“Hangi' ki'la muntu' u'yo alaingi'le mu nnumba yeni'yo ha itungo i'lo yi'lav'e yi'lugalilwe, alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'. <verse eid="LEV 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 14:47" />Ki'la muntu' u'yo alalale ninga ku'lyi'la mu nnumba yeni'yo, yi'lamudime avikanze vizwalo vyakwe.<verse eid="LEV 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 14:48" />“Ali'vi u'lu' muhozya ize ayikomye na ku'wona ku'v'a ndoowu yi'kalandalile ku' nnumba yeni'yo, ku'fuma aho ndi' yasi'li'v'wa, haho muhozya alayi'tangazye ku'v'a nnumba yeni'yo yi'li' nsoso, ku'nguno ndoowu yakamala. <verse eid="LEV 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 14:49" />Musav'a nnumba yeni'yo alalete nnoni iv'i'li', ki'pande cha muti' gwa mwelezi, wu'zi wa langi yazaa na itambi' lya hisopo, viv'e ku'nguno ya ku'yi'sosohya nnumba yeni'yo. <verse eid="LEV 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 14:50" />Nnoni yi'mo alayi'si'nzi'le ha igu'lya na nnungu' i'yo yi'li' na minzi' masoga ga kasela. <verse eid="LEV 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 14:51" />Hangi' alasole ki'pande cha mwelezi, itambi' lya hisopo, wu'zi wa langi yazaa na i'yo nnoni mpanga, na ku'vidobya mu magazi ga i'yo nnoni ya wu'si'nzwe, na ku' minzi' ago ga kasela, na ku'yi'nyanyagi'la nnumba yeni'yo kali' mupungati'. <verse eid="LEV 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 14:52" />I'vi hu' vyene alayi'sosohye nnumba yeni'yo ku' magazi ga nnoni, minzi' ga kasela, nnoni mpanga ki'pande cha mwelezi, itambi' lya hisopo, na ku' wu'zi wa langi yazaa. <verse eid="LEV 14:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 14:53" />Haho alayi'leku'li'le i'yo nnoni mpanga yiyagalu'le. Ku' nzi'la yeni'yo alav'e wav'ezya wu'swanano ku'nguno ya nnumba yeni'yo, nayo yi'lav'e yasosoka.<verse eid="LEV 14:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 14:54" />“Yeni'yi' hu' nhama ku'nguno ya ki'la mukoli gwa wu'lwile wa ndi'li' ninga wa wule, ku'nguno ya mapatu', <verse eid="LEV 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 14:55" />wule ku' vizwalo, ndoowu ku' magelele, <verse eid="LEV 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 14:56" />wu'vimbe, wu'landi ninga mabado, <verse eid="LEV 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 14:57" />ki'gele ku'lagi'la ki'ntu' ki' ki'li' zoma na i'cho ki'li' ki'soso.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 14:57">“Yeni'yi' hu' nhama ku'nguno ya wu'lwile wa ndi'li' na wule haki'mo na ndoowu.”<verse eid="LEV 14:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LEV 15" />
  <para style="s">Ku'fuma magazi ninga wu'fila i'vyo vili'lenga zoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 15:1" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'awi'laga Mose na Aloni ati', <verse eid="LEV 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 15:2" />“Muyombe na iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli, muv'awi'le ati', ‘Itungo i'lo mugosya ninga yu'mo aho alav'e ali'fumya wu'fila mu muv'i'li' gwakwe, wu'fila wenu'wo wu'li' zoma. <verse eid="LEV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 15:3" />I'vi hu' vyene yi'li' u'lu' muv'i'li' gwakwe gu'v'e gu'li'fumya wu'fila ninga mbe wu'v'e wu'kiv'ile mugati'. Muntu' mwenu'yo ali' na zoma.<verse eid="LEV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 15:4" />“ ‘Ki'la wu'li'li' u'wo alawu'lali'le wu'lav'e na zoma, ninga ki'ntu' i'cho alakikali'le ki'lav'e na zoma. <verse eid="LEV 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 15:5" />Ki'la muntu' wa ku'wu'kuumya wu'li'li' wa muntu' mwenu'yo, yi'lamudime avikanze vizwalo vyakwe, na koga mu minzi', nawe alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'. <verse eid="LEV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 15:6" />Hangi' ki'la muntu' u'yo alikali'le ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo i'cho wakikali'lile muntu' wa ku'zwa wu'fila yi'lamudime avikanze vizwalo vyakwe, na koga mu minzi', nawe alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'.<verse eid="LEV 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 15:7" />“ ‘Ninga u'yo alamukuumye muntu' wa ku'zwa wu'fila, yi'lamudime avikanze vizwalo vyakwe, na koga mu minzi', nawe alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'.<verse eid="LEV 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 15:8" />“ ‘Hangi' muntu' u'yo ali'zwa wu'fila u'lu' amutugi'le matye muntu' u'yo ali' musoso, haho muntu' wa ku'tugi'lwa yi'lamudime avikanze vizwalo vyakwe, na koga mu minzi', nawe alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'.<verse eid="LEV 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 15:9" />“ ‘Hangi' ki'la chanzwa i'cho alakikali'le muntu' u'yo ali'zwa wu'fila ha itungo lya ku'dami'la ha igu'lya na mutugo, ki'lav'e na zoma. <verse eid="LEV 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 15:10" />Ki'la muntu' u'yo alaki'kuumye ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo i'cho wakikali'lile muntu' mwenu'yo, alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'. Ki'la u'yo alaki'sombe ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo mugati' na vyeni'vyo yi'lamudime avikanze vizwalo vyakwe, na koga mu minzi', nawe alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'.<verse eid="LEV 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 15:11" />“ ‘Hangi' ki'la muntu' u'yo ali'zwa wu'fila u'lu' ize amukuumye muntu' yu'ngi' bila ku'kalav'a makono gakwe, u'yo alakuumiwe yi'lamudime avikanze vizwalo vyakwe, na koga mu minzi', nawe alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'.<verse eid="LEV 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 15:12" />“ ‘Ki'la ki'seme cha wu'longo i'cho alaki'kuumye muntu' u'yo ali'zwa wu'fila ki'lav'elagu'lwe. Sumbwa ki'la ki'seme cha muti' ki'lakuswe mu minzi'.<verse eid="LEV 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 15:13" />“ ‘Hangi' muntu' u'yo ali'zwa wu'fila u'lu' wapi'la wu'lwile wakwe, yi'lamudime alindi'le nsiku' mupungati' zya ku'sosoka kwakwe, nawe alavikanze vizwalo vyakwe, na koga mu minzi' ga kasela, haho alav'e wasosoka. <verse eid="LEV 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 15:14" />Lu'siku' lwa munane, yi'lamudime alete mapu'u'la av'i'li' ninga makune ga nkunda av'i'li' ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, na ku'mupa muhozya. <verse eid="LEV 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 15:15" />Nawe muhozya alagafumye, li'mo li'v'e ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi, na li'ngi' li'v'e ki'taambo cha ku'zigya. Ku' nzi'la yeni'yi' alav'e wamuv'ezezya wu'swanano ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ku'nguno ya wu'fila wakwe.<verse eid="LEV 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 15:16" />“ ‘Ki'la mugosya u'yo zilamufume mbiyu' zyakwe, yi'lamudime oge muv'i'li' gose mu minzi' nawe alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'. <verse eid="LEV 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 15:17" />Ki'la ki'zwalo ninga ki'la ndi'li' i'yo yi'lakuumiwe na mbiyu' zya ki'gosya vilakanzwe ku' minzi', navyo vilav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'. <verse eid="LEV 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 15:18" />U'lu' mugosya alale na muki'ma, na ku'fumya mbiyu' zyakwe, yi'lav'adime v'ose v'av'i'li' v'oge mu minzi', nav'o v'alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'.<verse eid="LEV 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 15:19" />“ ‘Ki'la muki'ma u'yo alav'e ali' ku' nsiku' zyakwe, alav'e na zoma ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati'. Ki'la muntu' u'yo alamukuumye muki'ma mwenu'yo alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'.<verse eid="LEV 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 15:20" />“ ‘Ki'la ki'ntu' i'cho alalali'le ninga ku'kikali'la ku' itungo lya ku' nsiku' zyakwe, ki'lav'e na zoma. <verse eid="LEV 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 15:21" />Ki'la muntu' u'yo alawu'kuumye wu'li'li' wa muki'ma mwenu'yo, yi'lamudime avikanze vizwalo vyakwe, na koga mu minzi', nawe alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'. <verse eid="LEV 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 15:22" />U'yo alakuumye ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo i'cho muki'ma mwenu'yo wakakikali'la, yi'lamudime avikanze vizwalo vyakwe, na koga mu minzi', nawe alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'. <verse eid="LEV 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 15:23" />Yi'v'e wu'li'li' ninga ki'ntu' ki'mo i'cho wakakikali'la muki'ma mwenu'yo, u'yo alaki'kuumye alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'.<verse eid="LEV 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 15:24" />“ ‘U'lu' mugosya alale na muki'ma u'yo ali' ku' nsiku' zyakwe na magazi gamukuumye mugosya mwenu'yo, hohene mugosya mwenu'yo alav'e na zoma ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati'. Ki'la wu'li'li' u'wo alawikali'le mwenu'yo wu'lav'e na zoma.<verse eid="LEV 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 15:25" />“ ‘Muki'ma u'yo alav'e ali'fuma magazi gakwe ku' nsiku' nyingi ku'ki'la i'vyo yi'li'v'aga ku' wakwe, ninga ali'fuma magazi ku' itungo ilihu i'lo li'kav'ile lya nsiku' zyakwe, nsiku' zyeni'zyo zyose alav'e na zoma ki'ti' i'vyo ali'v'aga ha itungo lya ku' nsiku' zyakwe. <verse eid="LEV 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 15:26" />Ki'la wu'li'li' u'wo alav'e ali'lali'la ninga i'cho alav'e ali'wikali'la mu itungo lyeni'lo lya ku'fuma magazi ki'lav'e na zoma, ki'ti' i'vyo yi'li'v'aga ha itungo lya nsiku' zyakwe zya zoma. <verse eid="LEV 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 15:27" />Muntu' u'yo alavikuumye vintu' vyeni'vyo alav'e na zoma na yi'lamudime avikanze vizwalo vyakwe, na koga mu minzi', nawe alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'.<verse eid="LEV 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 15:28" />“ ‘Ali'vi muki'ma mwenu'yo u'lu' magazi galeke ku'fuma, yi'lamudime av'azye nsiku' mupungati', haho alav'e wasosoka. <verse eid="LEV 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 15:29" />Lu'siku' lwa munane alasole mapu'u'la av'i'li' ninga makune av'i'li' ga nkunda, na ku'mufili'la muhozya bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. <verse eid="LEV 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 15:30" />Nawe muhozya alali'fumye li'mo ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi, na lya wu'v'i'li' ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'zigya. I'vi hu' vyene muhozya alamuv'ezezye wu'swanano ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ku'nguno ya zoma ya ku'fuma magazi gakwe.<verse eid="LEV 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 15:31" />“ ‘I'vi hu' vyene mulav'e muli'v'akoma V'aizilaeli ku'fuma ku' zoma yav'o, ki'gele ku'du' v'ali'v'ezezye zoma Ihema lyanne Isondo, i'lo li'li' hagati' nav'o, na ku'fwa ku' zoma yav'o.<verse eid="LEV 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 15:32" />“ ‘Yeni'yo hu' nhama ku'nguno ya mugosya wa ku'fuma wu'fila, na u'yo zili'mufume mbiyu' zyakwe na ku'muv'ezya av'e na zoma, <verse eid="LEV 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 15:33" />na ku'nguno ya muki'ma u'yo alav'e ali' ku' nsiku' zyakwe. Yaani, av'e mugosya ninga muki'ma u'yo ali'fuma ki'ntu' i'cho ki'li'yela. Hangi' yi'li' ku' u'yo alalale na muki'ma u'yo ali' na zoma ya magazi gakwe.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LEV 16" />
  <para style="s">Lu'siku' lwa wu'swanano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 16:1" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wayombaga na Mose, aho ndi' v'afwa av'o v'ana v'av'i'li' v'amwa Aloni, ha itungo i'lo ndi' v'egela ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 16:2" />Wamuwi'laga ati', “Muwi'le mudu'gu'yo Aloni, ku'du' ize av'e ali'wingi'la Hantu' Hasondo Muno ku' itungo i'lo li'kakoov'iwa, ha nnuma na muki'ngo ha mbele ya nfundi' ya wu'swanano, i'yo yi'li' ha igu'lya na isandi'ko lya ilagano, ki'gele ku'du' ize afwe, ku'nguno ene ndav'age nu'wigelisya mugati' na ilunde ha igu'lya na nfundi' yeni'yo ya wu'swanano.<verse eid="LEV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 16:3" />“Aloni aho alav'e ali'wingi'la ha Hantu' Hasondo Muno yi'lamudime ku'fumya vintu' i'vi mbela: ng'ombe nzagamba ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi na ng'ondi ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'zigya. <verse eid="LEV 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 16:4" />Aloge minzi' muv'i'li' gose, haho alavizwale i'vyo vizwalo visondo vya katani. Alazwale nhanzo nsondo, vizwalo vya mugati', isimangi'la, na kwitunga mukwato. <verse eid="LEV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 16:5" />Hangi' alasole ngulati' iv'i'li' ku'fuma ku' iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi, na ng'ondi yi'mo ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'zigya.<verse eid="LEV 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 16:6" />“Aloni alayi'fumye ng'ombe nzagamba ku'v'a ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi ku'nguno yakwe mweni'ki'li', na ku'v'ezya wu'swanano ku'nguno yakwe mweni'ki'li' na ku'nguno ya mugana gwakwe. <verse eid="LEV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 16:7" />Hangi' alazisole i'zyo ngulati' iv'i'li' na ku'zitu'u'la ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. <verse eid="LEV 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 16:8" />Nawe alese kav'ale ha igu'lya na i'zyo mbu'li iv'i'li', yi'mo ku'nguno yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu na yi'ngi' ku'nguno ya ku'somba wu'kenagu'zi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ku' Ki'ebulania i'yo mbu'li yi'ngi' yi'li' “ku'nguno ya Azazeli.” V'angi' mugati' na v'asomi v'ali'sani'zya ku'v'a Azazeli li'li' lina lya mugawo.</char></note>. <verse eid="LEV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 16:9" />Haho Aloni alayi'lete ngulati' i'yo yi'lav'e yagwi'lagwa kav'ale ku'nguno yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, na ku'yi'fumya yi'v'e ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi. <verse eid="LEV 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 16:10" />Ali'vi ngulati' i'yo yi'lav'e yagwi'lagwa kav'ale ku'nguno ya ku'somba wu'kenagu'zi yi'laletwe ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ku'no yi'li' mpanga, ki'gele ku'v'ezya wu'swanano ku' ku'yi'leku'li'la yi'ye ku' ibalangu' ku'no yi'wu'sombile wu'kenagu'zi.<verse eid="LEV 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 16:11" />“Nawe Aloni alayi'lete ng'ombe nzagamba ku'v'a ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi wakwe mweni'ki'li', na ku'v'ezya wu'swanano ku'nguno yakwe na mugana gwakwe, nawe alayi'si'nze yeni'yo ng'ombe ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi wakwe. <verse eid="LEV 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 16:12" />Hangi' alasole ki'tezo i'cho chokalile makala ga moto ago gafumile ha ihozezyo i'lo li'li' ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, na viganza viv'i'li' vya wu'bani wu'motu u'wo wu'siv'ilwe, na ku'vifila ha nnuma na muki'ngo gwa mugati'. <verse eid="LEV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 16:13" />Hangi' alawu'ti'ti'le wu'bani wenu'wo ha igu'lya na u'go moto ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ki'gele lyonsi lya wu'bani wenu'wo li'yi'si'gani'zye nfundi' ya wu'swanano i'yo yi'li' ha igu'lya na isandi'ko lya wu'sangi'lwa, ki'gele ku'du' afwe. <verse eid="LEV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 16:14" />Alasole na lwandi' lwa magazi ga i'yo ng'ombe nzagamba ku' lyala lyakwe, na ku'ganyanyagi'la ha mbele ha igu'lya na nfundi' ya wu'swanano, hangi' alanyanyagi'le ha mbele ya nfundi' ya wu'swanano ku' lyala lyakwe kali' mupungati'.<verse eid="LEV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 16:15" />“Hangi' alayi'si'nze i'yo ngulati' ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi ku'nguno ya v'antu' v'ose. Magazi ga ngulati' yeni'yo alagingi'zye mugati' na muki'ngo gwa mugati', na av'ezye ki'ti' i'vyo wav'ezyaga magazi ga i'yo ng'ombe nzagamba, na ku'nyanyagi'la ha igu'lya na nfundi' ya wu'swanano, na ha mbele yalyo. <verse eid="LEV 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 16:16" />I'vi hu' vyene alahasosohye Hantu' Hasondo Muno, ku'nguno ya zoma ya V'aizilaeli, mahu'v'yo gav'o, na wu'kenagu'zi wav'o wose. Hangi' alav'ezye vyeni'vyo ku'nguno ya Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, i'lo li'li' mugati' nav'o av'o v'ali' na zoma. <verse eid="LEV 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 16:17" />Muntu' ninga yu'mo akazumi'ziwa ku'v'a mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya ha itungo i'lo Aloni alav'e ali'wingi'la Hantu' Hasondo Muno ku'v'ezya wu'swanano, mpaka aho alav'e wafuma ha ibala, aho alav'e wamali'la ku'v'ezya wu'swanano ku'nguno yakwe mweni'ki'li', mugana gwakwe haki'mo na iv'ilingano lyose lya V'aizilaeli.<verse eid="LEV 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 16:18" />“Haho alafume ha ibala na ihema ha ihozezyo i'lo li'li' ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, na ku'li'sosohya. Alasole lwandi' lwa magazi ga ng'ombe nzagamba na lwandi' lwa magazi ga ngulati', na ku'v'ila ku' mapembe ga ihozezyo ku' ki'la lwandi'. <verse eid="LEV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 16:19" />Hangi' magazi genago alaganyanyagi'le ha igu'lya na ihozezyo lyeni'lo kali' mupungati' ku' ku'tu'mi'la lyala lyakwe, na alali'sosohye na ku'li'sondohya ku'fuma ku' zoma ya V'aizilaeli.<verse eid="LEV 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 16:20" />“Nawe u'lu' wamali'la ku'hasosohya Hantu' Hasondo Muno, Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya na ihozezyo, haho alayi'lete i'yo ngulati' mpanga ya ku'somba wu'kenagu'zi. <verse eid="LEV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 16:21" />Nawe Aloni alatu'u'le makono gakwe av'i'li' ha igu'lya na mutwe gwa ngulati' yeni'yo mpanga, na ku'v'isu'la ha igu'lya yayo wu'kenagu'zi wose na mahu'v'yo gose ga V'aizilaeli, na ku'tu'u'la wu'kenagu'zi wav'o wose ha igu'lya na mutwe gwa ngulati' yeni'yo. Haho alayi'leku'li'le yi'ye ku' ibalangu' ku' ku'filwa na muntu' u'yo wapiv'ilwe wangali'zi wa muli'mo gwenu'go. <verse eid="LEV 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 16:22" />Mbu'li yeni'yo yi'lawu'sombe ha igu'lya yayo wu'kenagu'zi wav'o wose, mpaka ku' lwandi' u'lo lu'li' wu'du'hu' v'antu', na muntu' mwenu'yo alayi'leku'li'le yi'ye ku' ibalangu'.<verse eid="LEV 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 16:23" />“Aloni alaingi'le hangi' mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, nawe alavizule vizwalo vyakwe vya katani, i'vyo ndi' wazwalaga aho ali'wingi'la Hantu' Hasondo Muno, na ku'vileka mwenu'mo. <verse eid="LEV 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 16:24" />Aloge mu minzi' mwenu'mo mugati' na lu'gu'tu' lwa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, na ku'zwala vizwalo vyakwe vingi'. Haho alafume na ku'fumya ki'taambo cha ku'zigya ku'nguno yakwe, na ki'taambo cha ku'zigya ku'nguno ya V'aizilaeli, ki'gele ku'v'ezya wu'swanano ku'nguno yakwe na ku'nguno ya v'antu' v'ose. <verse eid="LEV 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 16:25" />Hangi' maguta ga ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi alagazigye ha igu'lya na ihozezyo.<verse eid="LEV 16:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 16:26" />“Muntu' u'yo mwangali'zi wa ku'yi'fila i'yo ngulati' ya ku'somba wu'kenagu'zi, yi'lamudime avikanze vizwalo vyakwe na koga mu minzi', haho akowolile kwingi'la mu nkambi'. <verse eid="LEV 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 16:27" />I'yo ng'ombe nzagamba haki'mo na i'yo ngulati', i'zyo zyafumiwa ku'nguno ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi, i'zyo magazi gazyo ndi' gafilwa ha Hantu' Hasondo Muno ki'gele ku'v'ezya wu'swanano, yi'li'koov'iwa zifumiwe ha ibala na nkambi'. Ndi'li' zyazyo, nyama zyazyo, haki'mo na wu'se wazyo, vyose vitimwe. <verse eid="LEV 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 16:28" />Muntu' u'yo alavitime yi'lamudime avikanze vizwalo vyakwe na koga mu minzi', haho akowolile kwingi'la mu nkambi'.<verse eid="LEV 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 16:29" />“Nhama yeni'yi' yi'ku'v'a ya nhananhana. Lu'siku' lwa iku'mi lwa mwezi gwa mupungati' yi'lamudime ku'hangamyoyo, ku'du' mwize mutu'mame muli'mo ninga gu'mo, inywe, muv'anda ninga mugeni mwizi'li'zi u'yo ikalile mugati' na inywe. <verse eid="LEV 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 16:30" />Mulav'ezye vyeni'vyo ku'nguno lu'siku' lwenu'lo wu'swanano wu'lav'eziwe ku'nguno yinywe, ki'gele ku'musosohya. Haho mulasosoke wu'kenagu'zi winywe wose ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 16:31" />Lwenu'lo lu'li' lu'siku' lwa ku'lenda, na yi'li'mudima ku'hangamyoyo. Nhama yeni'yi' yi'ku'v'a ya nhananhana. <verse eid="LEV 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 16:32" />Hangi' ki'la muhozya muhanya u'yo asimi'kilwe ki'gele ikali'le isumbi' lya wu'hozya lyamwa ise, alav'ezyage wu'swanano wenu'wo ku'no azwalile vizwalo i'vyo visondo vya katani. <verse eid="LEV 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 16:33" />Alasosohyage Hantu' Hasondo Muno, Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya haki'mo na ihozezyo, na ku'v'ezya wu'swanano ku'nguno ya v'ahozya haki'mo na iv'ilingano lyose lya V'aizilaeli. <verse eid="LEV 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 16:34" />Nhama yeni'yi' yi'ku'v'a ya nhananhana ku' winywe. Wu'swanano wenu'wu' wu'lav'eziv'agwe kali' kamo ku' ki'la mwaka ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi wose wa V'aizilaeli.” Haho gav'ezyekaga gose ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye Mose.<verse eid="LEV 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LEV 17" />
  <para style="s">Ki'si'nzi'le cha ndimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 17:1" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', <verse eid="LEV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 17:2" />“V'awi'le Aloni, v'ana v'akwe haki'mo na V'aizilaeli v'ose ati', ‘U'gu' hu' mulagi' u'go walagi'li'zizye Gu'ku' Mulungu: <verse eid="LEV 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 17:3" />Ki'la Muizilaeli u'yo alasi'nze ki'taambo, ki'v'e cha ng'ombe, kadi'lana ka nkolo ninga mbu'li, mugati' na nkambi' ninga ha ibala na nkambi', <verse eid="LEV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 17:4" />na aleke ku'ki'leta ha muzigo gwa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ha mbele ya Ihema lyakwe Isondo, muntu' mwenu'yo alav'aziwe ku'v'a na musango gwa kwita magazi. Yi'lamudime akomwe na iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli. <verse eid="LEV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 17:5" />Nhama yeni'yi' yi'li' ki'gele V'aizilaeli v'amuletele Gu'ku' Mulungu vitaambo vyav'o i'vyo v'ali'v'a v'ali'si'nzi'la mu migu'nda. Yi'li'v'adima v'av'e v'ali'vileta ku' v'ahozya, yaani ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, ki'gele v'avisi'nze viv'e vitaambo vya kwiswanania ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 17:6" />Nawe muhozya alaganyanyagi'le magazi gavyo ha igu'lya na ihozezyo lyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu i'lo li'li' bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, na ku'gazigya maguta gavyo, ki'gele gav'e wu'motu wa ku'mutogezya Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 17:7" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo V'aizilaeli v'alapele wu'li'ko ku'fumya vitaambo ku' vimbulimbuli vya mbu'li i'vyo v'ali'v'ezya navyo wu'lav'a. Yeni'yi' yi'ku'v'a nhama ya nhananhana ku' wu'v'yalwa wav'o u'wo wu'lalonde.’<verse eid="LEV 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 17:8" />“Nanho u'lav'awi'le ati', ‘Ki'la muntu' mugati' na V'aizilaeli, ninga mugati' na v'ageni v'izi'li'zi, u'yo alafumye ki'taambo cha ku'zigya ninga ki'taambo ki'ngi', <verse eid="LEV 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 17:9" />bila ku'leta ha wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, ki'gele ku'fumya ki'taambo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, yi'lamudime muntu' mwenu'yo akomwe na iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli.<verse eid="LEV 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 17:10" />“ ‘Hangi' muntu' ninga yu'mo mugati' na V'aizilaeli, ninga mugati' na v'ageni v'izi'li'zi, u'yo alalye nyama ya magazi ga ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo, ene ndamupe nkonya muntu' mwenu'yo na ku'mukoma na iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli. <verse eid="LEV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 17:11" />Ku'nguno wu'zuwu'ku wa ki'tundwa wu'li' mu magazi nanne namulagi'li'zizye kwiti'la magazi ha igu'lya na ihozezyo ki'gele ku'v'ezya wu'swanano ku'nguno ya myoyo zinywe. Magazi gali'v'ezya wu'swanano ku'nguno wu'zuwu'ku wu'li' mu magazi. <verse eid="LEV 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 17:12" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo nu'v'alagi'li'zya V'aizilaeli i'vi: Muntu' ninga yu'mo mugati' nav'o, ninga mugati' na v'ageni v'izi'li'zi av'o v'ikalile nav'o, nhana ku'du' ize alye nyama ya magazi.<verse eid="LEV 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 17:13" />“ ‘Ki'la muntu' mugati' na V'aizilaeli, ninga mugati' na v'ageni av'o v'ikalile nav'o, u'yo alav'ende ndimu ninga nnoni i'yo yi'zumi'ziv'ilwe ku'liwa, yi'li'mudima agite magazi na ku'gatuli'la ku' wu'longo. <verse eid="LEV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 17:14" />Ku'nguno wu'zuwu'ku wa ki'la ki'tundwa wu'li' mu magazi gacho. Hene nav'alagi'li'zizye V'aizilaeli ati', nhana ku'du' mwize mulye nyama ya magazi ga ki'tundwa ninga ki'mo. U'yo alagalye yi'lamudime akomwe na iv'ilingano.<verse eid="LEV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 17:15" />“ ‘Hangi' ki'la muntu', av'e muv'anda ninga mugeni mwizi'li'zi, u'yo alalye nyama ninga yi'mo ya wifwi'le ninga i'yo yi'tandagu'lilwe na ndimu, yi'lamudime avikanze vizwalo vyakwe, na koga mu minzi', nawe alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi', haho alav'e wasosoka <verse eid="LEV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 17:16" />Ali'vi u'lu' aleke ku'vikanza vizwalo vyakwe na koga, haho yi'lamudime ku'wu'somba wu'kenagu'zi wakwe.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LEV 18" />
  <para style="s">Igizyo lya magambo mav'i ga wu'kwele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 18:1" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', <verse eid="LEV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 18:2" />“V'awi'le v'ana v'a Izilaeli, ‘Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe. <verse eid="LEV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 18:3" />Ku'du' muv'e muli'v'ezya magambo ki'ti' ago ga ku' nsi' ya Misili, u'ko mwav'age mwikalile, ninga ku'du' muv'e muli'v'ezya magambo ki'ti' ago ku' nsi' ya Kanaani, i'yo ndamufile. Nhana ku'du' mwize mulonde ki'ti'le chav'o. <verse eid="LEV 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 18:4" />Ali'vi inywe yi'li'mudima muziku'zye nzi'la zyanne, na ku'zidima nhama zyanne, ki'gele ku'zilonda. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe. <verse eid="LEV 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 18:5" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo, muzidime nhama zyanne na nzi'la zyanne. U'yo alazidime alav'e na wu'zuwu'ku. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="LEV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 18:6" />“ ‘Muntu' ninga yu'mo ku'du' ize amwegele mwiye wa igongo lyakwe lya bi'hi' ki'gele alale nawe. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="LEV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 18:7" />“ ‘Ku'du' u'muv'i'nzi'le isima so ku' ku'lala na nnoko wa ku'ku'v'yala, ku'nguno mwenu'yo ali' nnoko. Ku'du' u'lale nawe.<verse eid="LEV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 18:8" />“ ‘Ku'du' u'lale na muki' wamwa so, ku' ku'v'ezya vyeni'vi yi'li' ku'muv'i'nzi'la isima so.<verse eid="LEV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 18:9" />“ ‘Ku'du' u'lale na ilu'mbu'yo, mwaniki' mwana wamwa so ninga wamwa nnoko, av'e wa ku'v'yali'lwa mu lu'go lwinywe ninga ku'ngi'.<verse eid="LEV 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 18:10" />“ ‘Ku'du' u'lale na mwizu'ku'lu' wako, mwaniki' wa ku'v'yalwa na mwana wako, ku'nguno u'li'wiv'i'nzi'la isima ev'e mweni'ki'li'.<verse eid="LEV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 18:11" />“ ‘Ku'du' wize u'lale na ilu'mbu'yo wa ku'v'yalwa na muki' wamwa so. Mwenu'yo ali' ilu'mbu'yo.<verse eid="LEV 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 18:12" />“ ‘Ku'du' u'lale na sengiyo. Mwenu'yo ali' mudu'gu' wa bi'hi' ku'mwa so.<verse eid="LEV 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 18:13" />“ ‘Ku'du' u'lale na muku'lu'ye ninga muzunaye na nnoko. Mwenu'yo ali' mudu'gu' wa bi'hi' ku'mwa nnoko.<verse eid="LEV 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 18:14" />“ ‘Ku'du' u'muv'i'nzi'le isima so muhanya ninga mudo ku' ku'lala na muki' wakwe. Mwenu'yo ali' nnoko.<verse eid="LEV 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 18:15" />“ ‘Ku'du' u'lale na mukamwano, ku'nguno ali' muki' wa mwano.<verse eid="LEV 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 18:16" />“ ‘Ku'du' u'lale na mukwelayo, muki' wa muku'lu'yo ninga muzunayo. U'lamuv'i'nzi'le isima mudu'gu'yo.<verse eid="LEV 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 18:17" />“ ‘Ku'du' u'lale na muki'ma haki'mo na mwana wakwe, ninga mwizu'ku'lu' wakwe wa ku'v'yalwa na mwana wakwe. V'enav'o v'ali' v'adu'gu' v'akwe v'a bi'hi'. Lyeni'lo li'li' ihu'v'yo.<verse eid="LEV 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 18:18" />“ ‘Nhana ku'du' wize u'mutoole muki'ma haki'mo na muku'lu'ye ninga muzunaye ku'v'a mutoolwa mwiye, na ku'lala nawe ku'no mudu'gu'ye akaali' ali'zuwu'ka.<verse eid="LEV 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 18:19" />“ ‘Ku'du' u'mwegele muki'ma ki'gele u'lale nawe ku'no akaali' ali' na zoma ya ku' nsiku' zyakwe. <verse eid="LEV 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 18:20" />Ku'du' u'lale na muki' wa mwiyo, ku'nguno u'lav'e witu'u'li'la zoma ku' wakwe.<verse eid="LEV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 18:21" />“ ‘Ku'du' u'mufumye mwana wako ninga yu'mo, av'e ki'taambo ku'mwa mulungu Moleki, ku'nguno ku'v'ezya vyeni'vyo u'lav'e wali'yagazya lina lyamwa Mulungu wako. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="LEV 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 18:22" />“ ‘Ku'du' u'lale na mugosya mwiyo ki'ti' i'vyo u'li'lalaga na muki'ma. Lyeni'lo li'li' igayi'li'zyo.<verse eid="LEV 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 18:23" />“ ‘Ku'du' u'lale na ndimu ninga yi'mo, na kwitu'u'li'la zoma ku' wayo, ninga muki'ma ku'du' ifile ha mbele ya ndimu ki'gele alale nayo. Wenu'wo wu'li' wu'v'ipya.<verse eid="LEV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 18:24" />“ ‘Ku'du' mwize mwiv'ezezye zoma ninga yi'mo mugati' na magambo genaga, ku'nguno makabi'la ago ndagasage ha mbele yinywe gali' na zoma ku'nguno ya ku'v'ezya magambo genaga. <verse eid="LEV 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 18:25" />Ku'nguno ninga nsi' yav'o yatu'u'li'lilwe zoma, hene nanne nayi'li'pi'ki'zizye wu'kenagu'zi wayo, nayo yav'alu'kile v'ikazi v'ayo. <verse eid="LEV 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 18:26" />Ali'vi inywe yi'li'mudima muzidime nhama zyanne na nzi'la zyanne. Muv'anda ninga mugeni mwizi'li'zi u'yo ikalile mugati' na inywe, nhana ku'du' av'ezye igayi'li'zyo ninga li'mo mugati' na genaga. <verse eid="LEV 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 18:27" />Ku'nguno magayi'li'zyo gose genaga gav'eziv'agwe na v'antu' av'o ndi' v'ikalile mu nsi' ya Kanaani aho mukaali' inywe, na ku'yi'tu'u'li'la nsi' yeni'yo zoma. <verse eid="LEV 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 18:28" />U'lu' mwize muyi'tu'u'li'le zoma nsi', yi'lamulu'ke ki'ti' i'vyo yav'alu'ka v'a makabi'la av'o ndi' v'atongela aho mukaali' inywe.<verse eid="LEV 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 18:29" />“ ‘Ki'la muntu' u'yo alav'ezye igayi'li'zyo mugati' na magambo genaga, muntu' mwenu'yo yi'li'mudima akomwe na iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli. <verse eid="LEV 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 18:30" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo muyi'doonoke nhama yanne, ku'v'a ku'du' mulonde ki'ti'le ninga ki'mo cha igayi'li'zyo i'lo lyav'eziv'agwe aho ndi' mukaali' ku'fika mu nsi' yeni'yi', ki'gele ku'du' mwitu'u'li'le zoma ku' genago. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LEV 19" />
  <para style="s">Wu'sondo na milagi' hekeheke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 19:1" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, <verse eid="LEV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 19:2" />“U'yombe na iv'ilingano lyose lya V'aizilaeli u'v'awi'le ati', ‘Yi'li'mudima muv'e v'asondo, ku'nguno ene Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe, ni' musondo.<verse eid="LEV 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 19:3" />“ ‘Ki'la muntu' mugati' na inywe yi'li'mudima amuku'zye ise na nnina, na yi'li'mudima ku'zidima nsiku' zya ki'suuho i'zyo zili' Sabato zyanne. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe.<verse eid="LEV 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 19:4" />“ ‘Ku'du' mugalu'ke ku'vilonda vimbulimbuli, ninga ku'du' mwiv'ezezye milungu zya ku'sula. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe.<verse eid="LEV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 19:5" />“ ‘Ali'vi aho mulav'e muli'nfumi'zya ene Gu'ku' Mulungu ki'taambo cha kwiswanania, mulafumye ku' nzi'la i'yo yi'li'koov'iwa ki'gele ki'zumiwe. <verse eid="LEV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 19:6" />Ki'taambo cheni'cho yi'li'koov'iwa ki'liwe lu'siku' lwene lu'lo u'lo mulav'e mwaki'si'nzaga ninga lu'siku' lwa wu'v'i'li'. Ali'vi ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo cha ki'taambo cheni'cho i'cho ki'lasigali'le mpaka lu'siku' lwa wu'datu' yi'lamudime muki'zigye mu moto. <verse eid="LEV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 19:7" />U'lu' ki'taambo cheni'cho kize ki'liwe ninga hadoo ku' lu'siku' lwa wu'datu', ki'lav'e zoma, nacho ki'kasye ki'zumiwe, <verse eid="LEV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 19:8" />nawe u'yo alalye nyama yeni'yo alawu'sombe wu'kenagu'zi wakwe, ku'nguno alav'e waki'yagazya ki'ntu' ki'sondo chamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Yi'lamudime muntu' mwenu'yo akomwe na iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli.<verse eid="LEV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 19:9" />“ ‘Aho mulav'e muli'wi'mbu'la viliwa ku'fuma ku' nsi' yinywe, ku'du' mwize muv'e muli'wi'mbu'la mpaka ku' lu'v'i'mbi', ninga ku'du' mwize musu'v'e ku'salala nsalazyo. <verse eid="LEV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 19:10" />Ku'du' mwize muv'e muli'su'v'a ku'kuminga nsalazyo ya mizabibu zinywe, ninga ku'solela nzabibu i'zyo zigwile ha nsi'. Mulazilekele ku'nguno ya v'api'na na v'ageni v'izi'li'zi. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe.<verse eid="LEV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 19:11" />“ ‘Ku'du' wiv'e, ku'du' u'yombe wu'fi, ninga ku'du' muv'e muli'wikonga.<verse eid="LEV 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 19:12" />“ ‘Ku'du' u'lahi'le ku' wu'fi ku' ku'tu'mi'la lina lyanne, na ku'li'yagazya lina lyamwa Mulungu wako. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="LEV 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 19:13" />“ ‘Ku'du' u'mwiwonelezye mwiyo ninga ku'mupuzya nsawo yakwe. Wu'tenensya wa musyala wako ku'du' wikale ku' wako wu'ziku'pee mpaka ndiyu'.<verse eid="LEV 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 19:14" />“ ‘Ku'du' u'mutyomokele nkiv'a, ninga ku'pi'ngani'ka ki'ntu' ha mbele ya muhofu, ali'vi yi'li'ku'dima u'mogohe Mulungu wako. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu wako.<verse eid="LEV 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 19:15" />“ ‘Ku'du' u'nyonganie lole aho u'li'fumya wu'yangu'. Ku'du' u'v'ezye wu'hegela ku' mupi'na ninga ku'muku'zya muntu' muhanya. Ali'vi u'v'ezye wu'yangu' wa lole ku' mwiyo.<verse eid="LEV 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 19:16" />“ ‘Ku'du' u'sambazye mihayo ya wu'songania mugati' na v'antu' v'ako. Ku'du' u'yombe muhayo ninga gu'mo ha iv'anza u'go gu'kowolile ku'mulengela lu'fu muntu' wa lole. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="LEV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 19:17" />“ ‘Ku'du' u'mutu'u'li'le nsika mwiyo mu moyo gwako. Ali'vi yi'li'ku'dima u'muhame ku' katwipandu' ki'gele u'leke ku'v'a mu wu'kenagu'zi wakwe.<verse eid="LEV 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 19:18" />“ ‘Ku'du' wili'pi'ki'zye ninga ku'tu'u'la igundo ku' yu'mo mugati' na v'antu' v'ako, sumbwa yi'li'ku'dima u'mutogwe u'yo ali' bi'hi' nanho ki'ti' i'vyo witogilwe ev'e mweni'ki'li'. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="LEV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 19:19" />“ ‘Yi'li'ku'dima u'zidime nhama zyanne. Ku'du' wize u'zileke mitugo zyako ziliinwe na mitugo zya mukoli gu'ngi'. Ku'du' wize u'hambe mbiyu' zya mikoli iv'i'li' mu mugu'nda gwako. Ku'du' wize u'v'e u'li'zwala ki'zwalo i'cho ki'sumilwe ku' mikoli iv'i'li' zya wu'zi hekeheke.<verse eid="LEV 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 19:20" />“ ‘Hangi' u'lu' muntu' ninga yu'mo alale na muki'ma muzya u'yo akwiv'ilwe na mugosya yu'ngi', nawe akakomolilwe ku' ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo, ninga ku'leku'li'lwa iyagalu'le, yi'lamudime muntu' mwenu'yo afumiwe masumule. Ali'vi ku'du' v'awu'lagwe ku'nguno muki'ma mwenu'yo wali' akaali' ku'leku'li'lwa iyagalu'le. <verse eid="LEV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 19:21" />Mugosya mwenu'yo yi'lamudime alete ng'ondi ayi'fumye ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya yi'v'e ki'taambo cha masumule gakwe cha ku'sini'zya musango. <verse eid="LEV 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 19:22" />Nawe muhozya alamuv'ezezye wu'swanano ku'v'i'ti'la ku' ng'ondi yeni'yo ya ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya musango ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi u'wo wawu'v'ezizye, nawe alatondolwe.<verse eid="LEV 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 19:23" />“ ‘Aho mulav'e mwingi'la ku' nsi' i'yo ya Kanaani na ku'hamba mikoli hekeheke zya miti' zya visumo, mulaviv'azye visumo vyazyo ku'v'a vigiziv'ilwe. Ku' itungo lya myaka idatu' miti' zyeni'zyo zilav'e ki'ti' igizyo na visumo vyazyo vikasye viliwe. <verse eid="LEV 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 19:24" />Ku' mwaka gwa wu'ne visumo vyazyo vyose vilav'e visondo, ku'nguno ya kalu'mbi'lo ka lu'kumo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 19:25" />Sumbwa mwaka gwa wu'tano mukowolile ku'lya visumo vyazyo. Ku' nzi'la yeni'yi' lyi'mbu'la linywe li'lingi'he. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe.<verse eid="LEV 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 19:26" />“ ‘Ku'du' mwize mulye nyama ninga yi'mo ya wu'su'lu'le magazi. Ku'du' mwize muv'ezye wu'lagu'zi ninga wu'fumu.<verse eid="LEV 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 19:27" />“ ‘Ku'du' musenye nyele mu mpelo na mitwe, ninga ku'senya ndezu mu mpelo mpelo. <verse eid="LEV 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 19:28" />Ninga ku'du' mwisalange mu miv'i'li' zinywe, ninga kwiola mu miv'i'li' zinywe ku'nguno ya v'afwile. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="LEV 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 19:29" />“ ‘Ku'du' u'muyagazye mwaniki' wako ku' ku'muv'ezya mulav'a, ki'gele nsi' ku'du' yize yi'galu'ki'le ku' wu'lav'a na kokala wu'kenagu'zi wu'hanya.<verse eid="LEV 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 19:30" />“ ‘Yi'li'mudima muzidime nsiku' zya ki'suuho na ku'haku'zya hantu' hasondo ha wanne. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="LEV 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 19:31" />“ ‘Ku'du' muv'ayi'le v'a mizimu, ninga ku'v'alonda v'alagu'zi, ki'gele v'akamulagu'le, ku'nguno v'alamuv'ezezye zoma. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe.<verse eid="LEV 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 19:32" />“ ‘U'lu' munamala wa nvwi' av'e ha mbele yako yi'li'ku'dima wi'me ki'gele u'mupe iku'zyo lyakwe, nanho u'mogohe Mulungu wako. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="LEV 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 19:33" />“ ‘U'lu' mugeni mwizi'li'zi ikale haki'mo nanho mu nsi' yako, ku'du' u'muv'ezezye mav'i. <verse eid="LEV 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 19:34" />Mugeni u'yo ikalile haki'mo nanho av'e ki'ti' muv'yalwa wa ku' winywe, na u'mutogwe ki'ti' i'vi witogilwe ev'e mweni'ki'li', ku'nguno na inywe mwav'age muli' v'ageni ku' nsi' ya Misili. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe.<verse eid="LEV 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 19:35" />“ ‘Ku'du' u'tu'mi'le vipimo vya wu'yengani aho u'li'pima wu'lihu, wu'timbu ninga wingi. <verse eid="LEV 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 19:36" />Yi'li'ku'dima u'tu'mi'le mizani zya lole na ngelo zya lole<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ku' Ki'ebulania, “mizani zya lole, mawe ga lole, efa ya lole na hini ya lole.”</char></note>. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe, u'yo namufumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili.<verse eid="LEV 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 19:37" />“ ‘Yi'li'mudima muzidime nzi'la zyanne zyose na nhama zyanne zyose, na ku'zilonda. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 19:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LEV 20" />
  <para style="s">Lu'duko ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 20:1" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, <verse eid="LEV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 20:2" />“U'v'awi'le V'aizilaeli ati', ‘Ki'la muntu' mugati' na V'aizilaeli, ninga mugeni mwizi'li'zi u'yo ikalile mugati' na inywe, u'yo alamufumye mwana wakwe ninga yu'mo na ku'mupa kalu'mbi'lo mulungu Moleki, yi'li'mudima muntu' mwenu'yo awu'lagwe. V'antu' v'a iv'ilingano lyeni'lo v'alamuwu'lage ku' ku'mugu'ma na mawe. <verse eid="LEV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 20:3" />Nanne ndamupe nkonya muntu' mwenu'yo, na ku'musinia mu iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli. Ku'nguno ku' ku'mufumya yu'mo mugati' na v'ana v'akwe ku'mwa Moleki, alav'e wahav'ezezya zoma hantu' hasondo ha wanne, na ku'li'yagazya lina lyanne isondo. <verse eid="LEV 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 20:4" />Hangi' u'lu' iv'ilingano li'mulingi'li'lile du' muntu' mwenu'yo, aho ali'mufumya mwana wakwe ninga yu'mo ku'mwa Moleki, nav'o v'aleke ku'muwu'laga, <verse eid="LEV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 20:5" />ene mweni'ki'li' ndamupe nkonya muntu' mwenu'yo haki'mo na igongo lyakwe, nanne ndamukome na iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli, haki'mo na v'antu' v'enav'o v'ose av'o v'alamulonde ki'gele ku'kav'ezya wu'lav'a na Moleki.<verse eid="LEV 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 20:6" />“ ‘Hangi' u'lu' muntu' ninga yu'mo u'yo alav'ayi'le v'a mizimu na v'alagu'zi ku'kav'ezya wu'lav'a, ndamupe nkonya muntu' mwenu'yo, na ku'mukoma na iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli.<verse eid="LEV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 20:7" />“ ‘Yi'li'mudima mwisondohye, na inywe muv'e v'asondo, ku'nguno ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe. <verse eid="LEV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 20:8" />Muzidime nhama zyanne na ku'zilonda. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu wa ku'musondohya.<verse eid="LEV 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 20:9" />“ ‘U'lu' muntu' ninga yu'mo amutyomokele ise ninga nnina, yi'lamudime awu'lagwe. Wamutyomokelaga ise ninga nnina, na magazi gakwe galav'e ha igu'lya yakwe.<verse eid="LEV 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 20:10" />“ ‘U'lu' muntu' asihye na muki' wa muntu' mwiye, v'asihya v'enav'o v'av'i'li' yi'lav'adime v'awu'lagwe.<verse eid="LEV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 20:11" />“ ‘U'lu' muntu' alale na muki' wamwa ise, sanga wamuv'i'nzi'la isima ise. Mugosya mwenu'yo na muki'ma mwenu'yo v'ose v'av'i'li' yi'li'v'adima v'awu'lagwe, na magazi gav'o galav'e ha igu'lya yav'o.<verse eid="LEV 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 20:12" />“ ‘U'lu' muntu' alale na mukamwane, yi'lav'adime v'ose v'av'i'li' v'awu'lagwe. V'alav'e v'av'ezyaga wu'v'ipya, na magazi gav'o galav'e ha igu'lya yav'o.<verse eid="LEV 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 20:13" />“ ‘U'lu' mugosya alale na mugosya mwiye ki'ti' i'vyo ali'v'ezyaga ku' muki'ma, v'agosya v'enav'o v'alav'e v'av'ezya igayi'li'zyo. Yi'lav'adime v'awu'lagwe na magazi gav'o galav'e ha igu'lya yav'o.<verse eid="LEV 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 20:14" />“ ‘U'lu' muntu' atoole mwaniki' haki'mo na nnina, lyeni'lo li'li' ihu'v'yo. V'ose v'adatu' yi'lav'adime v'atimwe moto, ki'gele ku'du' ku'v'e na wu'kenagu'zi mugati' na inywe.<verse eid="LEV 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 20:15" />“ ‘U'lu' mugosya alale na ndimu, yi'lamudime awu'lagwe, hangi' ninga ndimu yeni'yo nayo yi'lawu'lagwe.<verse eid="LEV 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 20:16" />“ ‘U'lu' muki'ma ifile ha mbele na ndimu ki'gele alale nayo, yi'lamudime awu'lagwe, hangi' na ndimu yeni'yo yi'lawu'lagwe, na magazi gav'o galav'e ha igu'lya yav'o.<verse eid="LEV 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 20:17" />“ ‘U'lu' muntu' ninga yu'mo amutoole ilu'mbu'ye, mwaniki' mwana wamwa ise, ninga wamwa nnina, na kwikala haki'mo, lyeni'lo li'li' igambo lya nsoni. Yi'lav'adime v'akomwe ha minso ga iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli. Mugosya mwenu'yo walalaga na ilu'mbu'ye, yi'lamudime ku'wu'somba wu'kenagu'zi wakwe.<verse eid="LEV 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 20:18" />“ ‘U'lu' muntu' alale na muki'ma u'yo ali' ku' nsiku' zyakwe, v'ose v'av'i'li' v'alav'e v'av'isu'la magazi ga ku' nsiku' zyakwe. V'ose yi'lav'adime v'akomwe na iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli.<verse eid="LEV 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 20:19" />“ ‘Ku'du' u'lale na sengiyo ninga nnoko muhanya ninga nnoko mudo, ku'nguno v'enav'o v'ali' v'a igongo lya bi'hi' nanho. V'ose av'o v'alav'ezye vyeni'vyo yi'lav'adime ku'wu'somba wu'kenagu'zi wav'o.<verse eid="LEV 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 20:20" />“ ‘U'lu' muntu' alale na muki' lyamwa ise muhanya ninga mudo, sanga wamuv'i'nzi'la isima ise muhanya ninga mudo. V'ose v'av'i'li' yi'lav'adime ku'wu'somba wu'kenagu'zi wav'o, na v'alafwe bila ku'v'yala.<verse eid="LEV 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 20:21" />“ ‘U'lu' muntu' atoole muki' wa muku'lu'ye ninga muki' wa muzunaye, yeni'yo yi'li' zoma, sanga wamuv'i'nzi'la isima mudu'gu'ye. V'ose v'av'i'li' v'akasye v'av'yale.<verse eid="LEV 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 20:22" />“ ‘Muzidime nhama na nzi'la zyanne zyose, na ku'zidoonoka, ki'gele nsi' i'yo nu'mufila ku'du' yi'mulu'ke. <verse eid="LEV 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 20:23" />Nhana ku'du' mwikale ku' ku'londa ki'ti'le cha v'antu' v'a nsi' av'o nu'v'asaga ha mbele yinywe. Ku'nguno ndi' v'av'ezya magambo gose genaga, na ku'nguno ya genaga hene nav'agayile muno. <verse eid="LEV 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 20:24" />Ali'vi ene namuwi'lile inywe, mulayi'saale nsi' yav'o, nanne nu'mupa inywe ku'yi'tema nsi' ya lu'tongo i'yo yi'li'keneneka mav'eele na wu'ki'. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe, u'yo namukomile inywe ku'fuma ku' makabi'la gangi'.<verse eid="LEV 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 20:25" />“ ‘Ku'nguno yeni'yo, yi'li'mudima ku'mani'cha ndimu nsoso na zya zoma, hangi' na nnoni nsoso na zya zoma. Ku'du' mwiv'ezezye zoma ku'nguno ya ndimu ninga yi'mo, ninga nnoni, ninga vitundwa vido vido vya ku'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi', i'vyo navikomile ku'v'a vili' zoma ku'nguno yinywe. <verse eid="LEV 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 20:26" />Mulav'e v'asondo ku' wanne, ku'nguno ene Gu'ku' Mulungu ni' musondo, nanne namukomile inywe ku'fuma ku' makabi'la muv'e nsawo yanne.<verse eid="LEV 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 20:27" />“ ‘Hangi' mugosya ninga muki'ma u'yo ali' na mizimu, ninga mulagu'zi, nhana alawu'lagwe ku' ku'gu'mwa na mawe, na magazi gav'o galav'e ha igu'lya na mitwe zyav'o.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 20:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LEV 21" />
  <para style="s">Nhama ku'nguno ya wu'sondo wa v'ahozya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 21:1" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “U'v'awi'le v'ahozya, v'ana v'amwa Aloni v'a ki'gosya ati', ‘Muhozya ninga yu'mo ku'du' ize itu'u'li'le zoma ku' ku'kuumya mulambo gwa muntu' mugati' na v'a igongo lyakwe, <verse eid="LEV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 21:2" />sumbwa u'lu' gu'li' mulambo gwa mudu'gu'ye wa bi'hi' ki'ti' i'vi ise ninga nnina, mwana wakwe, ninga mudu'gu'ye wa ki'gosya, <verse eid="LEV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 21:3" />ninga mudu'gu'ye wa ki'ki'ma musimbe. Ku'nguno ali' wu'du'hu' mugosya wa ku'muzyi'ka, akowolile kwitu'u'li'la zoma ku'nguno yakwe. <verse eid="LEV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 21:4" />Muhozya ku'du' ize itu'u'li'le zoma mweni'ki'li' ku'nguno ya v'antu' av'o ali' bi'hi' nav'o ku' kwitoolela.<verse eid="LEV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 21:5" />“ ‘V'ahozya ku'du' v'amoge ki'pala ninga ku'moga mu mpelo ya ndezu zyav'o, ninga ku'sala nsale mu miv'i'li' zyav'o ku'nguno ya v'afwile. <verse eid="LEV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 21:6" />Yi'li'v'adima v'ahozya ku'v'a v'asondo ku'mwa Mulungu wav'o. V'aleke ku'li'yagazya lina lyamwa Mulungu wav'o, ku'nguno hu' v'ene v'ali'fumyaga kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, yaani kalu'mbi'lo ka viliwa ku'mwa Mulungu wav'o. Ku'nguno yeni'yo yi'li'v'adima ku'v'a v'asondo.<verse eid="LEV 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 21:7" />“ ‘Ku'du' v'atoole muki'ma wa zoma ya wu'lav'a, ninga u'yo walekilwe na mugosi, ku'nguno v'ahozya v'ali' v'asondo ku'mwa Mulungu wav'o. <verse eid="LEV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 21:8" />Muv'awone v'ahozya ku'v'a v'ali' v'asondo, ku'nguno hu' v'ene v'ali'fumyaga kalu'mbi'lo ka viliwa ku'mwa Mulungu winywe. V'alav'e v'asondo ku' winywe, ku'nguno ene, Gu'ku' Mulungu u'yo nu'musondohya inywe, ni' musondo.<verse eid="LEV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 21:9" />“ ‘U'lu' mwana wa ki'ki'ma wamwa muhozya av'ezye zoma ya wu'lav'a, sanga ali'mupondansoni ise. Yi'li'mudima atimwe mu moto.<verse eid="LEV 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 21:10" />“ ‘Muhozya muhanya mugati' na v'adu'gu'ye, u'yo wav'ililwe maguta ku' mutwe gwakwe na ku'simi'kwa ki'gele azwale vizwalo visondo, ku'du' azisalambanie nyele zyakwe ninga ku'zemula myenda zyakwe ku'nguno ya v'afwile. <verse eid="LEV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 21:11" />Ku'du' ingi'le u'mo gu'li'mo mulambo, na kwitu'u'li'la zoma ku'nguno yamwa ise ninga nnina. <verse eid="LEV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 21:12" />Ku'du' ize ahafume hantu' hasondo hamwa Mulungu wakwe, na ku'hatu'u'li'la zoma ku'nguno ya v'afwile, ku'nguno wasondohilwe ku' ku'v'ilwa maguta masondo gamwa Mulungu wakwe. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="LEV 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 21:13" />“ ‘Muhozya muhanya ali'koov'iwa ku'toola muki'ma u'yo akaali' ku'manya mugosya. <verse eid="LEV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 21:14" />Ku'du' ize atoole muki'ma u'yo afwi'lilwe mugosi, ninga wa ku'lekwa na mugosi, ninga mulav'a. Alatoole du' u'yo akaali' ku'manya mugosya na av'e wa ku'fuma mugati' na v'antu' v'a igongo lyakwe lya ki'hozya, <verse eid="LEV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 21:15" />ki'gele ku'du' ize av'atu'u'li'le zoma v'ana v'akwe mugati' na v'antu' v'a igongo lyakwe. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu wa ku'musondohya.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 21:16" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, <verse eid="LEV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 21:17" />“U'muwi'le Aloni ati', ‘Ku' wu'v'yalwa u'wo wizile, muv'yalwa wako u'yo alav'e na wu'lema akasye egele ha ihozezyo ku'fumya kalu'mbi'lo ka viliwa ku'mwa Mulungu wakwe. <verse eid="LEV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 21:18" />Muntu' ninga yu'mo wa wu'lema ku'du' egele: muhofu, wa ki'tewe, u'yo av'ipile wu'syu' ninga viv'alango vyakwe vikagelani'lile, <verse eid="LEV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 21:19" />u'yo avuni'kile mugu'lu' ninga mukono, <verse eid="LEV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 21:20" />ninga wa igonde, ninga u'yo akonile, ninga wa iv'elav'ela, ninga wa lu'kalawo ninga wu'lema wu'ngi' wa ndi'li', ninga u'yo avulali'kile mpese zya ki'gosya. <verse eid="LEV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 21:21" />Muv'yalwa wa muhozya Aloni u'yo ali' na wu'lema ninga wu'mo ku'du' ize egele ku'fumya kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, yaani kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo ku'mwa Mulungu wakwe. <verse eid="LEV 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 21:22" />Muntu' mwenu'yo akowolile ku'lya ki'liwa ki'sondo chamwa Mulungu wakwe, na i'cho ki'li' ki'sondo muno, <verse eid="LEV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 21:23" />ali'vi ku'nguno ya wu'lema wakwe, ku'du' ize egele bi'hi' na muki'ngo gwa mugati' ninga ku'lyegela ihozezyo. Ku'du' ize ahav'ezezye zoma hantu' hasondo ha wanne. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, wa ku'v'asondohya v'ahozya.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 21:24" />Hohene Mose wav'awi'laga gose Aloni na v'aane, haki'mo na V'aizilaeli v'ose.<verse eid="LEV 21:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LEV 22" />
  <para style="s">Milagi' ku'nguno ya kalu'mbi'lo kasondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 22:1" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, <verse eid="LEV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 22:2" />“U'muwi'le Aloni na v'ana v'akwe v'a ki'gosya v'av'e na lu'doono ku' kalu'mbi'lo kasondo ako V'aizilaeli v'ali'nsondohezya, ki'gele ku'du' v'ali'yagazye lina lyanne isondo. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="LEV 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 22:3" />“U'v'awi'le ati', ‘Ku' wu'v'yalwa winywe haki'mo na wu'v'yalwa u'wo wu'lalonde ku' wav'o, u'yo alegele ha kalu'mbi'lo kasondo ako V'aizilaeli v'ali'nsondohezya, ene Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku'no ali' na zoma, muntu' mwenu'yo alakomwe aleke ku'v'a ha mbele yanne. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="LEV 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 22:4" />“ ‘U'lu' muntu' wa wu'v'yalwa wamwa Aloni ali' na wu'lwile wa ndi'li' ninga ali'fumya wu'fila, ku'du' ize alye ki'ntu' mugati' na visondo mpaka aho alav'e wasosoka. Hangi' muntu' u'yo alaki'kuumye ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo i'cho ki'li' na zoma ya ku'kuumya mulambo, ninga muntu' u'yo zilamufume mbiyu' zyakwe, <verse eid="LEV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 22:5" />ninga u'yo alakuumye ki'tundwa ki'do ki'do cha ku'muv'ezya av'e na zoma, ninga muntu' wa ku'muv'ezya av'e na zoma ku' zoma ninga yi'mo i'yo ali' nayo, <verse eid="LEV 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 22:6" />muntu' mwenu'yo u'yo alakuumye ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo cha mukoli gwenu'go, alav'e na zoma mpaka mpi'ndi'. Ku'du' ize alye ki'ntu' ki'sondo mpaka aho alav'e woga mu minzi'. <verse eid="LEV 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 22:7" />Lyu'v'a aho li'lav'e lyaloka alav'e wasosoka. Haho akowolile ku'lya kalu'mbi'lo kasondo, ku'nguno ki'li' ki'liwa chakwe. <verse eid="LEV 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 22:8" />Muhozya ku'du' ize alye nyama ya wifwi'le yeni'ki'li' ninga i'yo yi'tandagu'lilwe na ndimu ya mu ipolu. Alav'e witu'u'li'la zoma ku' lyeni'lo. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="LEV 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 22:9" />“ ‘Yi'li'v'adima v'ahozya ku'zidoonoka nhama zyanne ki'gele ku'du' v'av'e na musango, na ku'du' v'afwe ku'nguno ya ku'ziv'engelezya. Ene ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu wa ku'v'asondohya.<verse eid="LEV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 22:10" />“ ‘Muntu' u'yo akav'ile wa igongo lya muhozya akazumi'ziwa ku'lya ki'liwa ki'sondo. Av'e mutu'mami ninga mugeni wa muhozya akazumi'ziwa ku'lya. <verse eid="LEV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 22:11" />Ali'vi u'lu' muhozya wamugu'la musese ku' hela zyakwe ninga musese av'yali'lwe mu lu'go lwa muhozya mwenu'yo, musese mwenu'yo akowolile ku'lya ki'liwa cha muhozya. <verse eid="LEV 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 22:12" />U'lu' mwaniki', mwana wamwa muhozya, atoolilwe na muntu' u'yo akav'ile muhozya, mwenu'yo akazumi'ziwa ku'lya ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo cha kalu'mbi'lo kasondo. <verse eid="LEV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 22:13" />Ali'vi u'lu' mwaniki', mwana wamwa muhozya, wafwi'lilwe na mugosi ninga walekilwe na mugosi, na ali' wu'du'hu' v'ana, na wasu'v'ile ku'mwa ise u'ko wikalage aho ndi' akaali' muhala, mwaniki' mwenu'yo ali'zumi'ziwa ku'lya cheni'cho ki'liwa chamwa ise. Ali'vi muntu' u'yo akav'ile wa igongo lya muhozya akazumi'ziwa ku'lya ki'liwa cheni'cho.<verse eid="LEV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 22:14" />“ ‘U'lu' muntu' yu'ngi' ize alye ki'liwa ki'sondo ku' ku'leka ku'manya, yi'lamudime ku'fumya masumule na kongezya lwandi' lwa wu'tano lwa mupango gwa ki'liwa cheni'cho, nawe alamupe muhozya. <verse eid="LEV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 22:15" />V'ahozya ku'du' v'ize v'aki'tu'u'li'le zoma ki'liwa ki'sondo i'cho V'aizilaeli v'amufumi'zizye Gu'ku' Mulungu, <verse eid="LEV 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 22:16" />ku' ku'v'azumi'zya ku'lya ki'liwa chav'o ki'sondo na ku'v'alengela wu'kenagu'zi na musango. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu wa ku'v'asondohya v'ahozya.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vitaambo i'vyo vizumiv'ilwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 22:17" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, <verse eid="LEV 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 22:18" />“U'v'awi'le Aloni na v'ana v'akwe v'a ki'gosya, na V'aizilaeli v'ose, ati', ‘U'lu' yu'mo mugati' na inywe, Muizilaeli ninga mugeni mwizi'li'zi u'yo ikalile mu nsi' ya Izilaeli, afumye ki'taambo cha ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, yi'v'e ku' ki'lu'mbo ninga kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'togwa, <verse eid="LEV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 22:19" />alafumye ndimu ngosya i'yo yi'li' wu'du'hu' wu'lema, yi'v'e ng'ombe, mbu'li, ninga nkolo, ki'gele ki'zumiwe ku'nguno yakwe. <verse eid="LEV 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 22:20" />Ali'vi ndimu i'yo yi'li' na wu'lema ku'du' ize afumye, ku'nguno yi'kasye yi'zumiwe ku'nguno yakwe. <verse eid="LEV 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 22:21" />Muntu' u'yo alamufumi'zye Gu'ku' Mulungu ki'taambo cha kwiswanania cha ng'ombe, nkolo ninga mbu'li, ki'gele ku'gelani'zya ki'lu'mbo ninga kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'togwa, yi'lamudime ku'leta i'yo yi'li' wu'du'hu' wu'lema ki'gele yi'zumiwe. <verse eid="LEV 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 22:22" />Ku'du' u'mufumi'zye Gu'ku' Mulungu ndimu i'yo yi'hofulile, ninga ya ki'tewe, i'yo yi'vuni'kile ki'v'alango, i'yo yi'li' na wu'landi, ninga wu'kuukulu, ninga malonda ago gali'fumya wu'fila. Ndimu ya vyeni'vyo ku'du' u'yi'fumye ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ha ihozezyo lyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 22:23" />Ali'vi u'kowolile ku'fumya ng'ombe ninga nkolo i'yo yi'li' na ki'v'alango ki'lihu ninga ki'guhi' ku'ki'la vingi' ku'v'a ki'taambo cha ku'togwa, ali'vi ku' ki'taambo cha ki'lu'mbo yi'kasye yi'zumiwe. <verse eid="LEV 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 22:24" />Ku'du' wize u'mufumi'zye Gu'ku' Mulungu ndimu i'yo yi'bov'elile mpese zyayo zya ki'gosya, ziv'e zitunilwe, ziv'elekile ninga ziputilwe. Ku'du' wize u'v'ezye vyeni'vyo mu nsi' yinywe. <verse eid="LEV 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 22:25" />Ku'du' wize u'zumye ku'sola ndimu zya vyeni'vyo ku'fuma ku' mugeni na ku'mufumi'zya Mulungu wako kalu'mbi'lo ka viliwa. Ndimu ki'ti' zyeni'zyo zikasye zizumiwe ku'nguno yako, ku'nguno zili' na wu'lema.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 22:26" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, <verse eid="LEV 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 22:27" />“Itungo lya ku'wu'twa ng'ombe, nkolo ninga mbu'li, yi'lasigale na nnina ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati'. Ali'vi kwandi'zya lu'siku' lwa munane na kwendeleya yi'zumiv'ilwe ku'fumiwa ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 22:28" />Hangi' ku'du' u'yi'si'nze ng'ombe na ndama yakwe ninga nkolo na kadi'lana kakwe ku' lu'siku' lu'mo.<verse eid="LEV 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 22:29" />“Aho u'lav'e u'li'nfumi'zya ene Gu'ku' Mulungu ki'taambo cha ku'lu'mba, u'lanfumi'zye ku' nzi'la ya ku'v'ezya u'zumiwe. <verse eid="LEV 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 22:30" />Ndimu yeni'yo yi'laliwe lu'siku' lwene lu'lo. Ku'du' wize u'sigazye ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo mpaka wangalu'ke ndiyu'. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="LEV 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 22:31" />“Yi'li'mudima ku'zidima nhama zyanne na ku'zilonda. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 22:32" />Ku'du' muli'yagazye lina lyanne isondo. Ndasondohiwe ene mugati' na v'antu' v'a Izilaeli. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu wa ku'musondohya. <verse eid="LEV 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 22:33" />Ene hu' namufumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili ki'gele mbe Mulungu winywe. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.”<verse eid="LEV 22:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LEV 23" />
  <para style="s">Milagi' ku'nguno ya myanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 23:1" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, <verse eid="LEV 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 23:2" />“U'v'awi'le V'aizilaeli ati', ‘I'zi hu' nsiku' zya myanya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, i'zyo mulazitangazye ku'v'a nkuti'la nsondo. I'zi hu' zyene natu'u'lile.<verse eid="LEV 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho u'lo lu'li' Sabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 23:3" />“ ‘Ku'lav'e na nsiku' mukaga zya ku'tu'mama mili'mo, ali'vi lu'siku' lwa mupungati' lu'li' lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho na nkuti'la nsondo. Ku'du' mwize mutu'mame muli'mo ninga gu'mo. Yeni'yo yi'li' Sabato nsondo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu mugati' na wikalo winywe wose.<verse eid="LEV 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Lu'siku' lwa Pasaka na Migate i'zyo Zikatumba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 28:16-25">Lu'v'alo 28:16-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 23:4" />“ ‘I'zi hu' nsiku' zya myanya zyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu i'zyo mulav'ezye nkuti'la nsondo, i'zyo mulatangazye ku' itungo i'lo li'tu'u'lilwe. <verse eid="LEV 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 23:5" />Lu'siku' lwa iku'mi na ine lwa mwezi gwa kwandya, Pasaka yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu yi'lav'e yi'li'lamula mpi'ndi'. <verse eid="LEV 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 23:6" />Lu'siku' lwa iku'mi na itano lwa mwezi gwenu'go gwa kwandya, gu'lav'e gu'li'lamula Mwanya gwa Migate i'zyo Zikatumba ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Yi'li'mudima ku'lya migate zyeni'zyo ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati'. <verse eid="LEV 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 23:7" />Lu'siku' lwa kwandya mulav'ezye nkuti'la nsondo. Lu'siku' lwenu'lo ku'du' mwize mutu'mame mili'mo zya nsiku' zyose. <verse eid="LEV 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 23:8" />Ku' nsiku' zyeni'zyo mupungati' mulamufumi'zye Gu'ku' Mulungu kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya. Lu'siku' lwa mupungati' mulav'ezye hangi' nkuti'la nsondo, na ku'du' mwize mutu'mame mili'mo zya nsiku' zyose.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Kalu'mbi'lo ka ntomolwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 23:9" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, <verse eid="LEV 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 23:10" />“U'v'awi'le V'aizilaeli, ‘Aho mulav'e mwafika mu nsi' i'yo namupile na kwi'mbu'la viliwa vya nsi' yeni'yo, ki'la yu'mo alamuletele muhozya isapali lya ntomolwa ya lyi'mbu'la lya kwandya. <verse eid="LEV 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 23:11" />U'lu' lwav'i'ta lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho, lu'siku' u'lo lu'lalonde nawe alawu'sye isapali lyeni'lo mu igu'lya ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ki'gele li'zumiwe ku'nguno yinywe. <verse eid="LEV 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 23:12" />Lu'siku' lwenu'lo lwa ku'wu'sya isapali, yi'lamudime ku'mufumi'zya Gu'ku' Mulungu ki'taambo cha ku'zigya cha kadi'lana ka nkolo ka mwaka gu'mo, ako kali' wu'du'hu' wu'lema. <verse eid="LEV 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 23:13" />Haki'mo na ki'taambo cheni'cho, mulafumye na kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo, kilo iv'i'li' zya wu'fuma wu'nelezu u'wo wu'seleganiv'ilwe na maguta ga muzeituni, ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya na wu'motu wa ku'mutogezya Gu'ku' Mulungu. Hangi' mulapu'ngu'li'le kalu'mbi'lo ka ki'neneko nsu'pa yi'mo. <verse eid="LEV 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 23:14" />Ku'du' mwize mulye ki'liwa cha mu mugu'nda, ki'v'e ki'toto, cha ku'kalangwa, ninga migate, u'lu' mukaali' ku'fumya kalu'mbi'lo ku'mwa Mulungu winywe. Yeni'yi' yi'ku'v'a nhama ya nhananhana ku' wu'v'yalwa winywe u'wo wu'lalonde, mu wikalo winywe wose.<verse eid="LEV 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Lu'siku' lwa Mwanya gwa Lyi'mbu'la</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 28:26-31">Lu'v'alo 28:26-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 23:15" />“ ‘Ku'fumi'i'la lu'siku' lwa ku'londa ki'suuho, lu'siku' u'lo ndi' mwaleta isapali lya ku'wu'siwa ku'v'a lu'manyi'lo lwa kalu'mbi'lo, mulav'azye mayuma mupungati'. <verse eid="LEV 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 23:16" />Mu lu'siku' lwa ku'londa ki'suuho cha yuma ya mupungati', yaani lu'siku' lwa maku'mi atano, mulafumye kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo mpya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 23:17" />Ki'la mugana mugati' na wikalo winywe, gu'lalete migate iv'i'li' i'zyo ziv'eziv'ilwe ku' wu'fuma wu'nelezu kilo iv'i'li' u'wo wu'li' na itumbyo, viwu'siwe ku'v'a lu'manyi'lo lwa kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo mpya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 23:18" />Haki'mo na migate zyeni'zyo, mulafumye tu'di'lana twa nkolo mupungati' twa mwaka gu'mo u'to tu'li' wu'du'hu' wu'lema, nzagamba na ng'ondi iv'i'li'. Vyeni'vi vilav'e vitaambo vya ku'zigya vya ku'mufumi'zya Mulungu, haki'mo na kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo na ki'neneko, ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya kav'e wu'motu wa ku'mutogezya Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 23:19" />Hangi' mulafumye ngulati' yi'mo ku'v'a ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi, na tu'di'lana tu'v'i'li' twa ng'ondi twa mwaka gu'mo ku'v'a vitaambo vya kwiswanania. <verse eid="LEV 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 23:20" />Nawe muhozya alaviwu'sye haki'mo na i'zyo migate ku'v'a lu'manyi'lo lwa ku'fumya kalu'mbi'lo ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, haki'mo na u'to tu'di'lana tu'v'i'li'. Kali' kalu'mbi'lo kasondo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, navyo vilav'e vya muhozya. <verse eid="LEV 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 23:21" />Lu'siku' lwene lu'lo mulatangazye nkuti'la nsondo. Ku'du' mwize mutumame mili'mo zya nsiku' zyose. Yeni'yi' yi'ku'v'a nhama ya nhananhana ku' wu'v'yalwa winywe u'wo wu'lalonde, mu wikalo winywe wose.<verse eid="LEV 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 23:22" />“ ‘Aho mulav'e muli'wi'mbu'la viliwa mu migu'nda, ku'du' mwize muv'e muli'wi'mbu'la mpaka ku' lu'v'i'mbi', ninga ku'du' mwize musu'v'e ku'salala nsalazyo. Zyeni'zyo mulazilekele ku'nguno ya v'api'na na v'ageni v'izi'li'zi. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Lu'siku' lwa Ku'fuula Milangale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 29:1-6">Lu'v'alo 29:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 23:23" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, <verse eid="LEV 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 23:24" />“U'v'awi'le V'aizilaeli ati', ‘Lu'siku' lwa kwandya lwa mwezi gwa mupungati' lu'lav'e lwa ku'lenda, na nkuti'la nsondo na ku'tangazya mwizu' ku' ku'fuula milangale. <verse eid="LEV 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 23:25" />Ku'du' mwize mutu'mame mili'mo zya nsiku' zyose, sumbwa mulafumye kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Lu'siku' lwa Wu'swanano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 29:7-11">Lu'v'alo 29:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 23:26" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, <verse eid="LEV 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 23:27" />“Lu'siku' lwa iku'mi lwa mwezi gwenu'go gwa mupungati' lu'li' Lu'siku' lwa Wu'swanano. Mulav'e na nkuti'la nsondo, na ku'hangamyoyo, na inywe mulamufumi'zye Gu'ku' Mulungu kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya. <verse eid="LEV 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 23:28" />Lu'siku' lwenu'lo ku'du' mwize mutu'mame muli'mo ninga gu'mo, ku'nguno lu'lav'e Lu'siku' lwa Wu'swanano, ki'gele ku'v'ezya wu'swanano ku'nguno yinywe ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe. <verse eid="LEV 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 23:29" />Muntu' u'yo alaleke ku'hangamoyo lu'siku' lwenu'lo, yi'lamudime akomwe na iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli. <verse eid="LEV 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 23:30" />Muntu' ninga yu'mo u'yo alatu'mame muli'mo ninga gu'mo lu'siku' lwenu'lo ndamuzimangu'zye ku'fuma mugati' na iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli. <verse eid="LEV 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 23:31" />Ku'du' mwize mutu'mame muli'mo ninga gu'mo. Yeni'yi' yi'li' nhama ya nhananhana ku' wu'v'yalwa winywe u'wo wu'lalonde, mu wikalo winywe wose. <verse eid="LEV 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 23:32" />Lu'siku' lwenu'lo lu'lav'e lwa ku'lenda na ku'hangamyoyo. Ku'lamuli'la mpi'ndi' ya lu'siku' lwa kenda lwa mwezi mpaka wangalu'ke mpi'ndi', mulalu'dime lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho chinywe.”<verse eid="LEV 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Lu'siku' lwa Mwanya gwa Mahema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 29:12-40">Lu'v'alo 29:12-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 23:33" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, <verse eid="LEV 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 23:34" />“U'v'awi'le V'aizilaeli ati', ‘Lu'siku' lwa iku'mi na itano lwa mwezi gwenu'go gwa mupungati', lu'lav'e lwa ku'lamula ku'muv'ezezya Gu'ku' Mulungu Mwanya gwa Mahema gwa nsiku' mupungati'. <verse eid="LEV 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 23:35" />Lu'siku' lwa kwandya mulav'ezye nkuti'la nsondo. Ku'du' mwize mutu'mame mili'mo zya nsiku' zyose. <verse eid="LEV 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 23:36" />Ku' nsiku' mupungati' mulamufumi'zye Gu'ku' Mulungu kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya. Lu'siku' lwa munane mulav'ezye nkuti'la nsondo na ku'mufumi'zya Gu'ku' Mulungu kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya. Nkuti'la yeni'yo yi'li' nsondo. Ku'du' mwize mutu'mame mili'mo zya nsiku' zyose.<verse eid="LEV 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 23:37" />“ ‘Zyeni'zyo hu' myanya zyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu i'zyo zitu'u'lilwe i'zyo mulatangazye ku'v'a nkuti'la nsondo zya ku'mufumi'zya Gu'ku' Mulungu kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya, vitaambo vya ku'zigya, kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo na ki'neneko, haki'mo na vitaambo vingi', ki'la kalu'mbi'lo ku' lu'siku' lwako. <verse eid="LEV 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 23:38" />Myanya zyeni'zyo zili' haki'mo na lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho chamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ya nsiku' zyose ya ki'la yuma, hangi' na vipanwa vinywe, na kalu'mbi'lo kinywe ka milahi' zyose, na kalu'mbi'lo kinywe ka ku'togwa, i'vyo muli'nfumi'zyaga ene Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="LEV 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 23:39" />“ ‘Ku'lamuli'la lu'siku' lwa iku'mi na itano lwa mwezi gwa mupungati', aho mulav'e mwamala lyi'mbu'la mu migu'nda zinywe mulamuv'ezezye Gu'ku' Mulungu Mwanya u'go gwa Mahema ku' nsiku' mupungati'. Lu'siku' lwa kwandya na lu'siku' lwa munane zili' nsiku' zya ku'lenda. <verse eid="LEV 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 23:40" />Lu'siku' lwa kwandya mulasole matambi' ga miti' zinywe misoga, yaani matambi' ga mitende, matambi' ga madu'tu' mingi na matambi' ga miti' i'zyo zili'melaga mu ngiligili na myongo, na inywe mulagiye ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe, ku' nsiku' mupungati'. <verse eid="LEV 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 23:41" />Mulav'ezye mwanya gwenu'gu' ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati' ku' ki'la mwaka ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Yeni'yi' yi'li' nhama ya nhananhana ku' wu'v'yalwa winywe u'wo wu'lalonde, na inywe mulav'e muli'v'ezya ku' ki'la mwezi gwa mupungati'. <verse eid="LEV 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 23:42" />Ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati' mulikale mu mahema. V'av'anda v'ose v'a mu Izilaeli v'alikale mu mahema, <verse eid="LEV 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 23:43" />ki'gele wu'v'yalwa winywe wize wu'manye ku'v'a aho ndi' nav'afumya V'aizilaeli ku' nsi' ya Misili ndi' nav'av'ezya v'ikale mu mahema. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 23:44" />Nawe Mose wav'atangazi'zyaga V'aizilaeli myanya zyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu i'vyo zitu'u'lilwe.<verse eid="LEV 23:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LEV 24" />
  <para style="s">Ku'tu'u'la tala ha mbele ya Hantu' Hasondo Muno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 24:1" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, <verse eid="LEV 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 24:2" />“U'v'alagi'li'zye V'aizilaeli v'aku'letele maguta masoso ga muzeituni ago gagongilwe ku'nguno ya mwanga, ki'gele tala ziv'e zili'v'aka nsiku' zyose. <verse eid="LEV 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 24:3" />Aloni alazitu'u'le tala zyeni'zyo ha ibala na muki'ngo u'go gu'li' mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, ki'gele ziv'ake ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ku'fumi'i'la mpi'ndi' mpaka ndiyu' bila ku'zima. Yeni'yi' yi'li' nhama ya nhananhana ku' wu'v'yalwa winywe u'wo wu'lalonde. <verse eid="LEV 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 24:4" />Alazitu'u'le tala zyeni'zyo ha ki'nala cha zahabu nsoso ziv'e zili'v'aka nsiku' zyose ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="LEV 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 24:5" />“U'lasole wu'fuma wu'nelezu na ku'komela migate iku'mi na iv'i'li' ku' ku'tu'mi'la kilo iv'i'li' zya wu'fuma wu'nelezu ku' ki'la mugate. <verse eid="LEV 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 24:6" />Migate zyeni'zyo zilahelwe mihelo iv'i'li', ki'la muhelo migate mukaga. U'lazitu'u'le ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ha igu'lya na meza i'yo yi'v'eziv'ilwe ku' zahabu nsoso. <verse eid="LEV 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 24:7" />Ki'la muhelo u'latu'u'le wu'vumba wu'soso, ki'gele wu'v'e kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ku'nguno ya migate. <verse eid="LEV 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 24:8" />Ki'la lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho, Aloni alazihele migate zyeni'zyo ha mbele yanne, ene Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku'nguno ya V'aizilaeli ku'v'a ilagano lya nhananhana. <verse eid="LEV 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 24:9" />Lwenu'lu' lu'li' lwandi' lwamwa Aloni na v'ana v'akwe v'a ki'gosya. V'alalyi'le migate zyeni'zyo ha hantu' hasondo, ku'nguno lu'li' lwandi' lu'sondo lwa kalu'mbi'lo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Lyeni'lo li'li' ifungu lyav'o lya nhananhana.”<verse eid="LEV 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntyomo na lu'duko lwayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 24:10" />Yav'aga musu'mbana yu'mo u'yo nnina wav'age Muizilaeli na ise wav'age Mumisili. Musu'mbana mwenu'yu' wayaga ha nkambi' ya V'aizilaeli. Lyawu'kaga isola mu nkambi' mugati' na Muizilaeli na musu'mbana mwenu'yo. <verse eid="LEV 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 24:11" />Hangi' musu'mbana mwenu'yo, u'yo nnina witanagwe Shelomiti, mwaniki' mwana wamwa Dibili wa igongo lya Dani, wali'tyomokelaga lina lyamwa Mulungu na ku'li'fusa. Haho v'antu' v'amufilaga ku'mwa Mose. <verse eid="LEV 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 24:12" />Nav'o v'amulugali'laga na ku'lindi'la i'vi Gu'ku' Mulungu alayombe.<verse eid="LEV 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 24:13" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, <verse eid="LEV 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 24:14" />“Mufumye mwenu'yo mutyomoki ha ibala na nkambi', na v'ose av'o v'amwigilwe ali'tyomoka v'atu'u'le makono gav'o ha igu'lya na mutwe gwakwe, hangi' iv'ilingano lyose v'amuwu'lage ku' ku'mugu'ma na mawe. <verse eid="LEV 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 24:15" />U'v'awi'le V'aizilaeli ati', ‘U'lu' muntu' ninga yu'mo amutyomokele Mulungu wakwe, yi'lamudime awu'sombe wu'kenagu'zi wakwe. <verse eid="LEV 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 24:16" />Ki'la muntu' u'yo alali'tyomokele lina lyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu yi'lamudime awu'lagwe. Iv'ilingano lyose li'lamuwu'lage ku' ku'mugu'ma na mawe, av'e mugeni mwizi'li'zi ninga muv'anda. <verse eid="LEV 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 24:17" />Muntu' u'yo alamuwu'lage muntu' mwiye yi'lamudime nawe ku'wu'lagwa. <verse eid="LEV 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 24:18" />Muntu' u'yo alawu'lage mutugo gwa muntu' mwiye yi'lamudime ali'pi'ki'ziwe, wu'panga ku' wu'panga. <verse eid="LEV 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 24:19" />Muntu' u'yo alamuvulazye muntu' mwiye, nawe alali'pi'ki'ziwe vyene vivyo ki'ti' i'vyo wamuvulazyaga mwiye, <verse eid="LEV 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 24:20" />iguha ku' iguha, linso ku' linso, lino ku' lino. Ki'la muntu' u'yo alamuvulazye mwiye nawe alali'pi'ki'ziwe vyene vivyo. <verse eid="LEV 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 24:21" />Muntu' u'yo alawu'lage mutugo gwa mwiye alafumye ndi'pi, sumbwa u'yo alawu'lage muntu' nawe yi'lamudime ku'wu'lagwa. <verse eid="LEV 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 24:22" />Nzi'la yeni'yi' yi'li' ya v'ose, av'e mugeni mwizi'li'zi ninga muv'anda. Ene ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe.’ ” <verse eid="LEV 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 24:23" />Hohene Mose wav'awi'laga V'aizilaeli gose genago. Nav'o v'amufumyaga ha ibala na nkambi' mutyomoki mwenu'yo na ku'muwu'laga ku' ku'mugu'ma na mawe. V'aizilaeli v'av'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye Mose.<verse eid="LEV 24:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="LEV 25" />
  <para style="s">Mwaka gwa lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho u'lo hu' Sabato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 15:1-11">Mwizu' 15:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 25:1" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ku' lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai, <verse eid="LEV 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 25:2" />“U'v'awi'le V'aizilaeli ati', ‘Aho mulav'e mwafika ku' nsi' i'yo nu'mupa inywe, mulalu'ki'ndi'ke lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho ku'nguno ya nsi' ku' ku'muku'zya Gu'ku' Mulungu, ki'gele yi'suuhe ki'la mwaka gwa mupungati'. <verse eid="LEV 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 25:3" />Myaka mukaga mulahambe migu'nda zinywe, na mulasonzole mizabibu zinywe na ku'yav'a visumo vyazyo. <verse eid="LEV 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 25:4" />Ali'vi mwaka gwa mupungati' gu'lav'e gwa ki'suuho cha ku'suuhya nsi', yi'li' Sabato ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Ku'du' mwize muhambe mbiyu' mu migu'nda zinywe ninga ku'sonzola matambi' ga mizabibu zinywe. <verse eid="LEV 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 25:5" />Ku'du' mwize mwi'mbu'le magwa ninga ku'gu'lu'la mizabibu i'zyo mukasonzolile. Gwenu'go gu'li' mwaka gwa ku'keeleka migu'nda. <verse eid="LEV 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 25:6" />Ali'vi muli'zumi'ziwa ku'yav'a viliwa vya mwaka gwa ki'suuho ku'nguno ya ku'tu'mi'la inywe v'eni'ki'li', v'akumba v'inywe v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma, v'asyala na v'ageni v'izi'li'zi av'o v'ikalile na inywe. <verse eid="LEV 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 25:7" />Hangi' nsi' yi'lalisye mitugo zinywe na ndimu zya mu ipolu i'zyo zili' mu nsi' yinywe.<verse eid="LEV 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwanya gwa Mwaka gwa Wiyagalu'le</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 25:8" />“ ‘Mulav'azye myaka mupungati' kali' mupungati' ki'gele visuuho mupungati' viv'e vya myaka maku'mi ane na kenda. <verse eid="LEV 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 25:9" />Aho zilav'e zyav'i'ta myaka zyeni'zyo, ku' lu'siku' lwa iku'mi lwa mwezi gwa mupungati', haho mulafuule milangale ku' ki'la lwandi'. Mugati' na Lu'siku' lwa Wu'swanano, mulafuule milangale mu nsi' yinywe yose. <verse eid="LEV 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 25:10" />Mwaka gwa maku'mi atano mulagu'sondohye na ku'tangazya wiyagalu'le mugati' na nsi' ku' v'antu' v'ose. Ki'la yu'mo u'yo ndi' wagu'zya mugu'nda gwa isaalo lyakwe alagu'su'v'i'le, na ki'la yu'mo u'yo ndi' wigu'zya ku'v'a musese alasu'v'e ku' igongo lyakwe. <verse eid="LEV 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 25:11" />Mwaka gwenu'go gu'lav'e gwa Mwanya gwa Wiyagalu'le. Ku'du' mwize muhambe ninga kwi'mbu'la magwa, ninga ku'gu'lu'la mizabibu i'zyo mukasonzolile. <verse eid="LEV 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 25:12" />Ku'nguno gu'lav'e mwaka gwa mwanya na musondo ku' winywe. Mulalye viliwa vya magwa mu migu'nda.<verse eid="LEV 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 25:13" />“ ‘Ku' mwaka gwenu'go ki'la yu'mo alali'su'v'i'le isaalo lyakwe. <verse eid="LEV 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 25:14" />Hangi' u'lu' u'li'gu'la ku' mwiyo mugu'nda, ninga ku'mugu'zi'zya mwiyo, ku'du' mwize mwikope inywe v'eni'ki'li'. <verse eid="LEV 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 25:15" />U'lagu'gu'le mugu'nda ku' muntu' mwiyo ku' ku'v'azya myaka zya ku'fumi'i'la ku' Mwanya gwa Wiyagalu'le u'go gwav'i'tile. Yaani alagu'gu'zye ku' wako ku'londana na lu'v'alo lwa myaka zya lyi'mbu'la i'zyo zilav'e zyasigalile ku'fika ku' Mwanya gwa Wiyagalu'le gwa ku' mbele. <verse eid="LEV 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 25:16" />U'lu' myaka ziv'e mingi u'longezye mupango, na u'lu' myaka ziv'e midoo u'lapu'ngu'zye mupango, ku'nguno i'cho alaku'gu'zi'zye nhana ki'lav'e lu'v'alo lwa myaka zya lyi'mbu'la. <verse eid="LEV 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 25:17" />Ku'du' mwize mwikope, sumbwa mumogohe Mulungu winywe. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe.<verse eid="LEV 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 25:18" />“ ‘Muzidime nhama zyanne, na ku'zilonda nzi'la zyanne, ki'gele mwikale na ku'hola mu nsi'. <verse eid="LEV 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 25:19" />Nayo nsi' yi'lafumye viliwa vyayo, na inywe mulalye na kwiku'ta, na mulikale mwenu'mo na ku'hola. <verse eid="LEV 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 25:20" />Mukowolile kwiwu'zya, “Ku'lalye ki' ha mwaka gwa mupungati' u'lu' ku'kahambile ninga kwi'mbu'la viliwa viswe?” <verse eid="LEV 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 25:21" />Hohene, ene ndadosye lu'v'ango lu'hanya mu nsi' yinywe ku' mwaka gwa mukaga, nayo yi'lamufumi'zye viliwa vya ku'gelani'la myaka idatu'. <verse eid="LEV 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 25:22" />Mugati' na mwaka gwa munane mulahambe mbiyu' ku'no muli'lya viliwa vya kale na mulendeleye ku'lya du' mpaka mwaka gwa kenda aho mulalamule hangi' kwi'mbu'la.<verse eid="LEV 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ki'ti'le cha ku'komola mugu'nda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 25:23" />“ ‘Nsi' ku'du' yize yi'gu'ziwe wu'li'ko wu'li'ko, ku'nguno nsi' yi'li' yanne, na inywe muli' v'ageni na v'av'i'tayi'la mu nsi' yanne. <verse eid="LEV 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 25:24" />Mugati' na nsi' yinywe i'yo yi'lav'e mu makono ginywe mulav'e na ki'ti'le cha ku'zumya ku'komola migu'nda.<verse eid="LEV 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 25:25" />“ ‘U'lu' mwiyo api'nahe, na agu'zye lwandi' lwa mugu'nda gwakwe, hohene mudu'gu'ye wa bi'hi' alahakomole aho wagu'zizye mudu'gu'ye. <verse eid="LEV 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 25:26" />U'lu' muntu' mwenu'yo ali' wu'du'hu' mudu'gu' wa bi'hi' wa ku'gu'komola, ali'vi apandi'ke nsawo ya ku'kowola ku'gu'komola mugu'nda gwakwe, <verse eid="LEV 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 25:27" />hohene, alav'azye myaka ku'fumi'i'la aho ndi' wagu'zya na ku'li'pa mupango gwago, nawe akowolile ku'li'su'v'i'la isaalo lyakwe. <verse eid="LEV 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 25:28" />Ali'vi u'lu' aleke ku'pandi'ka nsawo ya ku'gu'komola, hohene gu'lasigale mu makono ga u'yo wa ku'gu'la mpaka mwaka gwa Mwanya gwa Wiyagalu'le. Ku' mwaka gwenu'go mugu'nda gu'laleku'li'lwe, nawe akowolile ku'li'su'v'i'la isaalo lyakwe.<verse eid="LEV 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 25:29" />“ ‘U'lu' muntu' agu'zye nnumba i'yo yi'li' mugati' na kaya ya ngomwa, akowolile ku'yi'komola mugati' na mwaka gu'mo. Ku' mwaka gwenu'go gu'mo ali' na lole ya ku'yi'komola. <verse eid="LEV 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 25:30" />U'lu' nnumba yeni'yo ya mu ngomwa akayi'komolile musav'a ku' itungo lya mwaka gu'mo, hohene yi'lav'e nsawo ya wu'li'ko wu'li'ko ku' wa ku'gu'la na ku' wu'v'yalwa wakwe wose. Yi'kasye yi'su'v'iwe ku' mwaka gwenu'go gwa Mwanya gwa Wiyagalu'le. <verse eid="LEV 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 25:31" />Ali'vi nnumba zya mu magu'ngu'li i'zyo zikav'ile mu ngomwa zilav'aziwe ki'ti' migu'nda. Nnumba zyeni'zyo zikowolile ku'komolwa, nazyo zilasu'v'iwe ku' mwaka gwa Mwanya gwa Wiyagalu'le. <verse eid="LEV 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 25:32" />Ninga vyeni'vyo, V'alawi v'ali'zumi'ziwa ku'zikomola nnumba zyav'o i'zyo zili' mu kaya zyav'o ku' matungo gose. <verse eid="LEV 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 25:33" />U'lu' yu'mo mugati' na V'alawi akav'ile ku'yi'tu'mi'la lole yakwe ya ku'yi'komola, hohene nnumba i'yo yagu'ziwa yi'lasu'v'iwe ku' musav'a ku' mwaka gwa Mwanya gwa Wiyagalu'le, ku'nguno nnumba zya mu kaya zya V'alawi v'apiv'ilwe ku'v'a isaalo lyav'o ku'fuma ku' V'aizilaeli. <verse eid="LEV 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 25:34" />Ali'vi migu'nda zya ku'di'mi'zya zya kaya zya V'alawi, ku'du' zigu'ziwe, ku'nguno yi'li' nsawo yav'o ya wu'leka.<verse eid="LEV 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ku'v'agunana v'api'na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 25:35" />“ ‘U'lu' mwiyo api'nahe mpaka apotwe kwisu'nga na ali' haki'mo nanho, yi'li'ku'dima u'musu'nge na ku'mugwasya ki'ti' mugeni ninga muv'i'tayi'la. <verse eid="LEV 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 25:36" />Ku'du' u'sole wu'su'lu' ku' wakwe, sumbwa u'mogohe Mulungu wako, ki'gele mwiyo endeleye kwikala haki'mo nanho. <verse eid="LEV 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 25:37" />Ku'du' u'mukopisye hela ninga ku'mupa ki'liwa ki'gele u'pandi'ke wu'su'lu'. <verse eid="LEV 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 25:38" />Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wako, u'yo naku'fumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili ki'gele nku'pe nsi' ya Kanaani, nanne mbe Mulungu wako.<verse eid="LEV 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 25:39" />“ ‘U'lu' mwiyo api'nahe, nawe ize kwigu'zya ku' wako, ku'du' wize u'mutu'mamye ki'ti' musese. <verse eid="LEV 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 25:40" />Alikale nanho ki'ti' mutu'mami wa wu'tenensya ninga ki'ti' mugeni mwizi'li'zi. Alaku'tu'mami'le mpaka mwaka gwa Mwanya gwa Wiyagalu'le gwa myaka maku'mi atano. <verse eid="LEV 25:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 25:41" />Haho u'lamuleku'li'le iyagalu'le mweni'ki'li' na v'ana v'akwe, nawe alasu'v'e ku' v'antu' v'a igongo lyakwe na ku' nsawo ya v'agu'ku'ye. <verse eid="LEV 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 25:42" />Ku'nguno V'aizilaeli v'ali' v'akumba v'anne av'o nav'afumizye ku' Misili. Ku'du' v'agu'ziwe ki'ti' v'asese. <verse eid="LEV 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 25:43" />Ku'du' u'muteme mwiyo ku' wu'kandi, sumbwa u'mogohe Mulungu wako. <verse eid="LEV 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 25:44" />V'asese v'ako v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma u'lav'agu'le ku'fuma ku' nsi' zya bi'hi' i'zyo ziku'pilimile. <verse eid="LEV 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 25:45" />Hangi' u'kowolile ku'v'agu'la ku'fuma ku' v'ageni v'izi'li'zi av'o v'ikalile haki'mo nanho, na v'a magongo gav'o av'o v'av'yali'lilwe mu nsi' yinywe, nav'o v'alav'e nsawo yako. <verse eid="LEV 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 25:46" />V'enav'o u'kowolile ku'v'asaali'kya ku' v'ana v'ako ku'v'a nsawo yav'o ya wu'leka, na u'kowolile ku'v'av'ezya v'asese, ali'vi v'adu'gu'yo V'aizilaeli ku'du' u'v'ateme ku' wu'kandi.<verse eid="LEV 25:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 25:47" />“ ‘U'lu' mugeni mwizi'li'zi ninga muv'i'tayi'la u'yo ikalile haki'mo nanho adamalu'ke, na mwiyo api'nahe na kwigu'zya ku' mwenu'yo mugeni mwizi'li'zi ninga ku' muv'i'tayi'la, ninga ku' yu'mo mugati' na igongo lyav'o, <verse eid="LEV 25:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 25:48" />aho alav'e wigu'zya akowolile ku'komolwa. Yu'mo mugati' na v'adu'gu'ye akowolile ku'mukomola. <verse eid="LEV 25:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 25:49" />Ise muhanya ninga mudo, ninga mwana lya mwenu'yo ise, ninga mudu'gu'ye yu'ngi' wa igongo lya bi'hi' akowolile ku'mukomola. Akowolile kwikomola mweni'ki'li' u'lu' apandi'ke nsawo. <verse eid="LEV 25:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 25:50" />Mweni'ki'li' na wa ku'mugu'la, v'alav'azye myaka ku'lamuli'la aho ndi' wigu'zya mpaka mwaka gwa Mwanya gwa Wiyagalu'le. Lu'v'alo lwa ku'leku'li'lwa kwakwe lu'lagelani'le na myaka i'zyo watu'mami'la aho wav'age mukumba. Itungo lyeni'lo li'lav'aziwe ki'ti' itungo lya mutu'mami wa wu'tenensya. <verse eid="LEV 25:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 25:51" />U'lu' ziv'e zikaali' myaka mingi, yi'lamudime ku'li'pa lu'v'alo lu'hanya ku' ku'komolwa kwakwe, ku'londana na hela i'zyo ndi' wagu'li'lwa. <verse eid="LEV 25:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 25:52" />U'lu' ziv'e zyakasigala myaka midoo ku'fiki'la mwaka gwa Mwanya gwa Wiyagalu'le, alafumye lu'v'alo lwa ku'gelani'la ku' ku'komolwa kwakwe. <verse eid="LEV 25:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 25:53" />Itungo lyose i'lo alav'e ku'mwa gu'ku' wakwe, alatu'mame ki'ti' mutu'mami wa wu'tenensya. Mwenu'yo wa ku'mugu'la ku'du' ize amuteme ku' wu'kandi ha mbele ya minso ginywe. <verse eid="LEV 25:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 25:54" />Ninga u'lu' akakomolilwe mugati' na nzi'la zyeni'zi, mweni'ki'li' na v'ana v'akwe v'alaleku'li'lwe v'iyagalu'le ku' mwaka gwa Mwanya gwa Wiyagalu'le gwa myaka maku'mi atano. <verse eid="LEV 25:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 25:55" />Ku'nguno V'aizilaeli v'ali' v'akumba v'anne av'o nav'afumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe.<verse eid="LEV 25:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="LEV 26" />
  <para style="s">Lu'v'ango ku'nguno ya lu'doono</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 7:12-24">Mwizu' 7:12-24</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:1-14">28:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 26:1" />“ ‘Ku'du' mwiv'ezezye ki'mbulimbuli ninga ki'mo, ninga ku'ki'ndi'ka isu'mbano lya ku'pu'nza, ninga nhi'ngi' ya iwe, ninga iwe li'mo lya koola mu nsi' yinywe ki'gele muki'ku'v'i'i'le ninga ki'mo. Ku'nguno ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe. <verse eid="LEV 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 26:2" />Yi'li'mudima muzidime nsiku' zya ki'suuho i'zyo zili' Sabato zyanne na ku'haku'zya hantu' hasondo ha wanne. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="LEV 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 26:3" />“ ‘U'lu' muzidime nhama zyanne ku' lu'doono na ku'londa milagi' zyanne, <verse eid="LEV 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 26:4" />haho ndayi'lete nvula yi'tonye ku' itungo lyayo, ki'gele nsi' yi'fumye viliwa vyayo, na miti' zya mu migu'nda zilapambe visumo vyazyo. <verse eid="LEV 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 26:5" />Hangi' ku'gu'manga mbutoo ku' winywe ku'lendeleye mpaka ha itungo lya kwi'mbu'la nzabibu, na kwi'mbu'la nzabibu ku'lendeleye mpaka ha itungo lya ku'v'i'v'a mbiyu', na inywe mulalye viliwa vinywe na kwiku'ta, na mulikale na ku'hola mu nsi' yinywe.<verse eid="LEV 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 26:6" />“ ‘Ndamupe ku'hola mu nsi', na mulav'e muli'lala bila ku'kangwa na ki'ntu'. Ndazisinie ndimu ndaki mu nsi' na nsi' yinywe yi'kasye yi'v'e na wu'lu'gu'. <verse eid="LEV 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 26:7" />Mulav'apeezye v'anisi v'inywe, na mulav'awu'lage ku' lu'panga. <verse eid="LEV 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 26:8" />V'antu' v'inywe v'atano v'alav'apeezye v'anisi igana, na v'antu' v'inywe igana v'alav'apeezye v'anisi vihu'mbi' iku'mi. V'anisi v'inywe v'alagwe ha mbele yinywe ku' lu'panga.<verse eid="LEV 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 26:9" />“ ‘Ndamudoonoke na ku'muv'ezya muv'e na wu'v'yalwa wingi na kwingi'ha, nanne ndagelani'zye ilagano lyanne ku' winywe. <verse eid="LEV 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 26:10" />Ha itungo lya kwi'mbu'la mulav'e mukaali' muli'lya viliwa vya mwaka u'go gwav'i'tile, na yi'lamudime ku'visinia viliwa vilaala ki'gele mupandi'ke ha ku'tu'u'la viliwa vipya. <verse eid="LEV 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 26:11" />Ndatu'u'le wikalo wanne mugati' na inywe, nanne nkasye mmuleke. <verse eid="LEV 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 26:12" />Nanne ndayu'mbe hagati' yinywe na ku'v'a Mulungu winywe na inywe mulav'e v'antu' v'anne. <verse eid="LEV 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 26:13" />Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe, u'yo namufumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili ki'gele muleke ku'v'a v'asese v'a V'amisili. Ene nayi'v'i'nzile segeya yinywe na ku'muv'ezya muyu'mbe musanukile.<verse eid="LEV 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lu'duko ku'nguno ya ku'gayiwa lu'doono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 26:14" />“ ‘Ali'vi u'lu' muleke ku'ndegeleka na ku'londa nhama zyanne, <verse eid="LEV 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 26:15" />na inywe u'lu' muzikaane milagi' zyanne na ku'zigaya nzi'la zyanne, hangi' muleke ku'gelani'zya nhama zyanne na ku'li'v'i'nza ilagano lyanne, <verse eid="LEV 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 26:16" />haho ndamuv'ezezye igambo i'li': Ndalete wu'kange wu'hanya ha igu'lya yinywe, malwile mahanya, kakenke, homa ya ku'muhofuzya minso ginywe na ku'wu'sinia wu'zuwu'ku winywe hado hado. Mulav'i'v'i'le gele mbiyu' zinywe, ku'nguno v'anisi v'inywe v'alavilye viliwa. <verse eid="LEV 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 26:17" />Ene ndamupe nkonya, na inywe mulagu'mwe na v'anisi v'inywe. Mulatemwe na av'o v'amugayile, na mulapeele ninga yi'v'e hadu'hu' muntu' u'yo amupeezizye.<verse eid="LEV 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 26:18" />“ ‘U'lu' muv'e mukaali' du' ku'ndegeleka, haho ndamupe lu'duko hangi' kali' mupungati' ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi winywe. <verse eid="LEV 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 26:19" />Ndazivunagu'le mpaka zinywe na ku'v'ezya chelela i'cho ki'li' ha igu'lya yinywe ki'v'e ki'lambu ki'ti' chu'ma, na nsi' yi'lambe ki'ti' shaba ku'nguno yi'laleke ku'tonyelwa. <verse eid="LEV 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 26:20" />Mulatu'mi'le nguzu zinywe gele, ku'nguno migu'nda zinywe zikasye zifumye viliwa ninga miti' zya nsi' yinywe zilaleke ku'pamba visumo.<verse eid="LEV 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 26:21" />“ ‘U'lu' mwendeleye ku'nyani'li'zya na ku'kaana ku'ndegeleka, ndamongezezye lu'duko kali' mupungati' ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi winywe. <verse eid="LEV 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 26:22" />Ndatu'me ndimu ndaki ku' winywe, zilamupuli'le v'ana v'inywe, zilazimangu'zye mitugo zinywe, na ku'dohya lu'v'alo lwa v'antu' v'inywe, ninga nzi'la zinywe zilav'e na ki'nyuli.<verse eid="LEV 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 26:23" />“ ‘Ninga ku' lu'duko lwenu'lo, u'lu' muv'e mukaanile ku'ngalu'ki'la na mwendeleye ku'nyani'li'zya, <verse eid="LEV 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 26:24" />hohene ndav'e na wanisi na inywe na ku'mupa lu'duko kali' mupungati' ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi winywe. <verse eid="LEV 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 26:25" />Ndalete wu'lu'gu' ku' winywe, ki'gele ku'li'pi'ki'zya, ku'nguno ya ku'li'v'i'nza ilagano lyanne. Aho mulav'e muli'peelela mu kaya zinywe, ndamuletele malwile madaki mugati' na inywe, na inywe mulatu'u'lwe mu makono ga v'anisi v'inywe. <verse eid="LEV 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 26:26" />Aho ndav'e namusini'zya ndecha ya viliwa, v'aki'ma iku'mi v'alakomele mugate mu liko li'mo du'. V'alamugawu'le ku' ki'pimo. Mulalye, ali'vi mukasye mwiku'te.<verse eid="LEV 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 26:27" />“ ‘Aho galav'e gamupandi'ka gose genago ali'vi mukaane ku'ndegeleka na mwendeleye ku'nyani'li'zya, <verse eid="LEV 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 26:28" />haho ndatu'u'le wanisi na inywe ku' ki'sila channe, ene mweni'ki'li' ndamupe hangi' lu'duko kali' mupungati' ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi winywe. <verse eid="LEV 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 26:29" />Mulalye nyama ya miv'i'li' zya v'ana v'inywe, v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma, ku'nguno ya nzala. <verse eid="LEV 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 26:30" />Ndahazimangu'zye ha lwandi' lwinywe lwa ku' igu'lya ku' ngu'lu' u'ko muli'zisengaga milungu zinywe. Ndabomolange mahozezyo ginywe ga ku'zuki'zi'zya wu'bani. Ndazitagi'le milambo zinywe ha igu'lya na vimbulimbuli vya milungu zinywe i'zyo zili' wu'du'hu' wu'zuwu'ku, nanne ndamugaye muno. <verse eid="LEV 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 26:31" />Ndaziv'ezye kaya zinywe ziv'e mapagala, na ku'hav'ipya ha ki'la lwandi' lwinywe lu'sondo, ninga wu'motu wa kalu'mbi'lo kinywe nkasye nkazumye. <verse eid="LEV 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 26:32" />Nanne ndayi'v'ipye nsi' yi'v'e na ki'nyuli, ki'gele ninga v'anisi vinywe av'o v'alasami'le mwenu'mo v'alakamalwe. <verse eid="LEV 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 26:33" />Ndamusambazye mugati' na makabi'la, nanne ndalete wu'lu'gu' wu'mulondezye. Nsi' yinywe yi'lav'e na ki'nyuli na kaya zinywe zilav'e mapagala. <verse eid="LEV 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 26:34" />Haho nsi' yi'latogeziwe na visuuho vyazyo ha itungo i'lo yi'lav'e na ki'nyuli, na inywe aho mulav'e mugati' na nsi' ya v'anisi v'inywe. Nsi' yi'lasuuhe na kwihalali'la visuuho vyazyo. <verse eid="LEV 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 26:35" />Itungo lyose i'lo nsi' yi'lav'e na ki'nyuli, yi'lasuuhe na kwihalali'la ki'suuho chayo i'cho yav'age yi'kav'ile ku'ki'pandi'ka ku' itungo aho mwav'age mwikalile mwenu'mo.<verse eid="LEV 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 26:36" />“ ‘Mugati' na inywe av'o v'alapu'lu'gu'ke, ndav'atu'u'li'le wov'a mu myoyo zyav'o, mugati' na nsi' zya v'anisi v'av'o, ninga muzwi gwa idu'tu' i'lo li'li'hehemulwa na muyaga li'lav'ezye v'apeele. V'alapeele ki'ti' v'apeelile wu'lu'gu', nav'o v'alagwe ninga i'vi ku'du'hu' u'yo av'apeezizye. <verse eid="LEV 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 26:37" />V'alav'e v'ali'gwa v'ali'wituli'nkania ki'ti' v'apeela wu'lu'gu' ninga i'vi ku'du'hu' u'yo av'apeezizye. Inywe mukasye muv'e na nguzu zya kwi'ma ha mbele ya v'anisi v'inywe. <verse eid="LEV 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 26:38" />Mulafwe mugati' na makabi'la, na nsi' zya v'anisi v'inywe zilamulye. <verse eid="LEV 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 26:39" />Av'o v'alasigale v'alagande ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi wav'o, mugati' na nsi' zya v'anisi v'av'o. V'alagande ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi wav'o na wa v'agu'ku' v'av'o.<verse eid="LEV 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 26:40" />“ ‘Ali'vi u'lu' v'azumye wu'kenagu'zi wav'o na wa v'agu'ku' v'av'o, ku'nguno ya wu'tale u'wo v'ambezezizye ene na i'vyo v'endeleyile ku'nyani'li'zya, <verse eid="LEV 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 26:41" />hene nav'atu'u'li'lile wanisi na ku'v'afila ku' nsi' ya v'anisi v'av'o, yaani u'lu' myoyo zyav'o milambu mbe zitunie, nav'o v'azumye lu'duko lwa wu'kenagu'zi wav'o, <verse eid="LEV 26:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 26:42" />hohene ndalizu'ki'le ilagano lyanne na Abalahamu, Isaka na Yakobo na ku'yizu'ki'la nsi' i'yo nav'alagana. <verse eid="LEV 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 26:43" />Itungo i'lo v'alav'e ha ibala na nsi' yav'o, nayo yi'latogeziwe na ki'suuho, aho yi'lav'e yalekilwe na ki'nyuli, nav'o v'alalu'zumye lu'duko lwa wu'kenagu'zi wav'o, ku'nguno v'azikaanile milagi' zyanne na myoyo zyav'o zyazitalile nhama zyanne. <verse eid="LEV 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 26:44" />Ali'vi ninga haki'mo na genago gose, itungo i'lo v'alav'e mu nsi' ya v'anisi v'av'o, ene nkasye mbakaane, ninga ku'v'agaya mpaka ku'fiki'la ku'v'azimangu'zya na ku'li'v'i'nza ilagano lyanne ku' wav'o. Ku'nguno ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wav'o. <verse eid="LEV 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 26:45" />Ali'vi ku'nguno yav'o ndalizu'ki'le ilagano i'lo nalaganile na v'agu'ku' v'av'o, av'o nav'afumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili ha mbele ya minso ga makabi'la, ki'gele mbe Mulungu wav'o. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.’ ” <verse eid="LEV 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 26:46" />Zyeni'zyo hu' nhama, milagi' na nzi'la i'zyo Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' waki'ndi'ka hagati' yakwe na V'aizilaeli u'ko ku' lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai ku'v'i'ti'la ku'mwa Mose.<verse eid="LEV 26:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="LEV 27" />
  <para style="s">Kalu'mbi'lo ka ki'lu'mbo na ku'komolwa kwako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 27:1" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', <verse eid="LEV 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 27:2" />“U'v'awi'le V'aizilaeli, ‘Muntu' u'lu' atu'u'le ki'lu'mbo cha ku'mufumya muntu' ku' mili'mo zyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, muntu' mwenu'yo akowolile ku'komolwa ku' ku'li'pa lu'v'alo ku'londana na i'vyo yi'li'koov'iwa: <verse eid="LEV 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 27:3" />Mupango gwa ku'mukomola mugosya wa musimo gwa myaka maku'mi av'i'li' mpaka maku'mi mukaga, vilav'e vipande maku'mi atano vya feza ku'londana na vipimo i'vyo vitu'u'lilwe ha hantu' hasondo. <verse eid="LEV 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 27:4" />U'lu' av'e muki'ma mupango gwa ku'mukomola gu'lav'e vipande maku'mi adatu' vya feza. <verse eid="LEV 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 27:5" />U'lu' muntu' mwenu'yo ali' na musimo gwa myaka itano mpaka maku'mi av'i'li' mupango gwakwe gu'lav'e vipande maku'mi av'i'li' vya feza ku' mugosya, na ku' muki'ma vipande iku'mi vya feza. <verse eid="LEV 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 27:6" />U'lu' muntu' mwenu'yo ali' na musimo gwa mwezi gu'mo mpaka myaka itano, mupango gwa ku'mukomola gu'lav'e vipande vitano vya feza ku' mugosya, na ku' muki'ma vipande vidatu' vya feza. <verse eid="LEV 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 27:7" />U'lu' muntu' mwenu'yo ali' na musimo u'go gu'ki'lile myaka maku'mi mukaga, mupango gwakwe gu'lav'e vipande iku'mi na itano vya feza ku' mugosya, na ku' muki'ma vipande iku'mi vya feza. <verse eid="LEV 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 27:8" />Ali'vi muntu' u'lu' ali' mupi'na na akakowola ku'li'pa mupango u'go gu'tu'u'lilwe, hohene muntu' wa ku'fumiwa alafilwe ku' muhozya, nawe muhozya alatu'u'le mupango ku'londana na wu'pi'na wa u'yo wa ku'mufumya.<verse eid="LEV 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 27:9" />“ ‘U'lu' muntu' watu'u'la ki'lu'mbo cha ku'fumya ndimu i'yo yi'zumi'ziv'ilwe ku'v'a ki'taambo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ndimu yeni'yo yi'li' nsondo. <verse eid="LEV 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 27:10" />Muntu' ku'du' ayi'kaav'e ndimu yeni'yo, yi'v'e ku' ndimu nsoga ninga mbi. U'lu' ayi'kaav'e ku' yi'ngi', haho ndimu yeni'yo na i'yo yakaav'iv'agwa zyose iv'i'li' zilav'e nsondo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 27:11" />U'lu' ki'lu'mbo ki'li' cha ndimu ya zoma, i'yo yi'kaaniziv'ilwe ku'mufumi'zya ki'taambo Gu'ku' Mulungu, hohene ndimu yeni'yo yi'laletwe ha mbele ya muhozya, <verse eid="LEV 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 27:12" />nawe muhozya alayangu'le mupango gwa ndimu yeni'yo, ku'londana na wu'soga ninga wu'v'i wayo. Mupango u'go alayangu'le muhozya hu' vyene gu'lav'e. <verse eid="LEV 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 27:13" />U'lu' musav'a ndimu ali'koov'a ku'yi'komola ndimu yeni'yo, yi'lamudime kongezya lwandi' lwa wu'tano lwa mupango gwayo.<verse eid="LEV 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 27:14" />“ ‘Muntu' u'lu' ayi'sondohye nnumba yakwe ku'v'a ki'ntu' ki'sondo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, muhozya alayangu'le mupango gwa nnumba yeni'yo, ku'londana na wu'soga ninga wu'v'i wayo. Mupango u'go alayangu'le muhozya hu' vyene gu'lav'e. <verse eid="LEV 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 27:15" />U'lu' muntu' mwenu'yo u'yo wayi'fumyaga nnumba yeni'yo ali'koov'a ku'yi'komola, yi'lamudime kongezya lwandi' lwa wu'tano lwa mupango gwayo, nayo yi'lav'e nsawo yakwe hangi'.<verse eid="LEV 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 27:16" />“ ‘Hangi' u'lu' muntu' alu'sondohye lwandi' lwa mugu'nda gwakwe, u'go gu'li' isaalo lyakwe, ku'v'a musondo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, hohene mupango gwago gu'lapimwe ku'londana na mbiyu' i'zyo zilav'i'v'we mu mugu'nda gwenu'go. Ku' madebe iku'mi ga mpese zya shayili mupango gwago gu'lav'e vipande maku'mi atano vya feza. <verse eid="LEV 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 27:17" />U'lu' agu'sondohye mugu'nda gwakwe ku'v'a musondo mugati' na mwaka gwa Mwanya gwa Wiyagalu'le gwa myaka maku'mi atano, mupango gwago gu'lav'e gwenegu'go. <verse eid="LEV 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 27:18" />Ali'vi u'lu' gwav'i'ta mwaka gwa Mwanya gwa Wiyagalu'le hu' agu'sondohye mugu'nda gwakwe, hohene muhozya alayangu'le mupango ku'londana na myaka i'zyo zyasigali'lile ku'gu'fiki'i'la mwaka gwa Mwanya gwa Wiyagalu'le gwa myaka maku'mi atano, na mupango gwago gu'lapu'ngu'ziwe. <verse eid="LEV 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 27:19" />U'lu' muntu' mweni'ki'li' u'yo wagu'sondohizye mugu'nda gwakwe nawe akoov'e ku'gu'komola, yi'lamudime kongezya lwandi' lwa wu'tano lwa mupango gwago, na mugu'nda gu'lav'e nsawo yakwe hangi'. <verse eid="LEV 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 27:20" />Ali'vi u'lu' aleke ku'gu'komola ninga u'lu' amugu'zi'zye muntu' yu'ngi', hohene mugu'nda gwenu'go gu'kasye gu'komolwe hangi'. <verse eid="LEV 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 27:21" />Mugu'nda gwenu'go gu'lav'e musondo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu aho gu'lav'e gwaleku'li'lwa mu mwaka gwa Mwanya gwa Wiyagalu'le, ku'v'a musondo nhananhana, nago gu'lav'e nsawo ya muhozya.<verse eid="LEV 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 27:22" />“ ‘U'lu' muntu' agu'sondohye mugu'nda ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu u'go wagu'lile, yaani u'go gu'kav'ile gwa isaalo lyakwe, <verse eid="LEV 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 27:23" />muhozya alayangu'le mupango gwa mugu'nda gwenu'go ku' ku'londana na myaka i'zyo zyasigali'lile ku'fiki'i'la mwaka gwa Mwanya gwa Wiyagalu'le gwa myaka maku'mi atano, na muntu' mwenu'yo yi'lamudime ku'li'pa mupango gwago ku'v'a ki'ntu' ki'sondo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 27:24" />Ali'vi mwaka gwenu'go gwa Mwanya gwa Wiyagalu'le, mugu'nda gwenu'go gu'lasu'v'iwe ku' musav'a u'yo ndi' wagu'gu'zya, u'yo li'li' isaalo lyakwe. <verse eid="LEV 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 27:25" />Ki'la mupango gu'lapimwe ku'londana na vipimo vya hantu' hasondo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ki'ebulania ki'li'yomba gela maku'mi av'i'li' zigelani'lile na shekeli yi'mo.</char></note><verse eid="LEV 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 27:26" />“ ‘Yi'kazumi'ziwa muntu' ku'ki'sondohya ki'v'yalwa cha mbele cha ndimu, ku'nguno ndimu yeni'yo yi'li' yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, yi'v'e ng'ombe ninga nkolo. Yeni'yo yi'li' nsawo yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 27:27" />U'lu' ndimu yi'li' zoma, musav'a ndimu alayi'komole ku'londana na mupango u'go gu'tu'u'lilwe na kongezya lwandi' lwa wu'tano lwa mupango gwayo. U'lu' aleke ku'yi'komola, hohene muhozya alayi'gu'zye ku'londana na mupango u'go gwatu'u'lilwe.<verse eid="LEV 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 27:28" />“ ‘Ali'vi ki'la ki'ntu' i'cho chasondohiwa nhananhana ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, av'e muntu', ninga yi'v'e ndimu, ninga gu'v'e mugu'nda gwa ku'saala, ki'kasye ki'gu'ziwe ninga ku'komolwa. Ki'la ki'ntu' i'cho chasondohiwa nhananhana ki'li' ki'sondo muno ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="LEV 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 27:29" />“ ‘Muntu' u'yo wasondohiwa nhananhana ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ki'gele azimangu'ziwe, akasye akomolwe, sumbwa yi'li'mudima awu'lagwe.<verse eid="LEV 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 27:30" />“ ‘Hangi' lwandi' lwa iku'mi lwa ki'la ki'ntu' ku'fuma ha nsi', viv'e mbutoo ku'fuma ku' migu'nda ninga visumo ku'fuma ku' miti', vyose vili' nsawo yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Lwenu'lo lu'li' lwandi' lu'sondo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 27:31" />U'lu' muntu' ali'koov'a ku'komola ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo cha kalu'mbi'lo kakwe ka lwandi' lwa iku'mi, yi'lamudime ongezye ku'li'pa lwandi' lwa wu'tano lwa mupango gwalo. <verse eid="LEV 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 27:32" />Ku' lwandi' lwa ndimu, ng'ombe, mbu'li ninga nkolo, aho zilav'e zili'v'aziwa ku' mulanga gwa mudi'mi, i'yo yi'lav'e ya iku'mi hu' yene yi'lav'e nsondo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="LEV 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 27:33" />Ndimu ya iku'mi yi'kasye yi'sogolwe ku'nguno ya wu'soga wayo ninga wu'v'i, nayo yi'kasye yi'kaav'iwe na yi'ngi'. U'lu' yize yi'kaav'iwe ku' yi'ngi', hohene ndimu i'yo ya mbele na i'yo yakaav'iv'agwa, zyose zilav'e nsondo. Ndimu yeni'yo yi'kasye yi'komolwe.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 27:34" />Zyeni'zyo hu' nhama i'zyo Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' wamupa Mose ku' lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai av'awi'le V'aizilaeli.<verse eid="LEV 27:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 27" />
</usx>